<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="MAT" style="id">- Sanga Language Project (xns)</book>
  <para style="h">Matiyu</para>
  <para style="toc3">Mat</para>
  <para style="toc2">Mat</para>
  <para style="toc1">Matiyu</para>
  <para style="mt1">Matiyu</para>
  <para style="imt2">Oroka o lebo aa surea</para>
  <para style="imt1">Matiyu</para>
  <para style="imt">Masanto</para>
  <para style="im">Ondooka wa wele angmǝ aa lebo aana waya Matiyu, wai o Yahuda wai, ondo aa nyimi atoma a Yeso.</para>
  <para style="ip">
    <char style="bk">Angmǝ lebo aaka Matiyu wa wele</char> Wa wore ro na Yeso kaya Almasipu kanname, kamea kaya orona o pena otono ooka Ashili aye aromo a ai Otono oo Kozo. Kaya kamea maYahuda ne eke lenyong oo bena kaya deya. Ewela eena e tikǝrǝ ekoro mawo ma Ashili aa nyimi Otono o Kozo adorana a wore nangka Yeso ka panza e. Ewela me ee kang wore obena Yeso karomo ka akora Ibraheng kai. Kangza ka rare Yeso na “Kena ka Daoda”. Obena Yeso ka de aa bengmǝ be Almasipu naname, aa kap nangka maYahuda ne eke lenyong a Ashili. Ewela eena e wore na Yeso ondo baala ogong ooka o baala ka angmǝ a kai ne wore o bena kaye ka o bare maleo o kala o Mosa.</para>
  <para style="ip">Aa nyimi ewela eena, a tareze o baala o Yeso aa madǝkǝni esu nanna: O bora, o zoola azaa oyara, omea wa wore nangka wa gwara aromo Ashili cikǝ (masono 5-7). O Leere kangza, nangka otoma Almasipu yo eza ogole o wai (osono 10). O taaro, angmǝ aa gerpo zene azaa togomo te Ashili (osono 13). O naaze, o baala azaa ombela o cikǝ ondo o tare Ashili yo eza (osono 18). O esu, o baala azaa o maro awere aana kaa o deya togomo te Ashili (masono 24-25). O maare, Matiyu wa wore letoma lee gong ka Yeso ka nya, azaa o zoola azaa orooka oo lebo.</para>
  <para style="iot">Beyo be epa eeka eya nyimi</para>
  <para style="io1">Beting kaa o ngemengha Yeso Kiristi 1:1-2:23</para>
  <para style="io1">Ozoola o Yohana o batisma 3:1-12</para>
  <para style="io1">O batisma ka o kedeya Yeso 3:13-4:11</para>
  <para style="io1">Ogole o Yeso a nyimi makeke ma Galili 4:12-18:35</para>
  <para style="io1">O kurǝ a Galili aa alea Urshalima 19:1-20:34</para>
  <para style="io1">Ogole o Yeso o maare Urshalima 21:1-27:66</para>
  <para style="io1">O gendare o Yeso kaa o gbwǝ o kai 27:32-66</para>
  <para style="io1">O era aa malo gwǝ kaa o wore o kpwai kai 28:1-20</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="MAT 1" />
  <para style="s">Abuudu a Yeso</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 3:23-38">Luk 3:23-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 1:1" />Enna ewela azaa beting be Yeso Kiristi, kena ka Daoda, kena ka Ibraheng.<verse eid="MAT 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 1:2" />Ibraheng ate a Ishaku,</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="MAT 1:2">Ishaku ate a Yakubu, a Yakubu ate a Yahuda kaa arone awai alome.<verse eid="MAT 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 1:3" />Yahuda ate a Perez kaa Zera andaaka iini onea waye Tamar,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="MAT 1:3">Perez ate a Hezron,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="MAT 1:3">a Hezron ate a Aram.<verse eid="MAT 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 1:4" />Aram ate a Aminadab,</para>
  <para style="li3" vid="MAT 1:4">Aminadab ate a Nashon, aa Nashon ate a Salmon.<verse eid="MAT 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 1:5" />Salmon ate a Bowaza ka iini wai waye Rahab.</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="MAT 1:5">Bowaza ate a Obed ka iini wai waye Rut,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="MAT 1:5">Obed ate a Yese,<verse eid="MAT 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 1:6" />a Yese ate a Ogomo Daoda.</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="MAT 1:6">Daoda ate a Suleimanu ka iini wai waye Batsheba, ondaye Uriya o samba.<verse eid="MAT 1:6" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 1:7" />Suleimanu ate a Rehobowam,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="MAT 1:7">Rehobowam ate a Abija, Abija ate a Asa, <verse eid="MAT 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 1:8" />Asa ate a Yehoshapat, Yehoshapat ate a Yehoram,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="MAT 1:8">Yehoram ate a Uziya,<verse eid="MAT 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 1:9" />Uziya ate a Yotam,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="MAT 1:9">Yotam ate a Ahaz,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="MAT 1:9">Ahaz ate a Hezekiya,<verse eid="MAT 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 1:10" />Hezekiya ate a Manase,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="MAT 1:10">Manase ate a Amon, Amon ate a Yosiya,<verse eid="MAT 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 1:11" />aa Yosiya ate a Yekoniya ka arone awai, a were aka a bese maYahuda a ale a lezara a Babila.<verse eid="MAT 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="li4">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 1:12" />Malo besa one a lezara a Babila,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="MAT 1:12">Yekoniya ate a Sheyaltiyel, Sheyaltiyel ate a Zerubabel,<verse eid="MAT 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 1:13" />Zerubabel ate a Abihud,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="MAT 1:13">Abihud ate a Eliyakim, Eliyakim ate a Azor, <verse eid="MAT 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 1:14" />Azor ate a Zadok,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="MAT 1:14">Zadok ate a Akim,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="MAT 1:14">Akim ate a Aliyud,<verse eid="MAT 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 1:15" />Aliyud ate a Eleyazar,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="MAT 1:15">Eleyazar ate a Mattan,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="MAT 1:15">Mattan ate a Yakubu,<verse eid="MAT 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 1:16" />aa Yakubu ate a Yusupu ondaleme Mariya, Mariya kamea ka ngmeng Yeso ka a beya kai na Kiristi.<verse eid="MAT 1:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 1:17" />Obena pate sepeza a era Ibraheng a alea Daoda, sepeza betuurua ka she naaze. O era Daoda a alea awere amea a bese maYahuda a alea lezara a Babila, sepeza betuurua ka she naaze, o era were lezara a Babila kangza a ale o ngmenga Kiristi, sepeza betuurua ka she naaze.<verse eid="MAT 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ongmenga o Yeso Kiristi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 2:1-7">Luk 2:1-7</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 1:18" />Nannaa ongmenga o Yeso Kiristi waze. Awere aka Yusupu waya caasa Mariya kamea ka ngmeng Yeso, zongka wa ana kai, na manaa ka ana etumǝ a surǝ a Obere Ashili. <verse eid="MAT 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 1:19" />Yusupu ondasau kai waye ka boome ba Ashili na wata yeme o kare okai ezǝng a nyimi aromone, nawa eze madoola ma baya kai a suk. <verse eid="MAT 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 1:20" />Nangka waya madoola ma nyimi, na otoma Ashili o dera lepung o Ateokora deya awai atolau. Awa bena, “Yusupu kena ka Daoda, tana okone boome bo ana Mariya ka ka itǝ ondaye one, obena etumǝ ka ka ana, e surea Obere Ashilia. <verse eid="MAT 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 1:21" />Kayo ngmenga kena ka lome, oyo nya kai leze na Yeso, o bena kayo boza aromo aza madinǝ mane.”<verse eid="MAT 1:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 1:22" />A eze pate nyimia adorana angmǝ Ateokora pene ka Ondo beya angmǝ ka mawo ma Ashili Ishaya beke. <verse eid="MAT 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 1:23" />“Laka! Kagala yo ya etumǝ, ka ka ngmeng kena kalome, ka ayo nya kai leze na Emanuwel, o wore obena Ashili ya legwa ka ro.”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 7:14">Ish 7:14</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="MAT 1:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 1:24" />Nangka Yusupu wa ere atolau, nawa tare epaaka otoma Ashili o dera lepung me wa ote wai na waye, aa wa ana Mariya naka itǝ ondaye wai. <verse eid="MAT 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 1:25" />Pate ka nyimi, wata wa more ka kai ne, se malo ngmenga kena ka kai. Nawa nya kena kame leze na Yeso.<verse eid="MAT 1:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="MAT 2" />
  <para style="s">Begere be ana orosa kane surǝa dizi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 2:1" />Malo ngmenga Yeso a Baitalami o makeke ma Yahudiya, awere togomo te Hiridus ogomo Ogong, ana orosa ne surea adizi nane deya a Urushalima ane pirkǝ na, <verse eid="MAT 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 2:2" />“Ondooka a ngmeng, ogomo ma Yahuda ya babaa? Te laka bewerewere be wai a dizi na te deya kate eze kai makili ma Ashili.”<verse eid="MAT 2:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 2:3" />Nangka Ogomo Hiridus wa kone nyimi nawa kone oburǝ ka apate aromo a Urushalima. <verse eid="MAT 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 2:4" />Nawa kurki pate andaamoole magame ma Ashili ka ana obaala angmǝ aka Ashili a nya Mosa, awa pirkǝ ne na, a ruwǝme abena aya ngmenga Kiristi? <verse eid="MAT 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 2:5" />Nane kabare wai na, “Apeng Betalami a makeke ma Yahudiya,” Ane kang bena, “Nyimia ondo obeya angmǝ ka mawo ma Ashili wa wele,<verse eid="MAT 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 2:6" />“‘Bo Betalami o makeke ma Yahudiya</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 2:6">ota baate ne a nyimi makeke ma togomo ma Yahudiya,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 2:6">ka ogomo yo surǝa nyimi au ka waya eza togomo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 2:6">azaa aromo ang maIsrela.’<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MIC 5:2">Mek 5:2</ref>.</char></note>”’<verse eid="MAT 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 2:7" />Na Hiridus rare ana orosa name asuk adorana wa rose awere aka bewerewere beme be suri. <verse eid="MAT 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 2:8" />Nawa tong ne a Betalami na, “Ale na ka esoole kena kame a dede. Eedate ka ecǝ kai, deyana ka ebeleng, adorana mima ang ale kang eze makili ma Ashili a begeshe be kai.”<verse eid="MAT 2:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 2:9" />Malooka ne mara okona angmǝ ogomo, nane lya izi ka teweno tene, a bewerewere beeka be surǝ ane obora kale ane ba izi a ale araaka kena kame zane. <verse eid="MAT 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 2:10" />Nangka ne laka bewerewere beme, nane pene ka okona oleba maleu. <verse eid="MAT 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 2:11" />Ko lyǝ a kwilǝ me ane laka kena kame ka iini kai Mariya, nane girwǝ aa ne eze kai makili ma Ashili. Zaa nyimi nane pǝri majeketa ma emate mane ane nya kai magogoro, mazenare, madangku ma lubban kaa ma omur. <verse eid="MAT 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 2:12" />Aza obena Obere Ashili wa windi ne toto a nyimi tolau na tana ne kuri ara Hiridus ne, nane tare orona yende a kurǝ a makeke mane.<verse eid="MAT 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">O alea wogo a Masar</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 2:13" />Malooka ana orosa me ne ale, otoma Ashili o dera lepung wa suri a Yusupu a tolau. Awa bekaana, “Era o ana kena kame ka iini kai o alea wogo a Masar. Oo cikǝ a saname seena ba kone eyapa mi, aza obena Hiridus ya gera kena kame kawa wong kai.”<verse eid="MAT 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 2:14" />Na Yusupu ere a lelyaare leme, nawa ana kena kame ka iini kai a alea Masar, <verse eid="MAT 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 2:15" />arakanamea ne cikǝ ne a ale ogwǝ o Hiridus. Nyimi apanza angmǝ Ashili ka a beke o ngmǝ otoma ai o lepung na, “Ma rare kena kang ka ka suri a Masar.”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HOS 11:1">Hos 11:1</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="MAT 2:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">O wongha a bana ayana a Masar</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 2:16" />Nangka Hiridus wa laka obena ana orosa ne kala wai a izi, na o nyong caro wai maleu. Nawa ote na a wongze pate ayana a batebate alome ka neya Betalami ka oringǝri o ai, aa deya senai se leere aa jǝpi, a akap nangka ne kone ara ana orosa name. <verse eid="MAT 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 2:17" />Awere namea angmǝ Ashili ka Irimiya beke a pena na,<verse eid="MAT 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 2:18" />“A kona lengmelo a Rama,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 2:18">lengmelo le okona oburǝ ka oruuzi a jǝng,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 2:18">Rahila ya ruuzi azaa ayana kai</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 2:18">aka nyana kona okoo ogwǝ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 2:18">aza obena a wongza ne.”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 31:15">Irim 31:15</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="MAT 2:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">O surǝ a Masar a ale a Nazarat</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 2:19" />Malooka Hiridus wa gbwi, na otoma Ashili o dera lepung deya a Yusupu a nyimi tolau a Masar <verse eid="MAT 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 2:20" />awa bekaana, “Era, ka o ana kena ka iini kai o ale a makeke ma Isrela, andaaka neya yeme o wongnga kena kame ne gbwizǝ.”<verse eid="MAT 2:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 2:21" />Nawa ere, aa wa ana kena kame ka iini kai aa wa ale a makeke ma Isrela. <verse eid="MAT 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 2:22" />Nangka wa kone obena oyana o Hiridus, Arkilayus wa zala togomo a bengmǝ ba ate wai, nawa kone boome bo ale a saname. Azaa obena a windi wai teto a nyimi tolau, nawa dare awa ale a makeke ma Galili, <verse eid="MAT 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 2:23" />Wa ale nawa cikǝ a kapeng ka yende ka a rareze kai na Nazarat. Adorana apanza angmǝ Ashili ka ana obeya a ngmǝ ka mawo ma Ashili ne beke, “Ayo rara kai karomo ka Nazarat.”<verse eid="MAT 2:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="MAT 3" />
  <para style="s">Ozoola o Yohana o batisma</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:1-8">Mar 1:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:1-18">Luk 3:1-18</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 1:19-28">Yoh 1:19-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 3:1" />A nyimi tomore tonname a Yohana o batisma wa suri awa ya zoola a nyimi wake o makeke ma Yahudiya, <verse eid="MAT 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 3:2" />aa wa beyana, “Kurǝ na Ashili, obena togomo te shili te amara<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:2 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">togomo te shili te amara </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Anna wore obena togomo teeka Ashili ya ezaa me azaa aromo. </char></note>.” <verse eid="MAT 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 3:3" />Ondoonaa Ishaya ondo beya angmǝ ka mawo ma Ashili wa beke angmǝ azaa wai na:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 3:3">“Lengmelo ya rara owake ale beya na,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 3:3">‘Babara Ateokora orona,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 3:3">babara na marona ma wai.’ ”<verse eid="MAT 3:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 3:4" />A soo madibi ma Yohana ka sezǝru se orongkoomea, awa tera o tinǝ owai ka lejǝng le ongma. A epaolya wai eya ekangdang ka mato ma esheng. <verse eid="MAT 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 3:5" />Na aromo a Urushalima, kaa a makeke ma Yahudiya a pate, kaa a pate ana makeke ma Obeno Urdung ne deese ara a kai, <verse eid="MAT 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 3:6" />ane beeze madinǝ mane, aa wa ezene obatisma Obeno Urdung.<verse eid="MAT 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 3:7" />Pate ka nyimi nangka Yohana wa laka maParisa ka maSadukiya araaka waya eza aromo obatisma, nawa bekaa ne na, “Ying okurkǝnǝng ewa eburu! Mana wa zoola aying na esong o gǝǝzǝ o Ashili ka waya deya? <verse eid="MAT 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 3:8" />Ezana epaaka eyo ale akap ka ewore obena e kurǝ Ashili aying. <verse eid="MAT 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 3:9" />Kangza tane ole begeshe na, ‘Ibraheng waya ate aro ne.’ Ang bele ying na, Ashili aye ka obare o sǝǝrǝ Ibraheng ayana a nyimi a caleena. <verse eid="MAT 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 3:10" />A samba o eke betemo aa madǝrǝ ma o mati, kangza pate uti ka wata ngmengza ayana a rerene, ayo genda wai ka tare a nyimi ola.<verse eid="MAT 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 3:11" />“Mi ang ezeze ying o batisma ka manyia o wore o kurǝ a Ashili aying. Malo ong ondo ya deya kawa kalang o bare, tekakau te wai ma era anta bare ang monte ne. Wayo eza ying o batisma ka Obere Ashili ka ola. <verse eid="MAT 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 3:12" />Waya onta upkwi owai a taara, aa wa keleke epaolya wai, aa wa kare o eyo me a nyimi lebengga, aa wa ese masuni mame ka ola ka wata lambuzu ne.”<verse eid="MAT 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">A eze Yeso obatisma</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:9-11">Mar 1:9-11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:21-23">Luk 3:21-23</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 3:13" />A were name na Yeso deya ka suri a Galili a ale a Urdung ara Yohana adorana wa eze kai o batisma. <verse eid="MAT 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 3:14" />Na Yohana yeme o nara kai, awa bekaana, “Mi ang gwara obekaana bo oyeng o batisma, eyaaka bo ba deya ara ang?”<verse eid="MAT 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 3:15" />Na Yeso kabare wai na, “Baya wa itǝ nyimi nanname, aza obena nyimi a kala orera ka te panza epa e sangsang eeka Ashili ya yeme me.” Na Yohana kabare, aa wa ye kai o batisma.<verse eid="MAT 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 3:16" />Malo o eza Yeso o batisma, ka osurǝ kai a nyimi manyi naname, a saseya na zaa shili banggalanu, aka laka Obere o Ashili a jǝpi na kagoma, aka jǝpi ukpwei kai. <verse eid="MAT 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 3:17" />Na kone lengmelo a surǝ zaa shili na, “Kannaa kena kang, kamea ang yeme, kamea ang kone oleba kai maleu.”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 22:2">Obo 22:2</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 2:7">Sel 2:7</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 42:1">Ish 42:1</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 12:18">Mat 12:18</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 17:5">17:5</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:11">Mar 1:11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:35">Luk 9:35</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="MAT 3:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="MAT 4" />
  <para style="s">O kedeya Yeso</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:12-13">Mar 1:12-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:1-13">Luk 4:1-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 4:1" />Na Obere Ashili tare kaa Yeso a ale owake ka ogomo o bere o buru kedeya kai. <verse eid="MAT 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 4:2" />Aka meke ongmǝ o tomore tuuru naaze, lelyaare ka letereme, na ekomo meke kai. <verse eid="MAT 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 4:3" />Na ogomo obere o buru deya kai awa bekaana, “Boa baaya Kena ka Ashili, ote lecale leena ka le itǝ oborode.”<verse eid="MAT 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 4:4" />Na Yeso kabare na, “Angmǝ Ashili a bekaana, “Epaolya belle ta ongtaza oromo ne, seena ka koonang angmǝ ka susi ongmǝ Ashili.”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 8:3">Otik 8:3</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="MAT 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 4:5" />Na ogomo o bere oburu, ale ka kai a Urushalima apeng a odera madinǝ, nawa zalara kai araa o kala bezaati a akwilǝ Ashili. <verse eid="MAT 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 4:6" />Na wa bena, “Bo kena ka Ashili kaaza, cangko ka otaru a deze, obena a wele na,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 4:6">‘Wayo ote atoma wai a kazo o,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 4:6">kane woboo ka taara tene</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 4:6">nangka oto jukǝ tobona to ocale ne.”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 91:11-12">Sel 91:11-12</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="MAT 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 4:7" />Na Yeso kabare wai na, “A wele na, ‘Tana okedeya Ateokora Ashili au ne.’ ”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 6:16">Otik 6:16</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="MAT 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 4:8" />Kangza na ogomo obere oburu ale ka kai oyara o zaati awa wore kai pate togomo te lerambo leena ka o gongha te. <verse eid="MAT 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 4:9" />Awa kang bena, “Pate tenna eyang nyau, ba girwǝ a begeshe beng o ezeng makili ma Ashili.”<verse eid="MAT 4:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 4:10" />Na Yeso bekaa wai na, “Era arakaana, Shetan! A wele na, ‘Eza Ashili Ateokora au makili ma ai, kangza aiya belle oyo saba.’ ”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 6:13">Otik 6:13</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="MAT 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 4:11" />Na ogomo obere o buru ale awa baya kai, na atoma Ashili o dera lepung de nane kangkama kai.<verse eid="MAT 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Obora ogole o Yeso aa Galili</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:14-15">Mar 1:14-15</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:14-15">Luk 4:14-15</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 4:12" />Nangka Yeso ka kone obena a meke Yohana na apate akwilǝ andaleme, naka ere naka ale a Galili. <verse eid="MAT 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 4:13" />Ko baya Nazarat, naka ale a Kaparnahum ka ocikǝ, apeng amea aya bengmǝ bo beno, a bekazo be makeke ma Zebulung ka Naptali, <verse eid="MAT 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 4:14" />adorana a panza epaaka ondo obeya angmǝ ka mawo ma Ashili Ishaya wa beke,<verse eid="MAT 4:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 4:15" />“A makeke ma Zebulung ka ma Naptali,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 4:15">orona o alea obeno ogong a alea bekazo be obeno Urdung,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 4:15">a makeke ma Galili araaka a worme acake cikǝ ne,<verse eid="MAT 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 4:16" />aromo kane cikǝ amaring,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 4:16">ne laka masanto ma gong,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 4:16">ana ocikǝ makeke ma o ululu o gbwǝ kangza<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 9:1-2">Ish 9:1-2</ref>.</char></note>,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 4:16">masanto ma tara ane.”<verse eid="MAT 4:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 4:17" />O era were name, na Yeso bore ozoola aka beyaana, “Kurǝ na Ashili aza obena togomo te shili te amara.”<verse eid="MAT 4:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yeso ka rare atoma kai o bora</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:16-20">Mar 1:16-20</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:1-11">Luk 5:1-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 4:18" />Yeso kaya yenga edǝki o beno gong o Galili naname, naka laka arone a leere, Siman ka a rare wai na Biturusu ka orone owai Andarawus. Neya tara majara ma o meese ekwala obeno, obena ogole one o meese ekwala waze. <verse eid="MAT 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 4:19" />Na Yeso bekaane na, “Deyana ka etareng, eyang ote ying ka e itǝ ana o deesa ka aromo a mi.” <verse eid="MAT 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 4:20" />A saseya nane baya majara mane aa ne tare kai.<verse eid="MAT 4:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 4:21" />Ko lya izi a baate, naka laka arone leere kangza, Yakubu kena ka Zabadi, ka orone kai Yohana. Neya nyimi o onggo o manyi ka ate ane Zabadi, aneya babara majara mane ma o meese ekwala. Na Yeso rare ne. <verse eid="MAT 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 4:22" />A saseya nane baya o onggo o manyi mame ka ate ane, aa ne tare kai.<verse eid="MAT 4:22" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeso ka womza ana makono</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 6:17-19">Luk 6:17-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 4:23" />Yeso ka ringgari pate makeke ma Galili, aka baale a nyimi odandaro o gwarzanang maYahuda, aka zoole aa ne aza angmǝ a lebo a togomo te Ashili. Kangza aaka womza pate makono ka odera o kona zake ka aromo ya zitǝ ka mai. <verse eid="MAT 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 4:24" />Na orooka azaa kai ale a kurǝwǝ a nyimi makeke ma Suriya pate. Na aromo casa kai pate andaaka neya kono ka andaaka neya zitǝ ka kombela makono, ka ana o kona o poba a jǝng, andaaka obere o buru wa taba ne, ana letaranggi, andaaka apung ane aa gbwǝ a sara yende, pate naka womza ne. <verse eid="MAT 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 4:25" />Na aromo a cake ne tare kai, kane suri a Galili, ka ana o surǝ a Dekapolis<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:25 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Dekapolis </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Onnaa topepeng betuuru.</char></note>, ka Urushalima, ka makeke ma Yahudiya, a ale cakate obeno Urdung.<verse eid="MAT 4:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="MAT 5" />
  <para style="s">O zoola ka Yeso ka eze azaa oyara</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 5:1" />Nangka Yeso ka laka aromo ane kurkǝnǝng, naka zale oyara aa ka cikǝ a saname. Na atoma kai deya kai, <verse eid="MAT 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 5:2" />aka bore o baala one na.<verse eid="MAT 5:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">O wala o kona oleba</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 5:3" />“Ana okona olebaa aromo aaka ne rose o sawa one a nyimi o tare Ashili,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 5:3">aza o bena togomo te shili taate nea te.<verse eid="MAT 5:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 5:4" />Ana okona oleba ana o caro anyong,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 5:4">ayo nata ne anyong.<verse eid="MAT 5:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 5:5" />Ana okona olebaa ana o nata ukpwei,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 5:5">lerambo leena yo itǝ lalene.<verse eid="MAT 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 5:6" />Ana okona olebaa andaaka neya kona ekomo ka lewe le cikǝ o sangsang,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 5:6">obena neyo tiyǝ.<verse eid="MAT 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 5:7" />Ana okona olebaa andaaka ne kone egonegone,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 5:7">ayo wore ne egonegone.<verse eid="MAT 5:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 5:8" />Ana okona olebaa andaaka neya sangsang a nyimia nyong,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 5:8">obena neyo laka Ashili.<verse eid="MAT 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 5:9" />Ana okona olebaa andaaka ne gere o cikǝ o cammo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 5:9">obena ayo rara ne na ayana Ashili.<verse eid="MAT 5:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 5:10" />Ana okona olebaa andaaka a nyana ne azaa be sangsang bene,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 5:10">obena togomo te shili taa tene te.<verse eid="MAT 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 5:11" />Ana okona olebaa ying awere aka aromo ne eske ying, ane nyalang ka ying ane kang beya kombela rendaza ma buru aza oying, obena ying e tareng. <verse eid="MAT 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 5:12" />Konana oleba e zante ajǝng, o bena bengmǝ bee ying yo gongha aa cak azaa shili, nyimia aromome ne gǝǝzǝ ana obeya angmǝ ka mawo ma Ashili kane kaana ying.”<verse eid="MAT 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">O baala azaa ogalu ka masanto</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 9:50">Mar 9:50</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 14:34-35">Luk 14:34-35</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 5:13" />Yingnga ogalu makeke maana. A ogalu wa arnang ka olento owai, eya ayo ya ka wa kang olento? Wa itǝ wata kang ya ka edang ne, soona a oke wai a itǝzǝ ne.<verse eid="MAT 5:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 5:14" />Yingnga masanto ma lerambo. Apeng aka a sowa ai azaa ka zalo, a era ta baasa ne.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 8:12">Yoh 8:12</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 9:5">9:5</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="MAT 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 5:15" />Nyimi a aromo ne era neta diki beru be masanto aa ne pate be ka oso ne. Seena eke be ara azaati o eese be, nangka beyo nya pate aromo akwilǝ me masanto. <verse eid="MAT 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 5:16" />Nyimi a kangza bayana ee itǝ ana masanto a aromo, adorana nee laka teweno teying te rere ka eya ezame, aa ne sabe Ate aying ooka waya nyimi azaa shili.<verse eid="MAT 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">O baala azaa makili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 5:17" />Tane laka na ma deya kang dinggi makili ma Mosa ka ewela ana obeya angmǝ ka mawo ma Ashili. Anta ma deya kang dinggi ne soona ang panza mai. <verse eid="MAT 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 5:18" />Eyang dongdong bele oying, azaa shili ka makeke maana yo maro, otengke o baate ewela makili ma Mosa wato maro ne, seeka a panza ekeeya apat. <verse eid="MAT 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 5:19" />A zaa nyimi pate ondooka wa cakate o yende o kala a bebaate a nyimi makili ma Ashili maana, aa wa baale ana ondo na neye nyimi, ayo beka ondo me na wa kala be baate a nyimia togomo te o zaa shili. Ondooka wa tare mai kangza aa wa baale ana ondo o tare o mai, ayo rara wai na ondo ogong a togomo te shili. <verse eid="MAT 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 5:20" />Eyang baalo ying eta kala ana obaala angmǝ ka Ashili anya Mosa ka maParisa aa eza epa e sangsang ne, eto lyǝ a togomo te ozaa shili ne.<verse eid="MAT 5:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">O baala azaa lemunggi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 12:57-59">Luk 12:57-59</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 5:21" />“E kone obena a beka aromo ko rabo na, ‘Tano wong ondo ne, pate ondooka wa wongngha ondo, ayo gǝǝzǝ wai.’ <verse eid="MAT 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 5:22" />Mi eyang bele oying, ondooka wa munggi ka arone wai, ayo gǝǝzǝ wai. Ondooka wa rare arone wai na, eta ka edang ne, ayo ale ka wai ara o cora angmǝ. Komana kangza wa rare arone wai na, eta ka edang ne, wa itǝ kap ka akwilǝ ola.<verse eid="MAT 5:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 5:23" />“Nyimia kangza, baya nya Ashili eyapa a nyimi akwilǝ ai ara o esaza Ashili mapapa ma owaze, o ringtǝ o bena arone au neye ka bo a lenyong, <verse eid="MAT 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 5:24" />baya epaaka oya nya Ashili a ting ara o esaza Ashili mapapa mo waze. Bora ka o ale ka o babare kane, o ama o de ka onya Ashili epaaka baaya nyame.<verse eid="MAT 5:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 5:25" />Ondo wa ale ka bo ara o cora angmǝ, yangkanna a saseya ka ebabare ka wai e tata o orona o ale zongka e dukǝ. Bata ya nyimi ne, wayo gwaarau ka ondoo cora angmǝ, aa ondoo cora angmǝ kangza wayo gwaarau ka ana o tesa geza ka a pateo a akwilǝ andaleme. <verse eid="MAT 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 5:26" />Ang dongdong bele o epeng, zongka o sǝǝrǝu arakaname, seena ba are pate emate eeka ataro.<verse eid="MAT 5:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">O baala azaa leyau</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 5:27" />“Ba kone a bekaana, ‘Tana o eze leyau ne.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 20:14">Osur 20:14</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 5:18">Otik 5:18</ref>. </char></note>’ <verse eid="MAT 5:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 5:28" />Eyang beya ying na, pate ondooka wa gonta ondaaye, kawa kone o eza leyau ka wai, wa samba o eza me ka wai naname a nyimi lenyong le wai. <verse eid="MAT 5:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 5:29" />Liizi le oree leo leeyo ote ka o rizi, lopa le ka o pere. Mara o dere sara yende a lepung leo ko bena a tare pate lepung leo a nyimi akwilǝ ola. <verse eid="MAT 5:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 5:30" />O ara oree wa ote ka o rizi, core wai ka o pere. Mara o dere sara yende a lepung leo ko bena a tare pate lepung leo a nyimi akwilǝ ola.<verse eid="MAT 5:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">O baala azaa opere ondaaye</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 19:9">Mat 19:9</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:11-12">Mar 10:11-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 16:18">Luk 16:18</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 5:31" />“Akang samba obena, ‘Ondooka wa pere ondaaye wai, awa dongdong nya wai ewela o pere o awai. <verse eid="MAT 5:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 5:32" />Aa maa bekaa ying na pate ondooka wa pere ondaaye wai, aa wata wa meke wai ka leyau ne, wa ote wai orona o leyau naname, kangza pate ondooka wa ana wai, wa eza leyau naname.<verse eid="MAT 5:32" /></para>
  <para style="s">O baala azaa otono</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 5:33" />“Kangza, ekone a samba o bekea aromo ko rabo na, ‘Tana o tono a rendaza ne, o eze epaaka ba tono ne aa begeshe Ateokora.’<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:33 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 19:12">Mag 19:12</ref>; <ref loc="NUM 30:2">Abal 30:2</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 23:21">Otik 23:21</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="MAT 5:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 5:34" />Mi eyang beya yingna, tana e tono dakememe ne, ka azaa shili, obena arakanamea lǝdǝngdǝ le Ashili zene, <verse eid="MAT 5:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 5:35" />nyimia tane tono ka adeze ne, arakaname Ashili eeshe tobona te ai ne, koona ka Urushalima obena aya apeng ogomo ogong. <verse eid="MAT 5:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 5:36" />Kangza tana otono ka ukpwei o ne, azaa obena ba era ota ote lepkwai le yende kale itǝ leepeng koona leebo ne. <verse eid="MAT 5:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 5:37" />Pate epaaka wa gwara o beke belle eya ‘Eeye’ koona ‘Aa,’ eyapa e kala nyimi, e surea ara ondoo burua.<verse eid="MAT 5:37" /></para>
  <para style="s">O baala azaa otaasa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 6:29-30">Luk 6:29-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 5:38" />“E kone a samba o bekaa me na, ‘Liizi a bengmǝ be liizi, a liini a bengmǝ be liini.’<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:38 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 21:24">Osur 21:24</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 24:20">Mag 24:20</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 19:21">Otik 19:21</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="MAT 5:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 5:39" />Na mi eyang beya ying na, tana enyane ondoo eza oying epa eburu ne. Ondo wa tabau a letamo lo ore wanggare wai lo guri kawa tabe kangza. <verse eid="MAT 5:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 5:40" />Ondo wa ale ka bo ara o cora angmǝ ka wa jeke odibi o, nya wai ulǝ o urnǝzǝ o kangza. <verse eid="MAT 5:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 5:41" />A ondo wa oteu na o eze teweno te omele yende, o ale ka wai o mamele maleere. <verse eid="MAT 5:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 5:42" />Ondo wa bosa eyapa abo, o nya wai. Ondo kangza wa deya aa kope eyapa abo, tana o nare wai ne.<verse eid="MAT 5:42" /></para>
  <para style="s">Oyeme ana onyana o</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 6:27-28">Luk 6:27-28</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 6:32-36">32-36</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 5:43" />“E kone a samba o bekaa na, ‘Yeme ondooka waya ating o, o nyane ondooka wata yeme oo ne.’<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:43 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 19:18">Mag 19:18</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="MAT 5:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 5:44" />A mi eyang beya aying na, yeme na ana o nyana oying e bosazana Ashili azaa andaaka ne gǝǝzǝ ying, <verse eid="MAT 5:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 5:45" />adorana e itǝ ayana Ate aying o zaa shili. Ondooka wa oteze ongme ka wa ye masanto ara ana edang kaa ana o dera edang, awa kang deesa ka olyi ara ana nyong a sangsang ka ana nyong a buru. <verse eid="MAT 5:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 5:46" />Ba yeme ana o yeme owa belle, aya taasa o ka eya? Ana o eesa emate makeke kaa ana madinǝ, nyimia ne ezeze. <verse eid="MAT 5:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 5:47" />Ba beeza aromo au okoo belle, eya o ezeze erere ke kala ena ondo? Andaame maYahuda taza ne nyimia ne ezeze. <verse eid="MAT 5:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 5:48" />Azaa nyimi, itǝ na ana edang nangka Ate aying o zaa shili waye ka edang.<verse eid="MAT 5:48" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="MAT 6" />
  <para style="s">O baala azaa o nyaza</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 6:1" />“Ezana a sauwo tana ogole oying orere wa itǝ ogongta a yizi ne. Azaa obena e eza nyimi, eto cǝ o taasa o woma araa Ate aying o zaa shili ne.<verse eid="MAT 6:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 6:2" />“Nyimia baaya nya ana odera, tana o ara lengmelo ajǝng ka komana kone ne, ana o ara ukpwei ezeze nyimi odandaro o gwarzanang maYahuda ka azaa marona adora aromo sabe ne. Eyang dongdong bele oying, ne samba ocǝ o taasa o woma one pat. <verse eid="MAT 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 6:3" />Aa bayaa nya ondo odera eyapa, tana o baya o ara oguri wa rose epaaka o ara ore ya eza me ne, <verse eid="MAT 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 6:4" />adorana nyaza oying itǝ epa esuk. Arakaname Ate aying, ka wa gongte epaaka aya ezaa me aa asuk, wayo taasau akap.<verse eid="MAT 6:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">O baala azaa o beya angmǝ ka Ashili</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 11:2-4">Luk 11:2-4</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 6:5" />“Aa baaya beya angmǝ ka Ashili, tana oye na ana o ara ukpwei ne, ne yeme o beya angmǝ ka Ashili a itǝ a madandaro ma ogwarzanang maYahuda ka edǝki marona ka aromo laka ne. Eyang dongdong bele oying epeng, ne samba o emba o taasa one a pat.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 18:10-14">Luk 18:10-14</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="MAT 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 6:6" />Nyimia waaza, baya beya angmǝ ka Ashili, ale a nyimi odo o, pate abuudu me o beye angmǝ ka Ate au aaka ata gonta ai ne, aa Ate au ka agonte pate epaaka a eze a suk, ayo taasau.<verse eid="MAT 6:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 6:7" />“A eeya beya angmǝ ka Ashili, tana wa eweo na aworme ka neta rosa Ashili ne, andaame neya gonta na ne beya angmǝ a ewo waya yo ote ka kone ne. <verse eid="MAT 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 6:8" />Tane itǝ na nee ne, Ate ying rosa epaaka e gwara ka ying zongka e pirkǝ ai.<verse eid="MAT 6:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 6:9" />E beya angmǝ ka Ashili nanna,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 6:9">“Ate aro ozaa shili,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 6:9">a monte leze leo a sangsang.<verse eid="MAT 6:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 6:10" />A togomo to de,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 6:10">aa eze epaaka oya yeme me</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 6:10">a lerambo leena,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 6:10">nangka ezeze azaa shili.<verse eid="MAT 6:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 6:11" />Nyaro epaolya o ngmeengme.<verse eid="MAT 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 6:12" />O pisi ro madinǝ maro,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 6:12">nangka te pisizi andaaka ne ezeze ro madinǝ.<verse eid="MAT 6:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 6:13" />Tana o ale kaaro ara o kedeya ne,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 6:13">o wobe ro a taara te ogomo o bere o buru ona.’<verse eid="MAT 6:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 6:14" />“E pisǝ aromo aaka ne ezeze ying epa eburu, Ate aying o zaa shili yo pisǝ maying’. <verse eid="MAT 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 6:15" />Aa eeta pisǝ ana ondo madinǝ mane ne, Ate ying to pisǝ epa eburu eeying ne.”<verse eid="MAT 6:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">O baala azaa o pate ongmǝ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 6:16" />“Eeya meke o ngmǝ, tane care mayinu nangka ana o ara ukpwei ezeze ne. Ne care mayinu kane wore aromo bekaana neya eza opate o ngmǝ. Ang dongdong bele oying, ne samba ocǝ o taasa one naname. <verse eid="MAT 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 6:17" />Aa baaya pate o ngmǝ, kwizǝ mayinu mau, o saane mai manau, <verse eid="MAT 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 6:18" />adorana tana rosa o bena oya eza o pate o ngmǝ ne. Ate au kaa ta gonta ne, ooka kangza wa gonte pate epaaka a ezeze a suk, wayo taasau.<verse eid="MAT 6:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">O baala azaa o eke ocǝ azaa shili</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 12:33-34">Luk 12:33-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 6:19" />“Tana e kuri tukpwei toying ocǝ a lerambo leena araaka egau kaa orengkaka yo cara wai ne, araaka akǝri neyo pora ka ne lyǝ ne kpwi. <verse eid="MAT 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 6:20" />Soona e kuri tukpwei toying ocǝ azaa shili, araaka egau ka orengkaka to cara wai ne, araaka kangza, akǝri to lyǝ ka ne eze bekǝri ne. <verse eid="MAT 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 6:21" />Araaka ocǝ o zene, sanamea lenyong leo zene kangza.<verse eid="MAT 6:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Masanto ma lepung</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 11:34-36">Luk 11:34-36</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 6:22" />“Liizi leya beru be masanto ma lepung, liizi leo leeya cammo, pate lepung leo yo pena ka masanto. <verse eid="MAT 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 6:23" />A liizi leo leeta cammo ne, pate lepung leo yo dera masanto. Masanto ma lepung leo ma itǝ maring, maring yo dongdong gongha!<verse eid="MAT 6:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">O eza lezara aa ateokora a leere</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 16:13">Luk 16:13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 6:24" />“Ondo wa era wata eza lezara ateakoro leere ne, baya nyimi oyo nyana o yende o yeme o yende, koona o tare o yende o zeele o leere me. Ba era ota tare Ashili kaa emate awere yende ne.”<verse eid="MAT 6:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">O werno a Ateokora</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 12:22-31">Luk 12:22-31</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 6:25" />Azaa nyimi eyang bele oying, tana e gare tukpwei toying azaa epaaka eya lyame, koona eya sa me, koona nangka eyo cǝ madibi ma o amba. Ebeene kala epaolya sang? Aa lepung kangza kala madibi sang? <verse eid="MAT 6:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 6:26" />Laka na engmeng o zaa shili, neta eza o shebeka koona ne shende kane eke a bengga ne. Pate ka nyimi Ate ying o zaa shili lyeeze ka ne. Ying e kala ne edang sang? <verse eid="MAT 6:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 6:27" />Mana a nyimi oying a kazo gara ukpwei wai wa era wa wale lemore le yende a nyimi tomore to wai<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:27 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">wa era wa wale lemore le yende a nyimi tomore to wai </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ewele angmǝ Ashili yende, aye ka, “Waleke opkwai o meke yende o ewa o wai.”</char></note>?<verse eid="MAT 6:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 6:28" />“Na eyaka eya gara tukpwei toying azaa madibi ma o amba? Laka nangka eburu o wake e gongze, neta eza gole yende ne. <verse eid="MAT 6:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 6:29" />Pate ka nyimi eyang belo oying na ogomo Suleimanu ka ocǝ wai wata wa amba madibi maa gong na ondo a nyimi one ne.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 10:4-7">1 Agom 10:4-7</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 9:3-6">2 Oash 9:3-6</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="MAT 6:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 6:30" />Nyimia Ashili eze mawake ma owake bejaga nanna, maaka maya arakana o ngmeengme, a leere a ese mai ka ola, shibari ying? Ying ana o dera o kabare kaa Ashili! <verse eid="MAT 6:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 6:31" />Azaa nyimi tana e gare tukpwei toying a beyana, ‘Eya taya lya me?’ Koona ‘Eya teya sa me?’ Koona ‘Eya teya amba me?’ <verse eid="MAT 6:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 6:32" />A worme ana o dera o rosa Ashili neya gare tukpwei tone azaa o gera nyimi. Kangza Ate aying o zaa shili a rose o bena eya yeme mapapa maana. <verse eid="MAT 6:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 6:33" />Epa e woma o bora eya, e nya Ashili tukpwei toying, e eze epa e togomo te Ashili, ka o gera epa ee sangsang ai, ayo nya ying kaa pate ma mapapa maana kangza. <verse eid="MAT 6:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 6:34" />Zaa nyimia tana e gare tukpwei toying azaa leere ne, leere yo deya ka ebelo gara le. Konang lengme ya ka ozitǝ ka waya kap ka le.<verse eid="MAT 6:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="MAT 7" />
  <para style="s">Tana ecore angmǝ azaa ondo ne</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 6:37-38">Luk 6:37-38</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 6:41-42">41-42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 7:1" />“Tana e core angmǝ azaa ondo ne, adorana tana a core angmǝ azaa oying ne. <verse eid="MAT 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 7:2" />Nangka e core angmǝ azaa na ondo, nyimia ayo core angmǝ aza oying. Kangza ka epa ogoshe ooka e ezane, ka wai ya ayo eza ying ne.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 4:24">Mar 4:24</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="MAT 7:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 7:3" />“Eyaka oya gonta kapa a liizi le orone o, oota ba laka okuturu a liizi leo ne? <verse eid="MAT 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 7:4" />Ba wǝnia o bekaa orone o na, ‘Bayang lopau kapa a nyimi liizi leo,’ abo oya ka okuturu a liizi leo? <verse eid="MAT 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 7:5" />Bo ondo ara ukpwei, bora ka o lope okuturu a liizi leo, arakaname oyo laka maleu ko ama o lopa kapa a liizi le orone o.<verse eid="MAT 7:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 7:6" />“Tana e nya e'ere epa e sangsang ne, tana e tare odembashe akwilǝ acale edang aying ne. Nee era ne itǝzǝ ne ka tobona, ane kuri kane daare ying a lekeleke.”<verse eid="MAT 7:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">O beya angmǝ ka Ashili</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 11:9-13">Luk 11:9-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 7:7" />“Pirǝ na ayo nya ying, geraza na eyo cǝ, gwarazana ayo pari ying abuudu. <verse eid="MAT 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 7:8" />Pate ondooka wa pirǝ ayo nya wai, ondooka wa gera wayo cǝ, kangza pate ondooka wa gwara, ayo pari wai abuudu.<verse eid="MAT 7:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 7:9" />Mana nyimi oying ana ate, kena ka wai ka bosa oborode, awa nya kai lecale? <verse eid="MAT 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 7:10" />Koona ka bose bekwala, awa nya kai owa? <verse eid="MAT 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 7:11" />Na ying ana ara aburu e rose nangka eyo nyaza ayana ying mapapa ma rere, shebari Ate aying o zaa shili wato kala ying aa ama o nyaza mapapa ma rere andaaka ne pirzi ai sang! <verse eid="MAT 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 7:12" />Azaa nyimi, eza aromo epaaka oya yeme ane ezo, obena ennaa beyo be makili ma Mosa ka ana obeya angmǝ ka mawo ma Ashili.”<verse eid="MAT 7:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Abuudu a seto</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 13:24">Luk 13:24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 7:13" />Lyǝ na abuudu a seto. Obena abuudu a patarke kaa kang gongha a aleze ka aromo akwilǝ ola, aromo a cake lyǝzǝ a ai. <verse eid="MAT 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 7:14" />Nyimia orona o cǝsǝ ebeene o dera o maro, waya seto awa kang ya baate, andaa baate ya kalea ai.<verse eid="MAT 7:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">A rose uti ka ebelo ayana wai</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 6:43-44">Luk 6:43-44</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 7:15" />“Ezana a sauwo ka ana beya angmǝ ka mawo rendaza. Ne deese aying ka madibi ma emande epeng, a nyimi one neye na enama orambo o kala ara aburu. <verse eid="MAT 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 7:16" />Ebelo ogole ane wayo ote ka rose ne. Ara cǝ ayana inabi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:16 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">inabi </char><char style="ft" closed="false">wa kap na uti a anyong kaa soze ayana wai.</char></note> uti ekana na, koona ayana osaya a uti ekana? <verse eid="MAT 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 7:17" />Nyimia konang uti orere wa kareze ayana rere, aa uti oburu wa kareze ayana aburu. <verse eid="MAT 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 7:18" />Uti orere wa era wata kare ayana aburu ne, anyimia kangza uti oburu wa era wata kare ayana aa rere ne. <verse eid="MAT 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 7:19" />Pate uti ka wata kare ayana aa rere ne, ayo core wai a tare wai a nyimi ola. <verse eid="MAT 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 7:20" />Nyimia ayana ane yo ote ka erose ne.”<verse eid="MAT 7:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Anta maa tukǝ o rosa oying ne</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 13:25-27">Luk 13:25-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 7:21" />Pate ondooka wa beya mi na, ‘Ateokora, Ateokora’ waya to lyǝ a nyimi togomo to zaa shili ne. Soona ondooka wa eza epaaka Ate ang o nyimia o zaa shili ya yeme me. <verse eid="MAT 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 7:22" />A lengme lenname aromo acake yo beya me na, ‘Ateokora, Ateokora!’ Cai! Te zoole aa nyimi leze leo sang? Te sǝrsǝzǝ mabere maa buru anyimi leze leo sang? Kangza, a nyimi leze leo wa te eze mapapa mo tera ukpwei sang? <verse eid="MAT 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 7:23" />A were namea eyang bekaa ne a begeshe be komana na, ‘Anta tukǝ orosa oying ne. Arnang na ka me, ying ana o eza epa <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 6:9">Sel 6:9</ref>.</char></note>e buru.’<verse eid="MAT 7:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Aromo leere ana osowa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 6:47-49">Luk 6:47-49</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 7:24" />“Azaa nyimi pate ondooka wa kona angmǝ ang aana, ka wa eze ogole ka ai, waye na ondoo rosa ka wa sowa akwilǝ wai azaa opoo. <verse eid="MAT 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 7:25" />Nangka olyi wa ngmeze, na mabeno penze a ngmet, obere kang era nawa tabe akwilǝ me, nyimia na ata oko ne, obena oting ai ya azaa opoo. <verse eid="MAT 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 7:26" />A pate ondooka wa kona a ngmǝ ang aana, ka wata eza ogole ka ai ne, waye na ondoo dera orosa ka wa so akwilǝ azaa egengge. <verse eid="MAT 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 7:27" />Na olyi ngmeze, a mabeno penze, kangza obere ere nawa tabe akwilǝ name, naa oko a nyokonyoko.”<verse eid="MAT 7:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 7:28" />Nangka Yeso ka mare o beya mapapa ma name, na epame tere leguki le aromo ukpwei azaa ambela obaala kai. <verse eid="MAT 7:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 7:29" />Azaa obena ka baale ne naa ondooka waye ka obare, na ana o baala makili ma Mosa tazane.<verse eid="MAT 7:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="MAT 8" />
  <para style="s">Yeso ka womza ondo legangca</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:40-45">Mar 1:40-45</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:12-16">Luk 5:12-16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 8:1" />Nangka Yeso ka jǝpi aza oyara, na aromo cake ne tare kai. <verse eid="MAT 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 8:2" />Na ogangca yende deya a kai nawa tunggunu aa begeshe be kai awa bena, “Ateokora, oya ka obare o womzang ong kang itǝ a sangsang.” <verse eid="MAT 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 8:3" />Na Yeso nayi o ara kai naka meke wai aka bekaana, “Ma kabare ma womzau, itǝ a sangsang.” A saseya nawa woma ka leganca le ma. <verse eid="MAT 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 8:4" />Na Yeso beka a wai, “Kona, tana o bekea ondo epa eka ee manau ne, ale ka o wore ukpwei o ondo magame ma Ashili, oo kang nya epa eka a yo esa nangka Ashili a bele Mosa. Ya nyimi ka o wore aromo bekaana ba woma.<verse eid="MAT 8:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">O kabare kaa Ashili ondo ogong<optbreak /> ana o tesa geza omoole a Roma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 8:5" />Nangka Yeso ka lyǝ a Kaparnahum, Na ondo o gong o tesa geza omole o Roma bose kai na, <verse eid="MAT 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 8:6" />“Ateokora, ozara ong ya tete akwilǝ, a lepung lewai lee gbwǝ aa waya kona o poba ajǝng.”<verse eid="MAT 8:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 8:7" />Na Yeso bekaa wai na, “Eyang deya kang womza wai.”<verse eid="MAT 8:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 8:8" />Ondo o gong o tesa geza omole name bekena, “Ateokora ang ta bare odeya akwilǝ ang ne, soona o sokoo bekaa angmǝ, ozara ong wayo woma. <verse eid="MAT 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 8:9" />Mi ang ya taara te ondo, kangza ka ana o tesa geza a moole ba taara tong, maa kang bekaa ondo na, “Ale, awa ale, ondo kangza ang bekaa na, “Deya,” awa de, ang kang bekaa ozara ong na, “Ya epana,” a wa ye. <verse eid="MAT 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 8:10" />Nangka Yeso ka kone nyimi, na epame tere kai ukpwei, aa ka beka ana o tarea kai na, “Ang dongdong bele ying epeng me, anta ma cǝ ondo a nyimi Isrela kawa o kabare kaa Ashili na oromo na ne. <verse eid="MAT 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 8:11" />Eyang belo ying, aromo a cake ne yo deesa a dizi ka aza ka ne cikǝ a ne lye epaolya legwa kaa Ibraheng, kaa Ishaku aa Yakubu a nyimi togomo te o zaa shili.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 13:29">Luk 13:29</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="MAT 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 8:12" />Bangka nyimi, ayo gǝǝzǝ ayana togomo ogomo obere oburu a nyimi maring maa bitibiti. Ara aaka ne yo ruuzi ka o nonza tuuni.<verse eid="MAT 8:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 8:13" />Na Yeso bekaa ondo o gong o tesa geza o moole o Roma na, “Ale, ayo yau nangka o kabare ka Ashili au ze.” Na o ngmere liizi na ozara me woma.<verse eid="MAT 8:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yeso ka womza aromo acak</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:32-34">Mar 1:32-34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:38-41">Luk 4:38-41</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 8:14" />Nangka Yeso ka lyǝ akwilǝ a Biturusu naka mana ondawa wai a wata zake ne. <verse eid="MAT 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 8:15" />Na Yeso meke o ara wai, nawa woma, aa wa era nawa sele kai epaolya.<verse eid="MAT 8:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 8:16" />Nangka ulyǝlu waye, na aromo deese kaa aromo a cake ka ogomo o bere o buru wa taba ne. Kaa angmǝ ka ka beke belle, ka sǝǝrǝ obere oburu me, aka kang womza pate ana o dera o kona a cammo. <verse eid="MAT 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 8:17" />Ka ye nyimia adorana a panza epa eka ondo beya ngmǝ ka mawo ma Ashili Ishaya wa beke na,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 8:17">“Ka ana makono maro,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 8:17">kaa pate odera o kona aa zake aro.”<verse eid="MAT 8:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">O zaka o tare o Yeso wa pobe</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 9:57-62">Luk 9:57-62</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 8:18" />Nangka Yeso ka laka aromo a cake aa nee ringgǝri kai, naka ote nee na ne kuri owulu obeno niini. <verse eid="MAT 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 8:19" />Na ondo baala angmǝ aaka Ashili nya Mosa wa de nawa beka kai na, “Ondo baala, eyang tare o apate araaka oya ale ne.”<verse eid="MAT 8:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 8:20" />Na Yeso kabare wai na, “E ere o wake neye ka she'o, engmeng o zaa shili kangza neye ka todo, aa Kena ka o Oromo kata ka ara o mora ne.”<verse eid="MAT 8:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 8:21" />Na ondo nyimi ana o tare o Yeso bekena, Ateokora, baya ang ale kang taase ate ang suri.”<verse eid="MAT 8:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 8:22" />Na Yeso bekaa wai na, “Tareng, baya andaaka ne gbwizǝ ne taase andaaka ne gbwizǝ.”<verse eid="MAT 8:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yeso ka zurki obere ka lejǝng le manyi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 4:35-41">Mar 4:35-41</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:22-25">Luk 8:22-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 8:23" />Nangka Yeso lyǝ a nyimi o onggo o taara manyi, na ana o tare o Yeso ale legwa ka kai. <verse eid="MAT 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 8:24" />Na o bere ogong era a lepong leme, na sejǝng sheme ere ka legoone na manyi bore o lyǝzǝ a nyimi onggo me, aa Yeso ya malau. <verse eid="MAT 8:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 8:25" />Na atoma kai ale nane ara kai, aa ne bekaa kai na, “Ateokora, boza ro, manyi ya lya oro.”<verse eid="MAT 8:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 8:26" />Na ka bekaa ne na, “Eyaka e kerke nyimi? O kabare kaa Ashili aying me baba? Naka ere, aaka zurki obere ka lejǝng le manyi mame. Na keeya itǝ a tiiyi.<verse eid="MAT 8:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 8:27" />Na epame tere aromo ukpwei, aa ne beke na, “Mana waana ka o bere ka lejǝng le manyi kone kai aane tare kai?” <verse eid="MAT 8:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 8:28" />Nangka ne de owulu o makeke ma Garasina, na aromo leere ane suri a macau aaka obere o buru wa taba ne, ne wobe Yeso. Legoone lene le itǝ epa e boome maleu nangka aromo ta tareze orona me ne. <verse eid="MAT 8:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 8:29" />Na ne rurayi aa ne bekaa Yeso na, “Eya manyi mau kaaro, bo Kena ka Ashili? Ba deya ko ka gǝǝzǝ ro, a were ta aya ne na?”<verse eid="MAT 8:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 8:30" />Aa ma'amo kaa ne edembashe akwilǝ ne rene a cake a neya lya epaolya. <verse eid="MAT 8:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 8:31" />Na obere oburu name bose Yeso na, “Baa sǝǝrǝ ro o turki ro a nyimia edembashe akwilǝ me.”<verse eid="MAT 8:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 8:32" />Naka bekaa ne na, “Ale na.” Na ne suri aa ne lyǝ edembashe akwilǝ me. Na edembashe me ne ere ka tesong na ne tǝǝru a lepong leme na manyi lye ne apat.<verse eid="MAT 8:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 8:33" />Na ana o soola edembashe me ne ere ka tosong, aa ne ale apeng, aa ne baale pate epa eka e mane ne, kaa epa eka ee mane ana obere o buru me. <verse eid="MAT 8:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 8:34" />Na pate aromo apeng me ne suri na ne wobe Yeso. Nangka ne laka kai, na ne bose kai na ka baya makeke mane.<verse eid="MAT 8:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="MAT 9" />
  <para style="s">Yeso ka womza ondooka lepung lewai le gbwǝ</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 2:1-12">Mar 2:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:17-26">Luk 5:17-26</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 9:1" />Nangka Yeso ka lyǝ o onggo manyi, naka tare a Kaparnahum apeng aaka ka gong ne. <verse eid="MAT 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 9:2" />Na ca kai ondo ka lepung le wai le gbwi aa waya tete a kapengge. Nangka Yeso ka laka okabare kaa Ashili ane, naka bekaa ondooka lepung lewai le gbwǝ na, “Kena kang, zanta, a pisǝ madinǝ mau.”<verse eid="MAT 9:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 9:3" />Na ana o baala ngmǝ aaka Ashili nya Mosa ne bekaa a tukpwei tone na, “Karomo kaana ka tambo Ashili!”<verse eid="MAT 9:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 9:4" />Aa Yeso ka orosa madoola mane, naka pirkǝ na, “Eyaaka eya eza madoola maburu a nyong aying nanna? <verse eid="MAT 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 9:5" />Eya kala o dera o poba, o beka na, “O bena a pisǝ madinǝ mau na, ‘Koona era ka oyeng na? <verse eid="MAT 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 9:6" />Eyang yeme e rose obena Kena ka o Oromo kaye ka obare o pisǝ madinǝ a lerambo.’ Naka bekaa ondooka lepung le wai le gbwǝ na, “Era ka o jeke kapengge kau o ale akwilǝ.” <verse eid="MAT 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 9:7" />Na oromo me ere, nawa ale akwilǝ. <verse eid="MAT 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 9:8" />Nangka aromo a cake ne laka nyimi, nane kone boome, aa ne sabe Ashili, aaka aa nya aromo ebelo obare oona.<verse eid="MAT 9:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yeso ka rare Matiyu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 2:13-17">Mar 2:13-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:27-32">Luk 5:27-32</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 9:9" />Nangka Yeso ka lyǝ izi ka teweno, naka laka oromo yende kaa rareze wai na Matiyu, aa waya cikǝ awa eze ogole ara o eese emate makeke. Naka bekaa wai na, “Tareng.” Nawa ere aa wa tare kai. <verse eid="MAT 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 9:10" />Malo nyimi aa Yeso ya lya epaolya akwilǝ a Matiyu, na ana o eesa emate makeke ka ana madinǝ a cake ne de, na ne cikǝ ka kai kaa ana o tare o kai. <verse eid="MAT 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 9:11" />Nangka maParisa ne laka nyimi, na ne bekaa atoma kai na, “Eyaka ka ondo obaala o ying waya lya epaolya kaa ana o eesa emate makeke kaa na madinǝ?”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 15:1-2">Luk 15:1-2</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="MAT 9:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 9:12" />Nangka Yeso ka kone nyimi na ka bekaa na, “Andaaka neya kona azake ta gera ondo onyaza makang ne, seekoona ana o kono. <verse eid="MAT 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 9:13" />Azaa nyimi ale na ka e gere orosa epaaka nyimi, ‘Egonegonea mi ang yeme aying, onyaza eyapaa tazane.’ Antaa ma deya kang rare andaa woma ne, seena ana madinǝ.”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 12:7">Mat 12:7</ref>; <ref loc="HOS 6:6">Hos 6:6</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="MAT 9:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Be perǝ azaa opate ongmǝ</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 2:18-22">Mar 2:18-22</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:33-39">Luk 5:33-39</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 9:14" />Na ana otare Yohana o batisma ne deya Yeso na ne beka kai na, “Awiinia ro ka maParisa te pate o ngmǝ, a na otare o ta ezaza ne?”<verse eid="MAT 9:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 9:15" />Na Yeso kabare nee na, “Anyong a era caro ajaa ondooka wa sure ana ondaye osau a neye legwa na? Tomore ya deya ka ayo jeka ondoo ana ondaaye osau a baya ne. A tomore tonname neyo pate o ngmǝ. <verse eid="MAT 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 9:16" />“Ondo wa ere wata manka ozani osau ka wa naane odibi oo kozo ne, o naane me yo dara odibi me kawa kala o samba o burǝ. <verse eid="MAT 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 9:17" />Kangza, ondo wa era wata kare manyi ma o inabi ma sau aa boboto a kozo ne. Waya nyimi a boboto me yo poso ka manyi ma o inabi me oko, a boboto me caro. Manyi ma o inabi ma sau, a kare mai a boboto a sau. Adorana a bisi kaa pate maleere mame.”<verse eid="MAT 9:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kagala ka Yariyus<optbreak /> kaa ondaaye ooka manyau ya ooso a wai</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 5:21-43">Mar 5:21-43</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:40-56">Luk 8:40-56</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 9:18" />Yeso kaya za obeya nyimi naname, na ondoono o dandaro o gwarzanang maYahuda, wa de aa wa tunggunu ating kai aa wa bekaa na, “Nanname na kagala kang surǝ aa gbwǝ, deya ka o eke taara to azaa kai, ka yo era.” <verse eid="MAT 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 9:19" />Na Yeso ere legwa kaa ana otare kai, nane ale ka oromo me.<verse eid="MAT 9:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 9:20" />Ondaaye yende wa zene arame aa wa ye shenai betuuru ka she leere aa waya kono o ooso manyau, nawa deya a sauwo a dimǝ Yeso nawa eke o ara a bengmǝ be odibi kai. <verse eid="MAT 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 9:21" />Aa wa bekaa lenyong lewai na, “Maa eke o ara odibi kai belle, eyang woma.”<verse eid="MAT 9:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 9:22" />Nangka Yeso ka ringgǝnu naka laka wai, naka bekaana, “Ondaaye, zanta, o kabare kaa Ashili au, wa womzau.” A saseya na ondaaye me woma.<verse eid="MAT 9:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 9:23" />Nangka Yeso ka de akwilǝ ondoono dandaro gwarzanang maYahuda, naka mana aromo acak aa neya ulbǝ esherowa ka seleera she ma'ade. <verse eid="MAT 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 9:24" />Naka bekaana, “Erana arakaana! Ogala me taa wa gbwǝ ne waya malauwa belle.” Nane zoze, aa ne zeele kai.<verse eid="MAT 9:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 9:25" />Nangka asǝǝrǝ aromo me o yanga, naka lyǝ aa nyimi aa ka meke o ara ogala me, aaka ara kai. <verse eid="MAT 9:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 9:26" />Na orooka me wa ale a kuruwǝ a pate makeke mame.<verse eid="MAT 9:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yeso ka womza arǝ kaa orakare</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 9:27" />Yeso kaya baya ara me naname, na arǝ aleere tare kai aa ne rare ajǝng na, “Kena ka Daoda kona egonegone ero!”<verse eid="MAT 9:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 9:28" />Nangka ka lyǝ akwilǝ yende na arǝ me deya kai, na Yeso me bekaa ne na, “Ee kabare ka Ashili obena maa erang womza ying na?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 9:28">Na ne kabare kai na, “Eeye, Ateokora.”<verse eid="MAT 9:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 9:29" />Naka a eke o ara kai aa yizi ane, aaka bekaa na, “Azaa o kabare ka Ashili aying, aa womza ying.” <verse eid="MAT 9:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 9:30" />Na a yizi ane pǝrnu. Aa Yeso windi ne teto maleu na, “Tana e bele ondo orooka na ne.”<verse eid="MAT 9:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 9:31" />Pate ka nyimi, na ne suri, aane baale orooka kai aa kuruwǝ aa makeke ma me.<verse eid="MAT 9:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 9:32" />Nangka neya ale, na ca kai orakare yende ka obere oburu wa tabe wai. <verse eid="MAT 9:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 9:33" />Malo oka a sǝǝrǝ obere o buru me, na orakare me wa obeke angmǝ. Na epa me tere aromo cak tukpwei aane beyaa na, “Ata aa tuku laka ebelo epa eena a nyimi a Isrela ne.”<verse eid="MAT 9:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 9:34" />Na maParisa bekaana, “Ka legoone le ogomo obere o burua wa ya sǝrsǝzǝ mabere maburu.”<verse eid="MAT 9:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yeso ka kone egonegone aromo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 9:35" />Na Yeso ka aleze a topepeng, aaka baale angmǝ a lebo a madandaro ma ogwarzanang maYahuda, aaka zoole azaa togomo te Ashili, aaka womza aromo azaa kombela makono ka o dera o kona a zake. <verse eid="MAT 9:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 9:36" />Nangka ka laka o kurkǝnǝng aromo naka kone egonegone, obena neya zitǝ azaa o dera ondo o kangkama, neye na emande epeng zora ondo otare ka ne.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:36 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 27:17">Abal 27:17</ref>; <ref loc="1KI 22:17">1 Agom 22:17</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 18:16">2 Oash 18:16</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 34:5">Ezek 34:5</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:35">Mar 6:35</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="MAT 9:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 9:37" />Aka bekaa ana o tare o akai na, “O shende arame gong, aa na o shende me ta gongnga ne. <verse eid="MAT 9:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 9:38" />Azaa nyimi, bosana ateokora o shende me kawa tong ana ogole kane shende.”<verse eid="MAT 9:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="MAT 10" />
  <para style="s">Yeso ka zake atoma akai</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 3:13-19">Mar 3:13-19</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:12-16">Luk 6:12-16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 10:1" />Na Yeso zake ana o tare o akai betuuru kaa leere, a ka nya ne legoone lo sǝǝrǝ mabere maburu, ka o womza koonang makono kaa o dera o kona azake.<verse eid="MAT 10:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 10:2" />Shennaa seze she atoma Yeso betuuru:</para>
  <para style="li" vid="MAT 10:2">Obora waya Siman ka a beya wai na Biturusu,</para>
  <para style="li" vid="MAT 10:2">Kaa orone wai Andarawus,</para>
  <para style="li" vid="MAT 10:2">Kaa Yakubu kena kaa Zabadi,</para>
  <para style="li" vid="MAT 10:2">Kaa orone wai Yohana,<verse eid="MAT 10:2" /></para>
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 10:3" />Kaa Pilibus,</para>
  <para style="li" vid="MAT 10:3">Kaa Batilomi,</para>
  <para style="li" vid="MAT 10:3">Kaa Toma,</para>
  <para style="li" vid="MAT 10:3">Kaa Matiyu ondo eesa emate makeke,</para>
  <para style="li" vid="MAT 10:3">Kaa Yakubu kena ka Halpa,</para>
  <para style="li" vid="MAT 10:3">Kaa Tadiyus,<verse eid="MAT 10:3" /></para>
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 10:4" />Kaa Siman karomo ka Kan'na ka beya kai na kaye kale nyong le makeke ma kai,</para>
  <para style="li" vid="MAT 10:4">Kangza kaa Yahuda Iskariyoti ooka wa nya Yeso.<verse eid="MAT 10:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yeso ka tong atoma betuuru kaa leere</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 6:7-13">Mar 6:7-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:1-6">Luk 9:1-6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 10:5" />Nee betuuru kaa leere namea Yeso ka tong, aaka bekaa nee na, “Tana ne ale a makeke ma aworme ne, na koonang apeng a Samariya, <verse eid="MAT 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 10:6" />soona e ale emande epeng ka e wilǝ, aromo a Isrela. <verse eid="MAT 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 10:7" />A nyimi teweno teying e zoole na, ‘Togomo te zaa shili te amara.’ <verse eid="MAT 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 10:8" />Ee womza ana makono, ee arsaza andaaka ne gbwizǝ, a womza agangca, ee sǝǝrǝ mabere maburu. A nyaza ying zora onya eyapa, ying ma nyaza na nyimi.<verse eid="MAT 10:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 10:9" />Kane monte emate o ozinari, na azorpa, emate epeng a nyimi lejǝng le le'eke. <verse eid="MAT 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 10:10" />Kangza kane jeke ojeketa a teweno toying ne, kane jeke madibi maleere ne, na tokakau, na lebenda, obena ondo ogole gwara ka epaolya wai.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 9:14">1 Kor 9:14</ref>; <ref loc="1TI 5:18">1 Tim 5:18</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="MAT 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 10:11" />Pate apeng aaka e lyǝ ne, ee gere oromo edang ka e jǝpi akwilǝ wai, a ale a were o baya apeng me. <verse eid="MAT 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 10:12" />Eeya lyǝ a akwilǝ me ee bekaa na, ‘O cikǝ o cammo itǝ oying.’ <verse eid="MAT 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 10:13" />Akwilǝ me edang aaza, oo cikǝ o cammo ying wa cikǝ ai. Kangza edang waata zane, aa wa kuri a ying. <verse eid="MAT 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 10:14" />Pate ondooka wa nyana o emba oying, koona wa nyana o kona angmǝ aying, eeya surǝ akwilǝ me, na apeng me e zazame ma sorma ma tobona toying.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 13:51">Ogat 13:51</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="MAT 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 10:15" />“Eyang dongdong obele oying, a lengme lo core angmǝ ayo kona egonegone makeke ma Sadoma ka ma Gwamrata azaa apeng na.”<verse eid="MAT 10:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ozitǝ o deya</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 13:9-13">Mar 13:9-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 12:11-12">Luk 12:11-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:12-19">Luk 21:12-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 10:16" />“Laka na, ma tonga ying naa emande epeng a nyimi egana. Azaa nyimi cikǝ na ka o rosana na ewa, kangza e itǝ ana epa erere naa egoma. <verse eid="MAT 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 10:17" />Ezana a sauwo ka aromo, neyo ale ying abegeshe ana o cora ngmǝ, aane ole ying ane eze ying teyong aa madandaro ma ogwarzanang maYahuda. <verse eid="MAT 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 10:18" />Aza ong Kangza neyo aleze ka ying abegeshe be andaano kaa agomo, ka e beke angmǝ a lebo aza ong abegeshe be aworme. <verse eid="MAT 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 10:19" />Awereaka ne meke ying kane ale kaa ying aana togomo, tane gare tukpwei toying aza epa eeka eyo beka, kaa nangka eyo beka ne, ayo nya ying epa eka eyo beka awere me. <verse eid="MAT 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 10:20" />Aza obena ying ngha ta beya angmǝ ne, Obere orere Ate a ying waya ya beya angmǝ aa tongmǝ toying.<verse eid="MAT 10:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 10:21" />“Orone wayo nya orone wai ka wong, nyimia ate yo ya ka kena ka wai. Ayana kangza neyo girǝ ana ate ane, ane ote ka wongze ne. <verse eid="MAT 10:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 10:22" />Aromo neyo nyana ying azaa leze leng. Pate ondooka wa motana aa ale omaare, wayo bisǝ. <verse eid="MAT 10:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 10:23" />Nee gǝǝzǝ ying apeng aana, songhana ka e alea apeng a izi. Epeng emea eyang dongdong belo oying, eto mara o aleze a topepeng te Isrela ne, aa Kena ka o Oromo yo deya.<verse eid="MAT 10:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 10:24" />“Ondo tare wata kala ondo baala wai ne, ozara kangza wata kala ateokora wai ne. <verse eid="MAT 10:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 10:25" />Wa gwara ondooka a baale wai aa wa itǝ na ondo o baala wai, ozara kangza waye na ateokora wai. Aa ne rare ateokora na Ba'alzebul, nannia aromo akwilǝ wai kangza?”<verse eid="MAT 10:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ondooka wa gwara a kone boome be wai</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 12:2-9">Luk 12:2-9</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 10:26" />“Azaa nyimi kane kone boome bene ne, obena eyapa tazene ka a pate, ka atoo pǝri e ne, kangza eyapa ta zene ka aa baasa ka atoo rosa ee ne. <verse eid="MAT 10:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 10:27" />Epa eeka eyang baala oying asuk, beke na e aa pantalang. Aa epa eeka a bele ying a toto, zoola na azaa e ajǝng aa betǝnkǝrǝ. <verse eid="MAT 10:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 10:28" />Tana e kone boome be andaaka ne wonze oromo ne, a neta ama o wonga bebuu be wai ne. Soona e kone boome be ondooka waye ka legoone le o wonga bebuu ka lepung apat akwilǝ ola. <verse eid="MAT 10:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 10:29" />A lisǝzǝ engmeng e leere okobo sang? Kayende ka era aa kata tǝru aa deze ka ka gbwǝ dera orosa a Ate aying ne. <verse eid="MAT 10:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 10:30" />Nyimia waaza pate shepkwai she ying a bala. <verse eid="MAT 10:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 10:31" />Azaa nyimi tane kone boome ne. Obena edang eying e kala engmeng acak.”<verse eid="MAT 10:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 10:32" />“Pate ondooka wa kabare kaa mi a begeshe be aromo, mi ma eyang kabare kaa wai a begeshe be Ate ang o zaa shili. <verse eid="MAT 10:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 10:33" />Apate ondooka wa sangga o rosa ong a begeshe be aromo, mi ma eyang sangga o rosa wai a begeshe be Ate ang o zaa shili.”<verse eid="MAT 10:33" /></para>
  <para style="s">Anta ma deya ka ocikǝ o cammo ne seena o kara</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 12:51-53">Luk 12:51-53</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 14:26-27">14:26-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 10:34" />“Tane eke obena ma deya ka o cikǝ a cammo a lerambo leena ne. Anta ma deya ka o cikǝ ocammo ne, soona okara. <verse eid="MAT 10:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 10:35" />Ma deya,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 10:35">Kang gwara oromo kaa ate wai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 10:35">Ang gwaara okara kagala kaa iini kai,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 10:35">aa iini ka ogiri wai.<verse eid="MAT 10:35" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 10:36" />Kangza wa itǝ bena ondoo nyana o wa ya nyimi a kwilǝ au.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:36 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MIC 7:6">Mek 7:6</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="MAT 10:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 10:37" />Pate ondooka wa kala yeme ate, na iini wai o kala ong, wata gwara awa itǝ a ong ne. Kangza ondooka wa kala yeme ayana wai alome ka a ai o kala ong, wata gwara awa itǝ aa ong ne. <verse eid="MAT 10:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 10:38" />Nyimia ondooka waata ana uti o gendare o wai a wa tareng ne, wata gwara a wa itǝ a ong ne. <verse eid="MAT 10:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 10:39" />Pate ondooka wa yeme ebeene wai, wayo dera e. Aa pate ondooka wa dera ebeene wai azaa ong, wayo cǝ e.<verse eid="MAT 10:39" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ogole otaasa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 9:41">Mar 9:41</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 10:40" />“Ondooka wa kabare kaa ying, wa kabare kami naname. Kangza, ondooka wa kabare kaa mi wa kabare kaa ondooka wa tongang.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:40 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 9:37">Mar 9:37</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:48">Luk 9:48</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 10:16">10:16</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:20">Yoh 13:20</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="MAT 10:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 10:41" />Ondooka wa emba ondo obeya angmǝ ka mawo Ashili, ka leze le obena wai ondo obeya ngmǝ ka mawo ma Ashili wai, wayo cǝ o taasa ondo obeya angmǝ ka mawo ma Ashili. Ondooka wa kabare kaa ondo o sangsang, ka leze le obena wai ondo o woma wai, wayo cǝ o taasa ondo o sangsang. <verse eid="MAT 10:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 10:42" />Komana wa nya kena ka yende a nyimi ayana aa batebate naa kaso kaa manyi, ka leze le obena wai ondo tare ong nga wai wato dongdong dera o taasa wai ne.”<verse eid="MAT 10:42" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="MAT 11" />
  <para style="s">Yeso ka ana o tare o Yohana o batisma</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 7:18-35">Luk 7:18-35</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 11:1" />Malooka Yeso ka mare ozoola a atoma kai betuuru ka leere name, na ka ere aa rana me na ka ale aaka baale ka o zoola a topepeng to Galili<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:1 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Galili </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ka leleng le maHelena a eze ogole ka topepeng tone</char></note>.<verse eid="MAT 11:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 11:2" />A were me Yohana ko batisma kaya apate aa kwilǝ ana o ezaza epa eburu, nawa kone epa eka Almasipu ya eza me, nawa tong ana o tare o wai ara Yeso <verse eid="MAT 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 11:3" />kane pirkǝ wai na, “Boa ondooka waya deya na, na te kare ayizi a ondo na?”<verse eid="MAT 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 11:4" />Na Yeso kabare nee na, “Kurǝna ka e bekaa Yohana epa eeka ee laka kangza ka ee kaa ekone, <verse eid="MAT 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 11:5" />obena arǝ na cǝ o laka ara, aa agǝdǝ neya teyeno, agangca ne kurǝ a sangsang, arara neya konaza ngmǝ, aa ya arsaza andaaka na gbwizǝ kangza a nya ana o dera cǝ oroka o lebo.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 35:5-6">Ish 35:5-6</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 61:1">61:1</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="MAT 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 11:6" />Ondo okona oleba ondooka waata cǝwǝ aa zaa o eke lenyong le wai aza ong ne.”<verse eid="MAT 11:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 11:7" />Nangka ne ale, na Yeso bore obeya angmǝ ka aromo a cake a zaa Yohana na, “E ale owake nee laka eya? E laka mawake maaka obere ya paba me na? <verse eid="MAT 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 11:8" />Na ee surǝ ka e laka eya? Ondo ka wa amba madibi maa rere na? Aromo akwilǝ ogomo neya ambaza madibi maa rere. <verse eid="MAT 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 11:9" />Na eya ee surǝ a laka me? Ondo obeya angmǝ ka mawo ma Ashili na? Nyimia, eyang bele oying na, wa dongdong kala ondo obeya angmǝ ka mawo ma Ashili. <verse eid="MAT 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 11:10" />Ondo ona a wele aa zaa wai na, “Laka na, ma tong ka o otoma ong kawa kala a izi au, ondooka wayo babarau orona zongka o de.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAL 3:1">Mal 3:1</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="MAT 11:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 11:11" />Eyang dongdong belle oying, ata a tukǝ o ngmenga ondo a nyimi lerambo leena ka wa dukǝ Yohana o batisma ogonga ne, pate kaa nyimi, ondooka kala a be baate a togomo te zaa shili wa kala wai. <verse eid="MAT 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 11:12" />O era a were o Yohana o batisma a deya o ngmeengme togomo te zaa shili teya kala o ara ozitǝ, ana o ote o zitǝ me neya yeme o emba togomo teme ka legoone. <verse eid="MAT 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 11:13" />Nyimia apate ana o baya ngmǝ ka mawo ma Ashili kaa makili maa kaa Ashili a nya Mosa ne beke angmǝ aa zaa togomo te me zongka Yohana de. <verse eid="MAT 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 11:14" />Kangza ee yo kabare ka letoma leena, Yohana waya a beka angmǝ aa zaa wai kaa a bena Iliya ya deya.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAL 4:5">Mal 4:5</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 17:10-13">Mat 17:10-13</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:11-13">Mar 9:11-13</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="MAT 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 11:15" />Pate ondo teto to kona, awa kone.<verse eid="MAT 11:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 11:16" />“Ma erang kedeya aromo awere na keeya? Naa ayana aka neya cikǝ ara ejamane, aane rare eja eceya ene aane beyana,<verse eid="MAT 11:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 11:17" />“‘Te ulubǝ ying tejebe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 11:17">na eta e yowa leera ne,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 11:17">te beya leera le ma'ade</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 11:17">na eta ee ruuzi ne.<verse eid="MAT 11:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 11:18" />Lakana, Yohana wa de wata wa lyeeze aa wa soze ne, nane bekaana, ‘Cai! Waya ka o obere oburu.’ <verse eid="MAT 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 11:19" />Nangka Kena ka Oromo ka de na ka lyeeze aka soze nane bekaana, ‘Laka na ondo okala o ara o lyeeza ka o soza, beja bena o eesa emate makeke ka ana madinǝ!’ Pate kaa nyimi, a ebelo orosa Ashili, aa zaa gole o ai waya a rose edang.”<verse eid="MAT 11:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">O lyǝ udi o topepeng te odera kabare kaa Ashili</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 10:13-15">Luk 10:13-15</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 11:20" />Naka bore ozurki a topepeng teeka ka kala ara o eza ogole o kai o tera ukpwei ne, obena aromo me neta ne kuri aa Ashili ne. <verse eid="MAT 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 11:21" />E lyǝ udi Korasiya! E lyǝ udi Betsaida! Obekaana ogole o tera ukpwei ooka a eze a nyimi ying aa ezea Taya ka Sidon, eeya nee samba o kurǝ aa Ashili ka o rabo aane amba majankale ka o kareze mato apung ane.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 23:1-18">Ish 23:1-18</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 26:1-28:26">Ezek 26:1-28:26</ref>; <ref loc="JOL 3:4-8">Joy 3:4-8</ref>; <ref loc="AMO 1:9-10">Emo 1:9-10</ref>; <ref loc="ZEC 9:2-4">Zak 9:2-4</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="MAT 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 11:22" />Azaa nyimi, eyang belo ying, a lengme lo core angmǝ, ayo kala aa kona egonegone aromo a Taya ka Sidon azaa oying. <verse eid="MAT 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 11:23" />Bo ma Kaparnahum, oya gonta o bena aya zalara o aa zaa shili na? Nyimia taza ne, aya jǝpǝrǝ o araaka ana o gbwizǝ zene. Epa otera ukpwei ka a eze aa nyimi oo, eya aa eze a Sadoma, Sadoma me waayo tata a deya o ngmeengme.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 14:13-15">Ish 14:13-15</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 19:24-28">Obo 19:24-28</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="MAT 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 11:24" />Aza nyimi, eyang bele oying, a lengme le o core angmǝ, ayo kala aa kona egonegone o makeke ma Sadoma baa zaa o.”<verse eid="MAT 11:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Deyana a mi adorana e cǝ o teeseke</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 10:21-22">Luk 10:21-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 11:25" />A were namea Yeso ka bekaana, “Ate maa kona oleba o, Ateokora o zaa shili kaa deze, aa zaa obena ba baasa epaana a na o ama ka o rosa, na ba pari ara andaaka neta rosa eyapa ne. <verse eid="MAT 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 11:26" />Nyimia Ate, enna eya epa eeka e kala o rera aa bo.<verse eid="MAT 11:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 11:27" />Ate ang wa nya ekeeya aa taara tong. Ondo ta rosa kena kame ne soona Ate me, kangza ondo ta rosa Ate me ne soona kena kame, kaa pate ondooka kena kame kaa yeme owore o wai.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 3:35">Yoh 3:35</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 1:18">1:18</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 10:15">10:15</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="MAT 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 11:28" />Deyana me pate o ying ana o zitǝ, ying ana o kona kaa be dengdeng, eyang nya ying o teseke. <verse eid="MAT 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 11:29" />Lyǝ na a lezara leng, ee eze epa eeka ang eze, obena mi ondo o nata ukpwei ya wai, ondooka wata ara ukpwei ne, eyo cǝ o nata anyong. <verse eid="MAT 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 11:30" />Obena lezara leng ta poba ne, magogoro mang kangza ta dengdeng ne.”<verse eid="MAT 11:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="MAT 12" />
  <para style="s">Ateokora Lengme le o teseke maYahuda</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 2:23-28">Mar 2:23-28</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:1-5">Luk 6:1-5</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 12:1" />A were name a lengme le o teseke le maYahuda, Yeso ka dare aa nyimi turu te eyuu. Atoma kai neya kona ekomo, na ne torbe makpwe ma eyuu na ne lye. <verse eid="MAT 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 12:2" />Nangka maParisa ne laka nyimi, na ne beka kai na, “Ba laka atoma au neya eza epa eeka makili ma Mosa ma nare eze a lengme le o teseke le maYahuda.”<verse eid="MAT 12:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 12:3" />Naka bekaa nee na, “Eta e kone epa eeka Daoda ye a were aka ka kone ekomo, kai kaa aja teweno te kai sang? <verse eid="MAT 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 12:4" />Nangka ka lyǝ akwilǝ Ashili naka lye borode emea kata gwara aaka lye, na aja teweno te kai ne lye ne, soona ana magame ma Ashili belle.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 24:9">Mag 24:9</ref>; <ref loc="1SA 21:1-7">1 Sam 21:1-7</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="MAT 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 12:5" />Ying eta e soole a ngmǝ aaka Ashili nya Mosa, nangka ana magame ma Ashili, aa akwilǝ Ashili ne cakate makili ma lengme lo teseke maYahuda aa zaa nyimi ne tambo na?<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 28:9-10">Abal 28:9-10</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="MAT 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 12:6" />Eyang bele oying, kando kamea ka kala akwilǝ Ashili kaana. <verse eid="MAT 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 12:7" />Ayya e rose epa eeka a ngmǝ Ashili ya beyame, ‘Mi o cikǝ egonegonea mi ang yeme aying, o nayi Ashili enama tazane,’ etaa eeyo laka madinǝ mana odera madinǝ ne. <verse eid="MAT 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 12:8" />Obena Kena ka Oromo kaya Ateokora o lengme le o teseke le maYahuda.”<verse eid="MAT 12:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ondooka o ara wai wa waka</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 3:1-6">Mar 3:1-6</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:6-11">Luk 6:6-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 12:9" />Na Yeso baya araname aaka lyǝ odandaro o gwarzanang maYahuda. <verse eid="MAT 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 12:10" />Aa mana oromo yende a rame ooka o ara wai wa waka. Nane pirkǝ Yeso na, “Obaala Mosa wa wore obena wa gwara a womza a lengme le o teseke le maYahuda na?” Ne pirkǝ kai nyimia adorana ne cǝ kai ka o tambo. <verse eid="MAT 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 12:11" />Naka bekaa nee na, “Mana a nyimi oying waaya ka omande openg, na wa taru a leo a lengme lo teseke le maYahuda, wato meke wai kawa sǝǝrǝ ne na? <verse eid="MAT 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 12:12" />Oromo kala omande epeng edang maleu. Azaa nyimi ata aa nara ogole o rere aa lengme teseke maYahuda ne.” <verse eid="MAT 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 12:13" />Naka bekaa oromo me na, “Niyi o ara o!” Nawa niyi ora me, aa wa kuri a zak na o leere me. <verse eid="MAT 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 12:14" />Na maParisa suri, a ne gwaara madoola ma nangka neyo wongha kai.<verse eid="MAT 12:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yeso ozara ka Ashili a zake</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 12:15" />Nangka Yeso rose nyimi, na ka ere arame. Na aromo acake tare kai naka womza ne apat. <verse eid="MAT 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 12:16" />Aa ka windi ne toto na kana ne bele ana ondo ne. <verse eid="MAT 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 12:17" />Aye nyimia ka panza o bekaa ondo beya ngmǝ ka mawo Ashili Ishaya na,<verse eid="MAT 12:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 12:18" />“Kazara kang ang kaana kamea ma zake!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 12:18">Epa oyeme ong, kamea ang kone oleba kai ba cak.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 12:18">Eyang nya kai o bere ong, aa kayo beka ngmǝ a masanto a makeke ma aworme.<verse eid="MAT 12:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 12:19" />Ka too beya masanggo koona ka beye angmǝ a jǝng ne,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 12:19">Kangza ondo too kona lengmelo le kai aza orona ne.<verse eid="MAT 12:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 12:20" />Legaaga leeme le tunggunu katoo pora leene,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 12:20">Beru be masanto bemea bee amara ka o lambu katoo limbǝ be ne,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 12:20">Ka ka ote epeng eme ke lya izi.<verse eid="MAT 12:20" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 12:21" />Aa nyimi leze le kai aworme kangza neyo eke lenyong a kai.”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 42:1-4">Ish 42:1-4</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="MAT 12:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yeso kaa Ba'alzebul</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 3:20-30">Mar 3:20-30</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:14-23">Luk 11:14-23</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 12:22" />Na ca Yeso orakare ka urǝ waze ka wa kang ya ka obere o buru, naka womza wai, nawa bore beya ngmǝ awa kang gonta ara. <verse eid="MAT 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 12:23" />Na epame tere aromo me ukpwei, na ne bekaana, “Kanna Kena Daoda tazane na?”<verse eid="MAT 12:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 12:24" />Nangka maParisa ne kone nyimi na ne bekaana, ka legoone le Ba'alzebul ogomo obere oburua kando kaana kaya sǝrsǝzǝ mabere maburu.”<verse eid="MAT 12:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 12:25" />Nangka Yeso ka rose madoola mane, naka bekaa nee na, “Pate togomo teeka te arnang to dǝkǝni to leere a neya kara ka tukpwei, teyo caro. Kangza apeng koona akwilǝ aaka a arnang to dǝkǝni to leere a neya kara ka tukpwei, ayo rizi. <verse eid="MAT 12:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 12:26" />O Shetan wa sǝǝrǝ o Shetan waya kara ka ukpwei wai naname. Togomo te wai yoya legoone nannia? <verse eid="MAT 12:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 12:27" />Ma sǝrsǝzǝ obere oburu ka legoone le Ba'alzebul, ana o tare o ying ne sǝrsǝzǝ ka legoone le mana? Aa zaa nyimi ana otare oying neya yo core ying angmǝ me. <verse eid="MAT 12:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 12:28" />A ma sǝrsǝzǝ bere o buru ka legoone le obere Ashili na togomo te Ashili te deya aying naname.<verse eid="MAT 12:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 12:29" />A era ta lyǝ aa kwilǝ ondo legoone ka bese magogoro ma wai ne, soona a tese wai suri, aa amaa ama o besa magogoro ma akwilǝ a wai.<verse eid="MAT 12:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 12:30" />Ondooka wata ya legwa kami, ondo o nyana ong nga wai. Kangza ondooka wata kangkamang a kurǝ me ne, waya bacakaraa.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:30 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 9:40">Mar 9:40</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="MAT 12:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 12:31" />Aa zaa nyimi eyang bele oying, ayo pisǝ madinǝ ma aromo apat, ondooka wa sopa o obere Ashili, a to pisǝ madinǝ ma wai ne. <verse eid="MAT 12:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 12:32" />Ondooka wa beya a ngmǝ ma zeelakong aa Kena ka Oromo, ayo pisǝ madinǝ ma wai. Ondooka wa beya a ngmǝ ma zeelakong aa obere Ashili, a to pisǝ madinǝ ma wai a nyimi lerambo leena nanname ka o ale a izi ne.<verse eid="MAT 12:32" /></para>
  <para style="s">Uti kaa ayana wai</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 6:43-45">Luk 6:43-45</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 12:33" />Uti o rere wa ngmenze ayana a rere. Uti oburu wa ngmenze ayana aburu. A rose uti ayana wai ya. <verse eid="MAT 12:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 12:34" />Ying okurkǝnǝng ewa ee buru! Ee wiinia ee beye angmǝ edang, a ying naana ana ara buru ne? Obena epa emea eya nyimi lenyong eya susi o ngmǝ. <verse eid="MAT 12:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 12:35" />Oromo edang, a nyimi lenyong le wai wa eke epa eeke eye ka edang, ondo ara buru o eke lenyong lewai le eburu eya susi a lenyong le wai. <verse eid="MAT 12:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 12:36" />Eyang bele oying, aa lengme le o core angmǝ, pate angmǝ aburu ka oromo wa beya ayo pirkǝ wai. <verse eid="MAT 12:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 12:37" />Angmǝ au aya ayo sǝǝrǝu, aa kangza aya ayo core angmǝ aza o.<verse eid="MAT 12:37" /></para>
  <para style="s">O gera o laka epa o tera ukpwei</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 8:11-12">Mar 8:11-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:29-32">Luk 11:29-32</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 12:38" />Na ana obaala angmǝ aaka Ashili nya Mosa kaa maParisa ne bekaa kai na, “Ondo baala, teya yeme aa te laka epa otera ukpwei aa bo.”<verse eid="MAT 12:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 12:39" />Naka kabare na, “Ying aromo tomore teena, ana leyau ka ara aburu, neya gera o laka epa otera ukpwei, a era ta wore ne epa otera ukpwei ne! Soona epa o tera ukpwei ondo obeya angmǝ ka mawo Ashili Yonana. <verse eid="MAT 12:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 12:40" />Nangka Yonana wa more awa were ka taaro a nyimi lebangi le bekwala bee gong, nyimia Kena ka Oromo kayo ya tomore to taro nyimi ocau. <verse eid="MAT 12:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 12:41" />A lengme le core angmǝ aromo o Neneba neyo era ka aromo tomore teena, ka ne toze aromo a tomore teena kane ta ne ya epa e woma ne, azaa o bena nee kurǝa Ashili aa kazo o ozoola o Yonana. Kangza ondo ka wa kala Yonana waya raana. <verse eid="MAT 12:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 12:42" />A Lengme le o core angmǝ, Aya ogong o makeke ma o Sheba wayo era kaa aromo a tomore teena, ka wa toze ne, o bena wa deya a wa suri a macangcang ma lerambo leena, kawa kone o rosa ogomo Suleimanu. Ondo ka wa kala Suleimanu naana.<verse eid="MAT 12:42" /></para>
  <para style="s">O kurǝ o bere o buru</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 11:24-26">Luk 11:24-26</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 12:43" />Obere o buru wa surǝ nyimi oromo, aa wa kaale araaka manyi ta zane ne azaa o gera ara o teseke. Aa wa ta ocǝ ne, <verse eid="MAT 12:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 12:44" />malo nyimi aa wa bekaana, “Eyang kurǝ akwilǝ aa kaa maa surǝ ne.’ Wa kurǝ wayo mana akwilǝ amea zora ondo nyimi me aa a besa ai aa babare aa sangsang. <verse eid="MAT 12:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 12:45" />A wayo kurǝ kawa jeke mabere maa buru o sondaare maaka ma kala o bora me ara aburu, kane lyǝ ba oromo me aa ne cikǝ a nyimi owai. O maare oromo me wayo kala o bora wai o buru. Nyimia wayo itǝ kaa ana ara aburu a tomore teena.”<verse eid="MAT 12:45" /></para>
  <para style="s">Iini Yeso ka arone kai</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 3:31-35">Mar 3:31-35</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:19-21">Luk 8:19-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 12:46" />Nangka Yeso kaya beya angmǝ kaa aromo a cak naa mana iini ka arone kai aa neya itǝ oo yanga, a neya yeme o beya a ngmǝ kaa kai.” <verse eid="MAT 12:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 12:47" />Na oromo yende bekaa kai na, “Iini kaa arone au, neya oo yanga aa neya yeme o beya a ngmǝ kaa bo.” <verse eid="MAT 12:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 12:48" />Na Yeso kabare na, “Mana iini ong, kaa arone ang?” <verse eid="MAT 12:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MAT 12:49" />Naka niyi o ara kai ana o tare kai, aa ka bekaana, “Andaana iini ong kaa arone ang.” <verse eid="MAT 12:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MAT 12:50" />Komana wa eza epa eeka Ate ang o zaa shili waya yeme me, waya arone ang kaa iini ong.”<verse eid="MAT 12:50" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="MAT 13" />
  <para style="s">Angmǝ gerpo aa aza ondo owaale ebelo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 4:1-9">Mar 4:1-9</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:4-8">Luk 8:4-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 13:1" />A lengme leme na Yeso suri akwilǝ me, naka ale aa ka cikǝ o wulu o lepong. <verse eid="MAT 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 13:2" />Na leguki le aromo leegong deya a kai, naka lyǝ o onggo o tara manyi naka cikǝ. Aa leguki le aromo me kangza ne itǝ o wulu lepong le me.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 5:1-5">Luk 5:1-5</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="MAT 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 13:3" />Naka bele ne mapapa cake aa nyimi angmǝ a gerpo na, “Ondo ogole ara yende wa ale ara aa waale ebelo. <verse eid="MAT 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 13:4" />Nangka waya waale me, na ebelo eyende taru a za orona, na engmeng de nane donge e. <verse eid="MAT 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 13:5" />Na eyende taru aa za acale araaka makeke ta gongha ne. Na e suri a saseya obena makeke arame taa gerpo ne. <verse eid="MAT 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 13:6" />Nangka ongme wa tamana na ma ya rauwo, na ma waka obena madǝrǝ mame taa gerpo ne. <verse eid="MAT 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 13:7" />Ee belo yende kangza taru a nyimi ekana, na ekana me gong na e gatakale e. <verse eid="MAT 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 13:8" />Ee yende kangza taru a makeke ma rere, na ekare eyo, na eye eyo liwinu, liwunu, eyende etuuru taashe, taashe, eyende kangza etuuru taaro, taaro. <verse eid="MAT 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 13:9" />Pate ondooka waye ka toto to konaza a wa kone angmǝ aa na.”<verse eid="MAT 13:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Masanto ma angmǝ aa gerpo aa na</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 4:10-12">Mar 4:10-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:9-10">Luk 8:9-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 13:10" />Na atoma Yeso de, aa ne pirkǝ kai na, “Eyaaka o beya angmǝ aa gerpo ka aromo?” <verse eid="MAT 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 13:11" />Naka kabare ne na, “Ying aa kabare o bena e rose o ela o togomo te Ashili, aa ne ata a nya nee ne. <verse eid="MAT 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 13:12" />O bena ondooka waya ka eyapa waya ayo wala wai ne, ka wa cǝ a cake. Kangza ondo odera eyapa, ee baate kawa ye ka e, ayo emba e a wai. <verse eid="MAT 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 13:13" />Epa eeka e ote na eyang beya ngmǝ gerpo kane,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 13:13">‘Adorana na ne gonte a neta laka ne,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 13:13">aa ne rakara a neta a kona ne,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 13:13">obena epa eme e lyǝ aane amaring.’<verse eid="MAT 13:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 13:14" />Azaa one ayo panza epa eeka ondo beya ngmǝ ka mawo ma Ashili Ishaya wa beke na,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 13:14">“Eyo konaza,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 13:14">aa eto rosa ne dakememe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 13:14">eyo kang gonta</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 13:14">aa eto laka ne ko babate.<verse eid="MAT 13:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 13:15" />Obena anyong aromo ana aya katakau,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 13:15">aa teto tene ta konaza ne.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 13:15">Kangza ne pate ayizi ane,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 13:15">obena kana ne gonte ka ayizi ane ne,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 13:15">kana ne kone ka teto tene ne,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 13:15">obena kana ne cǝ orosa ne,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 13:15">kane kuri a mi kang womza nee ne.’<verse eid="MAT 13:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 13:16" />Ana o kona oleba ying obena ayizi aying aya gonta, a teto teying kangza taya konaza. <verse eid="MAT 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 13:17" />Eyang dongdong baala oying ana obeya angmǝ ka mawo ma Ashili ka ana o kona boome Ashili a cake ne yeme olaka epana eeya gonta me, na ne ta laka ne, aa ne kone epa eeka eya konaza me, na ne ta kona ne.<verse eid="MAT 13:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 13:18" />“Anna masanto ma angmǝ a gerpo ondo o waale ebelo na. <verse eid="MAT 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 13:19" />Pate ondooka wa kona ngmǝ a togomo nawa ta rosa ne, ogomo o bere oburu deese kawa kwagale epaaka a waale a lenyong le wai. Enna ebelo eeka a wale a za orona. <verse eid="MAT 13:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 13:20" />Ebelo eeka ee tǝru ara acale, eya naa ondooka wa kona angmǝ Ashili, nawa embe ka o kona o leba. <verse eid="MAT 13:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 13:21" />Oo bena wata ka oting ne, nawa ta rabo aa cake ne. A were aka o kedeya na opoba wa era, azaa a ngmǝ Ashili, aa oromo me kuri sidimǝ. <verse eid="MAT 13:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 13:22" />Ebelo ee ka e taru a nyimi ekana, eya na ondooka wa kona ngmǝ Ashili, na madoola ma ocǝ ka o kona oleba awere na a nare angmǝ o gongha, ka ngmǝ me itǝ o dera edang. <verse eid="MAT 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 13:23" />Ebelo eemea ee tǝru a makeke ma rere, waya na ondooka wa kone ngmǝ Ashili na wa rose ai, awa eze ogole ka ai. Kangza awa cǝ eyapa aza ame, eyende lewinu, lewinu, eyende etuuru taashe, taashe, ee yende etuuru taaro, taaro.”<verse eid="MAT 13:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">A ngmǝ a gerpo azaa mawake a nyimi o alkama</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 13:24" />Na Yeso kang bele ne angmǝ a gerpo yende na, “Ayo kedeya togomo ta shili ka oromo ooka wa waale ebelo e rere ara awai. <verse eid="MAT 13:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 13:25" />Awere aka aromo neya malau, na oja okara wai ale na wa waale a belo o wake yende ara o alkama me, awa sokoo ale. <verse eid="MAT 13:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 13:26" />Nangka ebelo me e ere na eye eyo, na owake me kang gongha. <verse eid="MAT 13:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 13:27" />Na azara ateakwilǝ me ne de, na ne bekaa wai na, ‘Ateakwilǝ, teya beya na ebelo erere ba waale ara au sang? A wiinia na mawake ma surǝ ara ame? <verse eid="MAT 13:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 13:28" />Nawa kabare ne na, ‘Oja okara waya nyimi.’ Na azara me pirkǝ wai na, ‘Oya yeme aa te ale kate lope mawake mame na?<verse eid="MAT 13:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 13:29" />Aa wa bekaa nee na, ‘Nyimia dai, bayana, tana azaa olopa mawake e gwaara ka o alkama me ne. <verse eid="MAT 13:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 13:30" />Baya na ne aa gong legwa a ale awere o shende. A were o shende me kangza eyang bekaa ana o shende me, kane bore ka oshende mawake mame, a ne kurki mawake mame, aane tese kane ese, aane shende o alkama me ka ne kare aa benga.’ ”<verse eid="MAT 13:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">A ngmǝ a gerpo azaa o yisti ka o mosta</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 4:30-32">Mar 4:30-32</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 13:18-19">Luk 13:18-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 13:31" />Na Yeso bekaa ne a ngmǝ a gerpo kangza na, “Togomo te shili teya baate na beyo be o mosta, emea oromo yende wa ale kawa kpeene ara awai. <verse eid="MAT 13:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 13:32" />Eya kala a bee baate a nyimi eyo, aa ee gongha, e kala kombela uti o marane, kawa itǝ uti oo gong, ka engmeng soze todo ee bana me.<verse eid="MAT 13:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 13:33" />Kangza Yeso ka bele ne angmǝ gerpo yende na, “Togomo te Ashili teye na o yisti, ooka ondaye yende wa jeke nawa sakale ka maso ma taaro ma'ena ma o alkama, na ma sakalnang ka ma o yisti me.<verse eid="MAT 13:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 13:34" />Na Yeso bele okurkǝnǝng aromo, pate epaname a nyimi angmǝ aa gerpo. Kata ka baaleze eyapa ne soona aa nyimi angmǝ gerpo. <verse eid="MAT 13:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 13:35" />Aye nyimia ka panza o bekaa ondo beya ngmǝ mawo Ashili Ishaya na,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 13:35">“Eyang beya angmǝ a nyimi ngmǝ a gerpo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 13:35">Eyang beka epa eeka a baasa obora lerambo.”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:35 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 78:2">Sel 78:2</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="MAT 13:35" /></para>
  <para style="s">Masanto azaa mawake a nyimi o alkama</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 13:36" />Na Yeso baya aromo acake me, aaka lyǝ akwilǝ. Na atoma kai kangza ne deya kai, na ne bekaa na, “Bele ro masanto ma angmǝ gerpo aza mawake ara.”<verse eid="MAT 13:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 13:37" />Aaka kabare na, “Ondo owaale ebelo erere name, waya Kena ka Oromo. <verse eid="MAT 13:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 13:38" />Aa ara ame, aya lerambo leena, ebelo erere name, neya ayana a togomo te Ashili, kangza mawake mame maya ayana ogomo ara a buru. <verse eid="MAT 13:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 13:39" />Oja okara ka wa waale owake, waya ogomo ara a buru. Awere oshende me aya lengme le maare o lerambo leena, ana o shende me neya atoma Ashili o surǝ azaa shili. <verse eid="MAT 13:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 13:40" />Nangka kurki mawake ka ese mai, nyimia wayo itǝ a lengme le omaare. <verse eid="MAT 13:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 13:41" />Kena ka Oromo kayo tonga atoma kai o surǝ azaa shili, kane shende ana o ote aromo kane rizi, kangza kaa pate ana o eza epa eburu, kane sǝǝrǝ ne a nyimi togomo te kai, <verse eid="MAT 13:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 13:42" />kangza kane tare ne a nyimi ola o kpwaiye. A saname neya ruuzi ka o nonza tuuni. <verse eid="MAT 13:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 13:43" />A were namea ana o eza epa erere, masanto mane mayo surǝ na ongme a nyimi togomo te Ate ane. Ondooka waya ka toto to kona, awa kone.”<verse eid="MAT 13:43" /></para>
  <para style="s">A ngmǝ a gerpo azaa ocǝ ka a baasa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 13:44" />Togomo te Ashili teye na ocǝa ka a baasa nyimi ara, ooka ondo wa cǝ nawa kang baasa. A nyimi zanta wai, nawa ale nawa lishi pate epa eeka waye ka e nawa embe ara me.”<verse eid="MAT 13:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 13:45" />Kangza togomo te Ashili teye na ondo ejamanea, ooka waya gera acale aa rere ka aye kaa emate. <verse eid="MAT 13:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 13:46" />Nangka wa cǝ lecale le yende lee rere acak, na wa ale nawa lishi pate epa eeka waye ka e, na wa embe ai.”<verse eid="MAT 13:46" /></para>
  <para style="s">A ngmǝ a gerpo azaa ojara o meese ekwala</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 13:47" />Kangza Togomo te Ashili teye na ojara o meese ekwala ooka tare a lepong, nawa meke kombela ekwala. <verse eid="MAT 13:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 13:48" />Nangka wa pene, naa windi wai o wulu lepong, nane cikǝ ane zake e kwala ee rere e me nane kare a nyimi o kende, aa ne oke eburu me. <verse eid="MAT 13:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MAT 13:49" />Nyimia wayo itǝ a lengme le omare. Atoma Ashili o surǝ azaa shili neyo sǝǝrǝ ana ara aburu nyimi aromo a rere. <verse eid="MAT 13:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MAT 13:50" />Ka ne tare ana ara aburu a nyimi ola o kpwaiye, aa sanamea neyo ruuzi ko nonza tuuni.<verse eid="MAT 13:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="MAT 13:51" />“E rose epaena pate na?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 13:51">Na ne kabare na “Eeye.”<verse eid="MAT 13:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="MAT 13:52" />Naka bekaa nee na, “Pate ondo o baala angmǝ aaka Ashili nya Mosa wa itǝ ondo tare togomo te Ashili, wa itǝ na ateakwilǝ, ondooka wa mangka ocǝ osau ka o kozo ara a le'eke lewai.”<verse eid="MAT 13:52" /></para>
  <para style="s">A nyane Yeso ba Nazarat</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 6:1-6">Mar 6:1-6</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:16-30">Luk 4:16-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="MAT 13:53" />Nangka Yeso ka mare obeya angmǝ aa gerpo name naka baya arame. <verse eid="MAT 13:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="MAT 13:54" />Ko deya a peng kai, naka bore o baala aromo oo dandaro o ogwarzanang one. Na epa me tere ne ukpwei na ne beke na, “Karomo kaana ka cǝ orosa ka epa o tera ukpwei aa ba? <verse eid="MAT 13:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="MAT 13:55" />Teya beyana kanna, kena ka o ondo cocoza sang? Iini kai kaya Mariya sang? Arone kai neya Yakubu, Yusupu, ka Saminu, kangza kaa Yahuda sang? <verse eid="MAT 13:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="MAT 13:56" />Arone kai andaye neya ara yendea kaa ro sang? Karomo kaana ka cǝ epa eena ba? <verse eid="MAT 13:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="MAT 13:57" />Na ne kone oburǝ okai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 13:57">Na Yeso bekaanee na, “Ondo obeya ngmǝ ka mawo Ashili ata kabare ka wai a nyimi apeng awai kaa kwilǝ awai ne. <verse eid="MAT 13:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="MAT 13:58" />Naka ta eza epa otera ukpwei a cake a saname ne, a za odera okabare ka Ashili one.<verse eid="MAT 13:58" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="MAT 14" />
  <para style="s">O gwǝ o Yohana o Batisma</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 6:14-29">Mar 6:14-29</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:7-9">Luk 9:7-9</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 14:1" />A were name Ogomo Hiridus Antipas wa kone oroka azaa Yeso. <verse eid="MAT 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 14:2" />Nawa bekaa azara wai na, “Ondoonaa Yohana o Batisma, waya a ara wai malo ogwǝ, nyimia wa ote na waya kaa o bare o eza epa otera ukpwei na.” <verse eid="MAT 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 14:3" />Obena Hiridus wa meke Yohana na tere wai, aa ote wai a akwilǝ andaleme azaa Herodiya ondaye orone owai Pilibus. <verse eid="MAT 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 14:4" />Azaa bena Yohana wa beeze awai na wa ta gwara awa ana Herodiya ka ka itǝ ondaye wai ne. <verse eid="MAT 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 14:5" />Pate ka o bena Hiridus waya yeme wonga Yohana, aa waya kona boome be aromo, aa ne jeke o bena Yohana ondo beya ngmǝ ka mawo ma Ashili wai.<verse eid="MAT 14:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 14:6" />Nangka lengme le o ngmenga o Hiridus le dukǝ, na kagala ka Herodiya ka yo leera a begeshe be aromo kane de ara o zǝnggǝ me, na Hiridus kone oleba maleo, <verse eid="MAT 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 14:7" />nawa tono a kai na wayo nya kai pate epa eeka ka bosa. <verse eid="MAT 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 14:8" />Na iini kai bekaa kai na ale ka o bekaana, “A nyau ukpwei o Yohana o Batisma nannameena a nyimi oso.” <verse eid="MAT 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 14:9" />Na ogomo kone oburu, aza obena wa tono abegeshe be ageng wai, nawa ote na a nya kai epa eeka kaa bosa. <verse eid="MAT 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 14:10" />Nawa tong na core ukpwei o Yohana a akwilǝ andaleme, <verse eid="MAT 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 14:11" />na de ka ukpwei me a nyimi oso na nya kagala ka me, na ka ca iini kai. <verse eid="MAT 14:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 14:12" />Na ana o tare Yohana de nane ana ekeze me, na ne taashe, aa ne ale na ne beka Yeso.<verse eid="MAT 14:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yeso ka lye ka aromo magu esu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 6:30-44">Mar 6:30-44</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:10-17">Luk 9:10-17</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 6:1-14">Yoh 6:1-14</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 14:13" />Nangka Yeso ka kone nyimi, naka ere naka lyǝ o onggo o taara manyi aaka ale ara aaka aromo ta rene ne ka ka cikǝ a yende. Nangka aromo acak ne kone nyimi, na ne surǝ a topepeng na ne tare kai a tobona. <verse eid="MAT 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 14:14" />Ka o surǝ kai o onggo o tara manyi naka laka leguki le aromo. Naka kone egonegone o ne, naka womza ana makono nyimi o ne.<verse eid="MAT 14:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 14:15" />Nangka ulyǝlu waye, na atoma kai de akai na ne bekaa na, “Ara na a aromo ta rene ne, a waana ulyǝlu waya. Baya aromo ana ane ale a topepeng kane gere tukpwei tone epaolya.”<verse eid="MAT 14:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 14:16" />Na Yeso bekaa ne na, “Wata gwara aane ale ne, nyana ne eyapa ka ne lye.”<verse eid="MAT 14:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 14:17" />Na ne kabare na, “Teta ka eyapa arakaname, soona maborode esu ka ekwala e leere.”<verse eid="MAT 14:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Maborode esu ka ekwala leere</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 14:18" />Na ka bekaa na, “Deyana ka e arakaana.” <verse eid="MAT 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 14:19" />Aaka ote aromo me na ne cikǝ azaa mawake. Naka jeke, maborode esu ka ekwala leere, naka ara ukpwei aaza shili, aaka sabe Ashili, naka pose maborode mame aaka nyaza atoma kai, a atoma me kangza aa ne nyaza aromo. <verse eid="MAT 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 14:20" />A pate one ne lye na ne tiyǝ, na ne kurki o dangare me, nawa panza makende betuuru ka maleere. <verse eid="MAT 14:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 14:21" />Andaaka ne lye ne dukǝ andaleme magu esu bangka andaye ka ayana.<verse eid="MAT 14:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yeso ka yeng azaa manyi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 6:45-52">Mar 6:45-52</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 6:16-21">Yoh 6:16-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 14:22" />Ka o mara me naka ote atoma kai na ne lyǝ o onggo o tara manyi ka ne kaana kai a ale owulu o sara yende. Aa kai ka itǝ a dimǝ ka ka laka o aleze a tokwilǝ te aromo me. <verse eid="MAT 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 14:23" />Malo ale aromo me, naka zale oyara kai a yende kaka beye angmǝ ka Ashili. Na ulyǝlu ye aa kaya yende saname. <verse eid="MAT 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 14:24" />A wereme o onggo o taara manyi waya tera lepong, na sejǝng se manyi se ere ka legoone, obena obere me waya kara ka ne.<verse eid="MAT 14:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 14:25" />Aa ra aa dukǝ beru bo taaro be lelere, na Yeso yeng azaa manyi aaka dore ne. <verse eid="MAT 14:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 14:26" />Nangka atoma ne laka kai aa yenga azaa manyi na boome meke ne nane bekaana, “Bebua be!” Nane gware bekoko azaa obena nee kona boome. <verse eid="MAT 14:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 14:27" />A saseya naka bekaa nee na, “Kane kone boome ne Mea. Kane kone boome ne.” <verse eid="MAT 14:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 14:28" />Na Biturusu kabare wai na, “Ateokora boa baaza, oteng kang deya bo aa yenga azaa manyi.”<verse eid="MAT 14:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 14:29" />Na Yeso bekaa wai na, “Deya.” Na Biturusu suri o onggo o taara manyi, nawa yeng azaa manyi a wa dore Yeso. <verse eid="MAT 14:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 14:30" />Awereaka wa laka obere wa ere a jǝng nawa kone boome. Nangka manyi ma bore dongha wai nawa rurai, awa bekaa na, “Ateokora bozang!” <verse eid="MAT 14:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 14:31" />Aa saseya na Yeso nayi o ara naka meke wai, aaka bekaa wai na, “Bo o kabare ka Ashili au wa sawa, eya e ote na ba dambaraza?” <verse eid="MAT 14:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 14:32" />Ka o lyǝ one o onggo o taara manyi na obere me tete. <verse eid="MAT 14:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 14:33" />Andaaka neya a nyimi onggo o tara manyi ma me na ne girwǝ ane bekaa na, “Bo dongdong, Kena ka Ashili kai!”<verse eid="MAT 14:33" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yeso ka womza ana o dera o kona zake aa Janasarata</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 6:53-56">Mar 6:53-56</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 14:34" />Nangka ne tare opong ome, na ne lyǝ a makeke ma Janasarata. <verse eid="MAT 14:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 14:35" />Nangka aromo apeng me ne rose bena Yesoa kai, na ne tongze a kombela aromo apat a topepeng te ma'amo, na ne casa kai ana makono, <verse eid="MAT 14:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 14:36" />Na ne boshe kai na ka kabare aa ne cocome edǝki odibi kai. Pate andaaka ne cocome na ne woma.<verse eid="MAT 14:36" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="MAT 15" />
  <para style="s">Makili ma anateandaasau</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 7:1-13">Mar 7:1-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 15:1" />Na ana ondo ba nyimi maParisa kaa ana o baala angmǝ aka Ashili a nya Mosa nane deya Yeso a ne surǝ ba Urushalima nane bekaa na, <verse eid="MAT 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 15:2" />“Eyaaka atoma au neta tare makili mana Anateandaasau ne? O bena neta sabozo zongka ne lye epaolya ne.”<verse eid="MAT 15:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 15:3" />Na Yeso kabare nee na, “Eyaaka ying eta tare makili ma Ashili ne e tare makili maying? <verse eid="MAT 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 15:4" />Ashili a bekaa na, ‘Tare ate au, ka iini au, kangza pate ondooka wa zeela ate ka iini wai wa gwara aa wongha wai.’<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 20:12">Osur 20:12</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 21:17">21:17</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 5:16">Otik 5:16</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 20:9">Mag 20:9</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="MAT 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 15:5" />Ying e baale na, ‘Pate ondooka wa bekaa ate ka iini wai na, epaaka maa ya kankama oying ka e, ma nya Ashili,’ <verse eid="MAT 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 15:6" />wa nyana otare ate kaa iini wai ka e ne, azaa nyimi ee cakate angmǝ Ashili azaa makili maying naname. <verse eid="MAT 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 15:7" />Ying ana rendaza, Ishaya ondo beya angmǝ ka mawo ma Ashili wa beke oroka Ashili aza oying aa kap na,<verse eid="MAT 15:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 15:8" />“Aromo ana, ne tareng ka ongmǝ belle,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 15:8">aa nyimi anyong ane neya macangcang kaa mi.<verse eid="MAT 15:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 15:9" />O girwǝ one aa mi taa ka edang ne,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 15:9">obaala one o tare makili ma aromo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 15:9">o bena aya angmǝ Ashili.”<verse eid="MAT 15:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mapa maaka ma care oromo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 7:1-13">Mar 7:1-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 15:10" />Na Yeso rare o kurkǝnǝng aromo acak, aa ka bekaa nee na, “Konana ekang rosa. <verse eid="MAT 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 15:11" />Epa eeka e lyǝzǝ ongmǝ oromo eta ote ka wa ye ka madinǝ ne, soona epa eeka e susi ba ongmǝ eya ote ka oromo wa itǝ ka madinǝ.” <verse eid="MAT 15:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 15:12" />Na atoma kai ne deya kai nane bekaa kai na, “Orose obena maParisa ne kona o burǝ ka ne kona a angmǝ aa na?” <verse eid="MAT 15:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 15:13" />Na Yeso kabare na, “Pate epa eeka Ate ang o zaa shili ta wa gata ne, ayo mukǝ. <verse eid="MAT 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 15:14" />Arnang ka ne, ne arǝ ne ka neya windǝ arǝ lebenda. Urǝ wa windǝ urǝ lebenda, pate one neya kala a le'o.”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 6:39">Luk 6:39</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="MAT 15:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 15:15" />Na Biturusu bekaa na, “Bele ro masanto ma angmǝ aa gerpo ana ka ba beka.”<verse eid="MAT 15:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 15:16" />Na Yeso pirkǝ nee na, “A alea aa were aana e tata a maring na? <verse eid="MAT 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 15:17" />Eta rosa obena pate epa eeka e lyǝ ongmǝ e ale a lebangi e suri ba lepung sang? <verse eid="MAT 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 15:18" />A epaaka e susi ba ongmǝ e suri ba lenyong. Epa o susǝ a lenyong leme eya ote oromo ka wa itǝ ka madinǝ a begeshe ba Ashili. <verse eid="MAT 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 15:19" />Azaa o bena aa nyimi lenyong leyaa sǝrsǝzǝ madoola maa buru. Naa, o wongha oromo, o mora kaa ondaye ondo, o mora kaa Ogala, o eza bekǝri, o ana angmǝ, ka o cara leze. <verse eid="MAT 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 15:20" />Ennaa ote oromo kawa itǝ ka madinǝ a begeshe ba Ashili, o lya epa olya zora o sabo waya ta ote ka oromo waye ka madinǝ a begeshe ba Ashili ne.”<verse eid="MAT 15:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">O eke lenyong a Ashili ondaaye o makeke ma Kan'ana</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 7:24-30">Mar 7:24-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 15:21" />Nangka Yeso ka baya arakaname, naka ale a makeke ma Taya ka Sidon. <verse eid="MAT 15:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 15:22" />Na ondaye yende ka makeke ma Kan'ana deya a Yeso ka oruuzi na, “Kona egonegone eng Ateokora, kena ka Daoda, bozang, kagala kang obere o buru ooka waya nyimi kai waya zo gara kai.”<verse eid="MAT 15:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 15:23" />Na Yeso ta beka eyapa a wai ne. Aza nyimi na atoma kai ne deya a kai nane bosa kai na, “Tarangga wai kawa ale waya tare oro awa gare ro ka be koko.”<verse eid="MAT 15:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 15:24" />Naka kabare na, “Mi aa tonghang azaa emande epeng e Isrela kane wilǝ belle.”<verse eid="MAT 15:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 15:25" />Na ondaye ome wa deya nawa girwǝ ba ting kai aaka bose kai kangza na, “Ateokora kangkamang!” <verse eid="MAT 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 15:26" />Na Yeso kabare na, “Wata gwara a jeke epa olya ayana ka kare e ere ne.”<verse eid="MAT 15:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 15:27" />Na ondaaye me bekaa na, “Nyimia Ateokora, pate kaa nyimi, e ere donge ma ngmeskarong maaka ma taaru ba deze araaka ateakwilǝ lyeeze epa olya ne.”<verse eid="MAT 15:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yeso ka lye ka aromo magu ma naaze</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 15:28" />Na Yeso kabare naka bekaa ondaye me na, “Ondaye o eke lenyong leo ba Ashili wa gong, baya epa eeka oya gera me, e itǝ nyimi.” Ka o bekaa nyimi na obere oburu me wa arnang ka kagala kame.<verse eid="MAT 15:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yeso ka womza aromo aa cake</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 15:29" />Nangka Yeso ka baya a rame naka tare bee dǝki lepong le Galili. Naka zale ba zaa oyara naka cikǝ ba saname. <verse eid="MAT 15:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 15:30" />Na aromo acak ne deya kai. Nane de kaa ana ozantǝ, arǝ, agǝdǝ, ka arara, aa ana ondo ba cak, nane eke ne aa begeshe be Yeso naka womza ne. <verse eid="MAT 15:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 15:31" />Na epame tere apate aromo tukpwei azaa obena arara neya beya ngmǝ, agǝdǝ ya teweno, arǝ neya gonta, na pate one ne saba Ashili a maIsrela.<verse eid="MAT 15:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yeso ka lye kaa aromo magu ma naaze</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 8:1">Mar 8:1</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 15:32" />Azaa nyimi na Yeso ka rare atoma o kai naka bekaa nee na, “Eyang kona egonegone aromo aana, tomore to taaro naana o ngmeengme teye legwa kaane aa neta ne lya epa olya ne, kangza anta yeme o baya one aane ale ekomo ne adorana tana ne sau orona ne.”<verse eid="MAT 15:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 15:33" />Na atoma kai ne kabare nane bekaa kai na, “A baba te era a te cǝ epaolya a nyimi lerambo leena kate nya aromo acake aana?”<verse eid="MAT 15:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 15:34" />Na Yeso pirkǝ nee na, “Ma borode ma wondaa eye kaa mai?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 15:34">Nane kabare na, “O sondaare kaa ekwala a baate.”<verse eid="MAT 15:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 15:35" />Naka ote aromo aa cake name nane cikǝ ba deze, <verse eid="MAT 15:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 15:36" />Nangka ka jeke maborode o sondaare ka ekwala me, naka wore o kona oleba ba Ashili, aaka pose mai aaka nya atoma kai, na nee kangza ne arseze aromo amea ne kurkǝnǝng. <verse eid="MAT 15:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 15:37" />Pate one ne lye na komana one tii, na atoma kurki ma ngmeskarong maaka ma lyǝ nama panza makende ma moole sondaare. <verse eid="MAT 15:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 15:38" />O gongha aromo aaka ne lye epaolya me ne dukǝ andaleme magu ma naaze bangka andaye kaa ayana. <verse eid="MAT 15:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 15:39" />Malo arnang ka aromo me, naka zale o onggo o taara manyi naka ale a makeke ma magadan.<verse eid="MAT 15:39" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="MAT 16" />
  <para style="s">Ogera epa otera ukpwei</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 8:11-13">Mar 8:11-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 12:54-56">Luk 12:54-56</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 16:1" />Na maParisa kaa maSadukiya ne deya a Yeso adorana ne kedeya kai, nane bose kai ka ka wore ne epa o tera ukpwei ooka wayo wore o bare o kai. <verse eid="MAT 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 16:2" />Naka kabare nee na, “Ulyǝlu waaya, ke laka azaa shili aaya aa ganggo e bekaana, ‘Ahaa, ara yo ya aa sangsang leere.’ <verse eid="MAT 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 16:3" />Ara a sana a leleere kangza e laka azaa shili aya a ganggo, na masanto mame maa kabare kuruwǝ ee bena, ‘Ulyi wayo ngmeza o ngmeengme.’ E ama orosa nangka zaa shili ze, aa eta ama orosa epaeka awere ana ya nyimi me ne. <verse eid="MAT 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 16:4" />Aromo awere ana, ana odera o tare Ashili, ana leyau, ana a nyong aburu, ana ogera epa otera ukpwei, aa ato wore ne epa o tera ukpwei ne, soona e Yonana.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 16:4">Na Yeso arnang ka ne a ka ale.<verse eid="MAT 16:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">O yisti o maParisa ka maSadukiya</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 8:14-21">Mar 8:14-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 16:5" />Nangka atoma Yeso ne cakate aa ale owulu lepong leme, nane winǝ o jeka oborode. <verse eid="MAT 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 16:6" />Na Yeso bekaa ne naa, “Eza na ba sauwo, ka o yisti o maParisa kaa o maSadukiya.”<verse eid="MAT 16:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 16:7" />Na ne bore o pirǝ tukpwei tone na, “Ka beka epaana ba eza azaa obena teta te deya ko borode ne na?”<verse eid="MAT 16:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 16:8" />Nangka Yeso ka laka nyimi, a ka rose madoola mane naka beka nee na, “Ying ana o kabare kaa mi aa baate, eyaaka eya masanggo obena eta ka o borode ne? <verse eid="MAT 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 16:9" />Aa deya wereena e tata a maring na? E winǝ nangka ma lye ka aromo magu esu ka a agwataka ma o borode maaname esu sang? Makende ma wonda e panza kaa maa epa eeka e lyǝ? <verse eid="MAT 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 16:10" />Koona awere aaka ma lye ka aromo magu ma naaze ka ma borode o sondaare, makende ma wonda e panza kaa epa eeka e lyǝ? <verse eid="MAT 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 16:11" />Eyaka eta ama o rosa obena anta beya oroka aza o borode ne? Epa eka eyang yeme e rose eya ezana ba sauwo ka o yisti o maParisa kaa maSadukiya.” <verse eid="MAT 16:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 16:12" />Arakanamea atoma Yeso ne rose obena kataa beya a zo yisti o kareze ba o borode ne, aa kaya beya kane eza ba sauwo kaa obaala maParisa kaa maSadukiya.<verse eid="MAT 16:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Biturusu wa wore o kabare kaa Kiristi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 8:27-30">Mar 8:27-30</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:18-21">Luk 9:18-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 16:13" />Nangka Yeso ka de aa bekazo be makeke ma Kaisariya o Pilibi, naka pirkǝ atoma kai na, “Aromo ne beya kena ka oromo na mana kai?”<verse eid="MAT 16:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 16:14" />Na ne kabare na, “Ana ondo ne beya na Yohana o Batisma, aana ondo beya na Iliya, aana ondo kangza beya naa, Irimiya, na ondo ba nyimi ana o beya angmǝ kama mawo ma Ashili.”<verse eid="MAT 16:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 16:15" />Naka pirkǝ nee na, “A ying pa, e beye na mia mana?” <verse eid="MAT 16:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 16:16" />Na Siman Biturusu kabare na, “Boa Almasipu, Kena ka Ashili ondo ebeene.” <verse eid="MAT 16:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 16:17" />Na Yeso kabare naka bekaa wai na, “Bo ondo kona oleba wai, Siman kena ka Yonana! Obena oromo ka lepung ka manyau waya ta waa belo ne, soona Ate ang omea waya nyimia shili. <verse eid="MAT 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 16:18" />Eyang bele au, boa Biturusu, azaa lecale leena eyang sowa akwilǝ ang, aaka legoone le ogbwǝ leto ama kaa ai ne. <verse eid="MAT 16:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 16:19" />Eyang nyau becapa be togomo to shili. Kangza epaaka ba tera a lerambo leena, eyo itǝ nyimi ba zaa shili, a epaaka ba dinggǝ a lerambo leena eyo itǝ ka o dinggǝ a nyimia shili.” <verse eid="MAT 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 16:20" />Naka windi atoma kai toto na tana ne bele ondo na kai ya Almasipu ne.<verse eid="MAT 16:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yeso ka bele nangka kayo gbwǝ</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 8:31-9:1">Mar 8:31-9:1</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:22-27">Luk 9:22-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 16:21" />Oo era lengme lenname na ka bore o wore atoma kai na kayo dongdong ale ba Urushalima, a sanamea kayo lyǝ kombela o zitǝ aa taara te anateandasau, kaa ana magame ma Ashili, kaa ana obaala angmǝ ka Ashili a nya Mosa, kangza aane wongha kai, aa lengme le o taaro aaka era ka ebeene.”<verse eid="MAT 16:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 16:22" />Na Biturusu kuri ka Yeso aa sara yende nawa zurki kai na, “Tana Ashili baya epaana eye ne, Ateokora! Enna to manau ne.” <verse eid="MAT 16:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 16:23" />Na Yeso ringgarnu naka beka a Biturusu na, “Arnang kaa mi, Shetan! Bo epaa o ote ong kang cǝwǝ, bo o eze madoola mau ma oromoa, ma Ashili ta za ne.”<verse eid="MAT 16:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 16:24" />Na Yeso ka bekaa atoma kai na, “Pate ondooka waya yeme o tare ong, awa nyane ukpwei o wai a wa ana uti o gendare o wai a wa tareng. <verse eid="MAT 16:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 16:25" />Pate ondooka waya yeme o boza ebeene e wai, wayo dera e. Aa ondooka wayo dera ebeene e wai a za ong, wayo cǝ e. <verse eid="MAT 16:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 16:26" />Ebelo epa edang ngha oromo yo cǝ, wa cǝ pate lerambo leena a wa dera ebene e wai? Eya oromo wa era wa nya aa bekazo be ebeene e wai? <verse eid="MAT 16:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 16:27" />Kena ka oromo kaya deya ka togomo te Ate o kai kaa aa toma ozaa shili, kangza kayo nya komana epaaka e itǝ e wai a zo ogole omea komana wa eza. <verse eid="MAT 16:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 16:28" />“Ang dongdong bele ying, ana ondo ka neya itǝ arakana neto gbwǝ ne, seeka ne laka o deya kena ka Oromo ba nyimi togomo te kai.”<verse eid="MAT 16:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="MAT 17" />
  <para style="s">Lepung le Yeso sara</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 9:2-13">Mar 9:2-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:28-36">Luk 9:28-36</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 17:1" />Malo tomore o taashe na Yeso ka jeke Biturusu, ka Yakubu, a orone kai oka a beya wai na Yohana, naka ale kaa ne o oyara o yende oo zaati, na ne cikǝ saname ne belle. <verse eid="MAT 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 17:2" />Na nangka kaze, sara aa begeshe bene, na mainu ma kai ma santo na ongme, aa madibi maaka ka amba, na ma itǝ maa peng. <verse eid="MAT 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 17:3" />Na ongmere liizi, na ana o beya angmǝ ka mawo ma Ashili Mosa ka Iliya ne surǝ baa tera one a neya beya angmǝ ka Yeso.<verse eid="MAT 17:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 17:4" />Na Biturusu beka Yeso na, “Ateokora, wa gwara ka teye arakana. Ba kabare ang sowa mapuki ma taaro arakana, oyende a au, a oyende o Mosa a oyende kangza o Iliya.”<verse eid="MAT 17:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 17:5" />Waya zo beya angmǝ naname na owere yende oma santo wa urǝ ne, aane kone lengmelo le yende ba nyimi owere me a le beka na, “Kando kaana kena kang, ka oyeme ong maleo, ang kang kona oleba kai. Konana kai!”<verse eid="MAT 17:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 17:6" />Nangka atoma kai ne kone nyimi na boome moke ne maleu, na ne rizi baa deze. <verse eid="MAT 17:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 17:7" />Na Yeso ka de naka cokome ne aaka bekaa nee na, “Erana a itǝ, tane kone boome ne.” <verse eid="MAT 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 17:8" />Nangka ne ara tukpwei, nane ta laka ondo ne soona Yeso kai aa yende.<verse eid="MAT 17:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 17:9" />Aa neya zo jipi oyara me, na Yeso ka windi ne toto na, “Tane bele ondo epaaka e laka ne, soona aa ara Kena ka Oromo malo ogbwǝ kai.”<verse eid="MAT 17:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 17:10" />Na atoma kai ne pirkǝ kai na, “Nyimia waaza, eyaka ana o baala angmǝ aaka Ashili a nyana Mosa ne beeze na dongdong Otoma Ashili Iliya waya yaa deya o bora?”<verse eid="MAT 17:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 17:11" />Na Yeso kabare na, “Iliya wayo dongdong deya kawa babara ekeeya. <verse eid="MAT 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 17:12" />Pate ka nyimi eyang bele oying, Iliya wa samba o deya, na eta ee rose naa waya ne, nane eze wai epaaka ne ama o ezaa me. Nyimia kangza Kena ka Oromo yo zitǝ ba taara tone.”<verse eid="MAT 17:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 17:13" />Na atoma Yeso ne rose obena kaya beya one a ngmǝ ba zaa Yohana ondo batisma.<verse eid="MAT 17:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yeso ka womza kena kamea obere o buru wa taba kai</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 9:14-29">Mar 9:14-29</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:37-43">Luk 9:37-43</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 17:14" />Nangka ne dukǝ araaka aromo ne gwarnang ne, na oromo yende wa deya Yeso nawa girwǝ ba begeshe be kai awa bekaa na, <verse eid="MAT 17:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 17:15" />“Ateokora, kona egonegone kena kang, ka ya ka letaranggi, kangza leya gǝǝzǝ kai maleo. Le rabo aa peere okai a nyimi ola kaa nyimi manyi. <verse eid="MAT 17:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 17:16" />Nang ale ka kai a atoma au, nane ta ama o womza kai ne.”<verse eid="MAT 17:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 17:17" />Na Yeso kabare naka bekaa na, “Ying aromo awereena, ana o dera o kabare ka Ashili, kangza ana ara aburu! Aa alea aa werea yemea eyang cikǝ ba nyimi oying? Aa alea aa werea yemea ang motana ka ying? Deyana ka kai arakana.” <verse eid="MAT 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 17:18" />Na Yeso ka zurki obere oburu me, na obere oburu me wa arnang ka kena kame. Na o ngmere liizi na kena kame ka woma.<verse eid="MAT 17:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 17:19" />Na atoma Yeso ne deya kai ba sara yende, na ne pirkǝ kai na, “Eyaka teta te ama o sǝǝrǝ obere oburu me ne?” <verse eid="MAT 17:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 17:20" />Na Yeso bekaa nee na, “O kabare ka Ashili oying wata gongha ne. Eyang dongdong bele oying, eeya ka o kabare kaa Ashili na beyo bee baate be o mosta, eyo ama bekaa oyara na wa mukuru araaka wa zene, kawa ye nyimi. Eyapa eto girǝ ying ne. <verse eid="MAT 17:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 17:21" />Ebelo onname, wata susǝ ne soona ka obeya angmǝ ka Ashili kangza ka opate ongmǝ.”<verse eid="MAT 17:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yeso ka wale o beka angmǝ azaa o gbwǝ kai</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 9:30-32">Mar 9:30-32</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:43-45">Luk 9:43-45</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 17:22" />Nangka atoma Yeso ne kurkǝnǝng a makeke ma Galili, na Yeso ka bekaa nee na, “Ayo nya Kena ka Oromo ba taara ta aromo, <verse eid="MAT 17:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 17:23" />neyo wongha kai. Aa lengme lo taaro kangza ayo ara kai.” Na pate one ne kone oburǝ.<verse eid="MAT 17:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">O ara emate makeke</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 17:24" />Malooka Yeso kaa atoma kai ne dukǝ Kaparnahum, na ana o eesa e mate akwilǝ Ashili nane mana Biturusu, na ne pirkǝ wai na, “Ondo baala oying wata nyaza emate akwilǝ Ashili ne na?”<verse eid="MAT 17:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 17:25" />Nawa bekaa na, “Ka arseze. “Nangka wa kurǝ ba akwilǝ, na Yeso bora o beya angmǝ ka wai naka beka na, “Ba laka nannia Siman Biturusu azaa be pirǝ beena? Aana mana agomo lerambo leena ne eesa emate e makeke ne, ara ayana anea naa, ana ondoai?” <verse eid="MAT 17:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 17:26" />Na Biturusu kabare na, “Aana ondo,” na Yeso bekaa na, “Obena ayana ane ta arsaza ne. <verse eid="MAT 17:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 17:27" />Pate ka nyimi, adorana tana aromo me ne mungi kaa ro ne, ale ba lepong ka o tare beruu be omeese ekwala, bekwala beeka baa bora a moke me o pǝri ongmǝ be oyo cǝ emate eeka eyo bare. O jeke mate me ka o are e mate makeke mau kaa a‘eng.”<verse eid="MAT 17:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="MAT 18" />
  <para style="s">Be pirǝ azaa ondo o kala o gongha</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 9:33-37">Mar 9:33-37</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:46-48">Luk 9:46-48</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 18:1" />Awere name na atoma Yeso ne deya akai, nane pirkǝ na, “Mana kala o gongha a nyimi togomo te zaa shili?” <verse eid="MAT 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 18:2" />Naka rare kena ka baate ka yende, naka eke kai baa tera one, <verse eid="MAT 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 18:3" />aka bekaa na, “Eyang dongdong bele oying, eeta kurǝ ka e itǝ naa abana ayana aana ne, eto lyǝ ba togomo ta zaa shili ne. <verse eid="MAT 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 18:4" />Pate ondooka wa jipǝrǝ ukpwei wai naa ka bana kena kaana, waya wa kala o gongha a togomo te zaa shili. <verse eid="MAT 18:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 18:5" />Pate ondooka wa kabare ka kabana kena naa kaana, mia wa embang.”<verse eid="MAT 18:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mapapa ma o ote o cǝwǝ</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 9:42-48">Mar 9:42-48</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 17:1-2">Luk 17:1-2</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 18:6" />Pate ka nyimi, ondooka wa ote kena ka yende ba nyimi abana ayana aaka ne kabare kaa mi ka ka ye madinǝ, wayo kala aa tere wai onyanto aa lengmelo, a tare wai ba nyimi o pong o gerpo.”<verse eid="MAT 18:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 18:7" />Ee lyǝ udi lerambo, aza epa eeka e oteze aromo kane ye madinǝ! Dongdong ngha ebelo epaana eye, pate ka nyimi ondo ote ka a cǝwǝ, wa lyǝ udi. <verse eid="MAT 18:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 18:8" />Aa o ara o, na obona o, wa ote ka o lyǝ a madinǝ, mara o core wa ka opere. Wa kala o lyǝ ara e ebeene o dera o maro kaa o ara yende, na obona yende, na ka legǝdǝ, koo bena tareo ola kaa wata lumbuzu ne ka tobona to leere, ka taara te leere teo a pate. <verse eid="MAT 18:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 18:9" />Kangza Liizi leo le otezeo ko lyǝ a madinǝ lopa le ka o pere. Wa gwara o lyǝ ara ebene o dera o maro ka liizi le yende, ka o bena o ale akwilǝ ola ka yizi leere.”<verse eid="MAT 18:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">A ngmǝ aa gerpo azaa o mande openg kawa wilǝ</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 15:3-7">Luk 15:3-7</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 18:10" />“Ekena toto, tane zeele kena ka yende baa nyimia ayana na ne. Eyang belo ying, atoma ane o dera apung o nyimia shili ne gonte mainu ma Ate ang omea waya nyimia shili konang were. <verse eid="MAT 18:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 18:11" />Obena Kena ka Oromo ka deya ka ka boze andaaka ne wilǝ. <verse eid="MAT 18:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 18:12" />“Eya madoola maying? Ondo waya ka emande lewinu, na kayende ka wilǝ, wato baya etuuru torai ka o torai name aa ting oyara aa wa ale ba gera ka yende kanname sang? <verse eid="MAT 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 18:13" />Wa cǝ kai, eyang dongdong bele oying, wayo kona oleba maleo o kala etuuru torai ka otorai eeka eta e wilǝ ne. <verse eid="MAT 18:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 18:14" />Nyimia, Ate oying azaa shili wato kona oleba a kena ka yende ba nyimi ayana na ka wili ne.”<verse eid="MAT 18:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Orone ka wa tambo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 17:3">Luk 17:3</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 18:15" />“Aa orone o wa yau tambo bo, o ale ka o bele wai epaaka wa yau, ying ngha leere belle. Wa kona epaaka ba bele wai, baa kuriyǝ orone o orona naname. <verse eid="MAT 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 18:16" />Waata konau ne, o ale ka oromo yende na a leere kane laka aane kone, adorana angmǝ me itǝ ka ma ganggang a begeshe be aromo leere, na a taaro. <verse eid="MAT 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 18:17" />Wa nyana kona one, o bele akwilǝ ana o tare Ashili, kangza waata kona nee ne, o kuriyǝ wai a nyimi andaaka neta rosa Ashili ne na ondo eesa emate o makeke.”<verse eid="MAT 18:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 18:18" />“Eyang dongdong bele oying, pate epaaka e tera a lerambo leena, awa itǝ epaaka a samba o tera me ba zaa shili. Pate epaaka e dinggǝ a lerambo leena, eyo itǝ ka o dinggǝ a zaa shili.<verse eid="MAT 18:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 18:19" />“Eyang dongdong wala o bele oying na, aromo leere ba nyimi lerambo leena ne kabare ka tukpwei tone ba za epaaka neya bosa me, Ate ang omea waya nyimia zaa shili wayo nya ne. <verse eid="MAT 18:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 18:20" />Pate araaka aromo leere, na a taaro ne gwarnang ba nyimi leze leng, eyang cikǝ legwa kaa ne.”<verse eid="MAT 18:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ozara ooka wata pisǝzǝ epa eeka ya wa ne</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 18:21" />Na Biturusu paka ting Yeso nawa pirkǝ na, “Ateokora, ka wondaa orone ong wa tambo a mi ang pisi wai? Ka o sondaare na?” <verse eid="MAT 18:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 18:22" />Na Yeso bekaa na, “Ka o sondaare belle dai, ka o sondaarea o dukǝa etuuru sondaare.<verse eid="MAT 18:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 18:23" />“Aza nyimi ayo kedeya togomo te a zaa shili ka ogomo omea waya yeme o eza abalo ocǝ wai ka eeya taara te azara wai. <verse eid="MAT 18:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 18:24" />Nangka wa bore obala ocǝ wai me, naa de ka ondo omea ogomo me tare wai emate magu betuuru. <verse eid="MAT 18:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 18:25" />O bena wato ama o ara me ne, na ateakwilǝ wai wa ote ka a lishi wai ka ondaye wai ka ayana wai ka pate magogoro ma wai, ka a are uduru me. <verse eid="MAT 18:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 18:26" />Na ozara me tunggunu a begeshe be wai a wa bose wai na, “Ateakwilǝ tana o mungi ne, eyang arau ba pat.” <verse eid="MAT 18:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 18:27" />A aza obena ateakwilǝ me wa kone egonegone ozara me, nawa baya a wai kaa uduru me. <verse eid="MAT 18:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 18:28" />“Nangka ozara me wa ere arakaname, ka o surǝ wai nawa laka oja lezara awai, ka wa tare wai uduru o kap, emate lewinu. Nawa moke lengmelo le wai, a wa beka wai na, “Arang pate epaaka ang taroo.” <verse eid="MAT 18:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 18:29" />Na oja lezara me bose wai naa tana wa mungi ne eyang arau.” <verse eid="MAT 18:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 18:30" />Na ozara me ta kabare ne, nyimia na wa ale ka wai na pate wai akwilǝ andaleme, seena wa are emate uduru me. <verse eid="MAT 18:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 18:31" />Nangka aja lezara le wai ne kone epaaka eya ale, neta ne kone oleba nyimi ne. Nane ale ba ateakwilǝ one nane bele wai epaaka ozara name wa ya. <verse eid="MAT 18:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 18:32" />Na ateakwilǝ me wa rare wai, nawa beka wai na, “Bo ozara oburua wai. Ma bayau ka uduru ooka ang taro aza obena ba de na obosheng, <verse eid="MAT 18:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 18:33" />wa ta gwara o kone egonegone o beja be lezara lo nangka maa kona egonegone o sang?” <verse eid="MAT 18:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 18:34" />Na ateakwilǝ wai wa mungi ka wai, aa wa ote na a gǝǝzǝ wai, aa wa ote wai na wa are pate epaaka a tare wai. <verse eid="MAT 18:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 18:35" />Nyimia kangza Ate ang o nyimia zaa shili wayo ya kaa komana o ying, eeta pisǝ andaa ying kaa lenyong le yende ne.”<verse eid="MAT 18:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="MAT 19" />
  <para style="s">Be pirǝ azaa o maro o amare</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 10:1-12">Mar 10:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 16:18">Luk 16:18</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 19:1" />Nangka Yeso ka mare obeya angmǝ me a pate, naka baya makeke ma Galili aaka lyǝ aa makeke ma Yahudiya, mamea mayo o tara obeno Urdung. <verse eid="MAT 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 19:2" />Na aromo a cak ne tare kai, naka womza ana makono aa saname.<verse eid="MAT 19:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 19:3" />Na maParisa ma yende ne deya a kai adorana ne kedeya kai, nane pirǝ na, “Azaa o baala makili Mosa, wa gwara obena oromo wa pere ondaye o wai aza ekeeya na?”<verse eid="MAT 19:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 19:4" />Naka kabare nee na, “Eta tukǝ soola obena, ondooka wa ye ne o bora, wa ye nea ondaleme kaa ondaye sang?” <verse eid="MAT 19:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 19:5" />Na akang bekaana, “Aza nyimi, oromo wa arnang kaa iini wai kaa ate a wai, a wa gwarnang ondaye wai. Neya leere kane itǝ lepung le yende.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 2:24">Obo 2:24</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="MAT 19:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 19:6" />A ale a izi neto itǝ apung a leere ne, leyendea yo za. Epaaka Ashili a gwaara tana oromo wa are ne.” <verse eid="MAT 19:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 19:7" />Nane beka kai na, “Nyimia waaza, eyaaka Mosa wa ote na a nya e wela omaro o amare, akang pere ondaaye?”<verse eid="MAT 19:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 19:8" />Na Yeso kabare naka bekaa nee na, “Azaa obena eye kaa anyong a katakau waya wa ote na Mosa kabare na e nya e wela opere amare, obora nyimia ta za ne. <verse eid="MAT 19:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 19:9" />Eyang bele oying kangza, pate ondooka wa arnang ka ondaye wai, azaa leyau lee taza ne, awa kang ale kawa ana ondaye yende kawa ote odo, wa ya epa e madinǝ naname. Ondooka wa ote ondaye omea a pere wai ba odo, wa ya leyau.”<verse eid="MAT 19:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 19:10" />Na atoma kai bekaa kai na, “Nyimia waaza a tera ondaleme kaa ondaye wai, odera o ana ondaye me wa kala.” <verse eid="MAT 19:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 19:11" />Naka bekaa nee na, “Komana wa era wata kabare ka oroka me ne, soona andaaka Ashili a kangkama ne. <verse eid="MAT 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 19:12" />Ana ondo ne zene ka a ngmeng ne agbele, ana ondo aromoa ne ote ne nane itǝ agbele. Ana ondo kangza ne tere o bena neto ana andaaye ne obena neya yeme togomo te zaa shili. Pate ondooka wayo ama o jeka orokaana, awa jeke.”<verse eid="MAT 19:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yeso ka ayana a batebate</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 10:13-16">Mar 10:13-16</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:15-17">Luk 18:15-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 19:13" />A were name, na ca Yeso ayana aa batebate adorna ka eke ne o ara, a kakang beye angmǝ kaa Ashili aa za one, na atoma kai ne zurki ba andaaka ne deya ka ayana me. <verse eid="MAT 19:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 19:14" />Na Yeso bekaa nee na, “Bayana ayana a batebate aa ne deya mi, tane nara nee ne, obena togomo te zaa shili te ebelo ene te.” <verse eid="MAT 19:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 19:15" />Na ka eese taara to kare o leba ba za one, aaka ale teweno te kai.<verse eid="MAT 19:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ondaasau ooka waye ka ocǝ</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 10:17-31">Mar 10:17-31</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:18-30">Luk 18:18-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 19:16" />Aya zaa nyimi na ondo paka ting Yeso nawa bekaa na, “Ondo baala, obelo edang ka maa eze ang cǝ ebeene o dera o maro?” <verse eid="MAT 19:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 19:17" />Na Yeso kabare wai naa, “Eyaaka oya pirǝ ong ba zaa epa edang? Ashili aya belle aye ka edang. Baaya yeme o cǝ ebeene odera o maro, o tare makili ma Ashili maana.”<verse eid="MAT 19:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 19:18" />Nawa beka Yeso na, “Makili ma Ashili maa yeme?” Na Yeso bekaa na, “Tana o wong ondo ne, tana o eze leyau, tana o eze bekǝri ne, tana o beye majǝkǝri ne. <verse eid="MAT 19:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 19:19" />Nya ate au ka iini o ogongha one. Kangza oo yeme ondooka wa cikǝ ating au, na ukpwei o.”<verse eid="MAT 19:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 19:20" />Na Ondasau me bekaa kai na, “Ma eza nyimi ba pat, eya tata mi kangza?”<verse eid="MAT 19:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 19:21" />Na Yeso bekaa wai na, “Ba ya yeme o cikǝ zora madinǝ, ale ka o lishi pate magogoro mau, o jeke emate me ka o nya ana o dera eyapa oyo itǝ ondo ocǝ aa zaa shili. O ama o de ka o tareng.”<verse eid="MAT 19:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 19:22" />Nangka ondasau me wa kone nyimi, nawa sokoo ale ka o caro lenyong, obena waya ka ocǝ maleu.<verse eid="MAT 19:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 19:23" />Na Yeso bekaa atoma kai na, “Eyang dongdong bele oying, wayo poba kaa ondo ocǝ wa lyǝ ba nyimi togomo ta zaa shili. <verse eid="MAT 19:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 19:24" />Eyang kang bele oying. Mara orongkoome wa lyǝ a le'o beberkena ka obena ondo ocǝ wa lyǝ ba nyimi togomo to Ashili.”<verse eid="MAT 19:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 19:25" />Nangka atoma Yeso ne kone nyimi, na epame tera ne tukpwei maleo, nane bekaana, “Nyimia waaza, mana wa era wa cǝ o boza?<verse eid="MAT 19:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 19:26" />Na Yeso laka ne aaka bekaa na, “Enna ara aromo e pobe oya, ara Ashili ekeeya e era eye.”<verse eid="MAT 19:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 19:27" />Na Biturusu kabare nawa bekaana, “Ro naana, te arnang ka ekeeya azaa o tare o. Eya teyo cǝ? <verse eid="MAT 19:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 19:28" />Na Yeso bekaa nee na, “Eyang dongdong bele oying, a tomore to deya, awereaka Kena ka Oromo yo cikǝ aa ledǝndǝ lee gong le togomo to kai, ying ka e tareng, eyo cikǝ ara to cikǝ be tuuru ka leere, e core angmǝ ba zaa tokwilǝ be tuuru ka leere a maIsrela. <verse eid="MAT 19:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 19:29" />Kangza pate ondooka wa baya tokwilǝ, kaa arone andaleme, na arone andaaye, kaa ate, kaa iini, na ayana, na turu, ba za leze leng, wayo cǝ o ripitini liwinu, a wa kang cǝ ebene odera omaro. <verse eid="MAT 19:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 19:30" />Bangka nyimi, aromo a cak ana o bora neyo itǝ ana o maare, aa ana o maare neyo itǝ ana o bora.”<verse eid="MAT 19:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="MAT 20" />
  <para style="s">Ana ogole ara o inabi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 20:1" />“Togomo ta zaa shili a kedeya te kaa ateakwilǝ yende, omea wa suri ba leleere nawa jeke ana ogole ba nyimi ara a wai a mati ma inabi. <verse eid="MAT 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 20:2" />Nangka wa beye ejamane kaa ne ba za o dinari yende konang owere, nawa turki ne ba nyimi ara me. <verse eid="MAT 20:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 20:3" />Aa ya gera beru be torai be leleere nawa suri kangza, nawa laka ana ondo ba cikǝ zora epa o eza a bengmǝ ba ara ejamane. <verse eid="MAT 20:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 20:4" />Nawa beka ne na, “Ying kangza ale na ba ara a mati ma inabi mang, eyang nya ying epaaka wa gwara a nya ying.” Nane ale. <verse eid="MAT 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 20:5" />Nangka wa kang surǝ a ongme wa dukǝ tera, kangza kaa beru be o taaro ulyǝlu, nyimia nawa kang jeka ana ogole. <verse eid="MAT 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 20:6" />Nangka beru be esu beye, nawa kang surǝ nawa laka ana ondo ba itǝ, nawa beka nee na, ‘Eyaka e were ba cikǝ zora epa o eza?’<verse eid="MAT 20:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 20:7" />Nane kabare wai na, “Ondo taa wa nya ro ogole ne.” Nawa bekaa nee na,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 20:7">“Ying kangza ale na ba ara a mati ma inabi mang.”<verse eid="MAT 20:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 20:8" />Nangka ulyǝlu waye baa cuwu, na ondo ara o mati ma inabi wa bekaa ondo o kangkama o wai a soola ogole o me na, ‘Rare ana ogole me ka o arseze ne epa eka e itǝ e komana, o bore ba ana o maare ba ale ana o bora.’ <verse eid="MAT 20:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 20:9" />Nangka andaaka ne bore ogole ba ulyǝlu ba cuwu ne de, na komana one a nya wai be dinari be yende. <verse eid="MAT 20:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 20:10" />Nangka andaaka a jeke ne ba obora ne de, nane eke lenyong oo bena neyo cǝ o kala o nyimi. Neema na komana one wa cǝ be dinari be yende. <verse eid="MAT 20:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 20:11" />Nangka komana one wa cǝ epaaka a nya wai nane wore odera o kona oleba ba ateakwilǝ me, <verse eid="MAT 20:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 20:12" />aane beye na, “Andaaka a jeke ne oo maare ogole o beru be yendea belle ne eze, na ba ara ro nangka ba ara ne, ro ka tee were ba aa gole aa nyimi ongme.”<verse eid="MAT 20:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 20:13" />Nawa kabare ondo ba nyimi one na, “Oja, anta ma iru ne. Teta te beya na eyang nyau o dinari yende ne? <verse eid="MAT 20:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 20:14" />Emba epaeka te beya kaa bo o ale. Mia maa zaka na ma nya ana o maare ba kap ka nangka ma nyau. <verse eid="MAT 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 20:15" />Anta ka obare kang ye epaaka ang ama oya me ka epa eng sang? Aa bo ota ba kona oleba epaeka ma ya e rere naname ne na?”<verse eid="MAT 20:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 20:16" />Baa zaa nyimi ana o maare neyo itǝ ana obora, aa ana obora neyo itǝ ana o maare.”<verse eid="MAT 20:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yeso ka sukǝ o bekaa nangka kayo gbwǝ</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 10:32-34">Mar 10:32-34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:31-34">Luk 18:31-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 20:17" />Awereaka Yeso kaa atoma kai neya zala ba Urushalima, na Yeso itǝ kaa ne be daki orona aka beka nee na, <verse eid="MAT 20:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 20:18" />“Teya ale ba Urushalima. Aya nya kena ka oromo ba taara ta andaamoole ama magame ma Ashili, kaa ana o baala angmǝ aka Ashili a nya Mosa, neyo core angmǝ ba zaa kai ka a wong kai. <verse eid="MAT 20:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 20:19" />Neyo niyi kai ba taara ta maYahuda kane zeele kai, aane ole kai, aane kang gendare kai ba zaa uti. A lengme lo taaro kangza ayo ara kai.”<verse eid="MAT 20:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lebose le iini Yakubu kaa Yohana</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 10:13-45">Mar 10:13-45</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 20:20" />Na iini ayana Zabadi paka ba ting Yeso kaa ayana kai, naka girwǝ ba begeshe be kai, aa ka bose eyapa ba kai.<verse eid="MAT 20:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 20:21" />Na Yeso beka kai na, “Eya oya yeme me?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 20:21">Naka beka kai na, “Ote ayana ang a leere aana ka ne cikǝ, ka yende o ara ore o, aa ka yende o ara o guri o, a nyimi togomo teo.”<verse eid="MAT 20:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 20:22" />Na Yeso kabare naka beka ba ayana me na, “Eta rosa epaeka eya bosaza me ne, eyo ama o sa o gǝǝzǝ omea eyang sa na?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 20:22">Nane bekaa kai na, “Teyo ama.”<verse eid="MAT 20:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 20:23" />Naka bekaa ne na, “Eyo dongdong sa a ka poto kang, a obena e cikǝ ba o ara o re na o guri, mia taza ka o bare nya me ne. Ate ang o zaa shili wa babara araname azaa andaaka aa zaka.”<verse eid="MAT 20:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 20:24" />Nangka o dangare atoma kai be tuuru ne kone nyimi, na ne mungi ka ayana leere name. <verse eid="MAT 20:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 20:25" />Na Yeso rare ne na ka bekaana, “Erose obena agomo a worme ne wore ne legoone, aa na o kangkama agomo me kangza ne wore ne obare. <verse eid="MAT 20:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 20:26" />Wato itǝ nyimi ba nyimi oying ne. Ba zaa nyimi pate ondooka waya yeme o itǝ ondo gong ba nyimi oying, seeka wa itǝ ozara oying. <verse eid="MAT 20:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 20:27" />Kangza ondooka waya yeme a wa itǝ ondo tare ka ying, seeka wa itǝ ozara oying. <verse eid="MAT 20:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 20:28" />Nyimia kangza Kena ka Oromo kata ka deya ka aromo eze kai lezara ne, ka deye adorana kai ka itǝ ozara, na ka nya ebene kai adorana ka boze aromo ba cak.”<verse eid="MAT 20:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">Arǝ leere ne cǝ o gonta</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 10:46-52">Mar 10:46-52</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:35-43">Luk 18:35-43</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 20:29" />Nangka Yeso kaa atoma kai neya baya a nyimia Yariko na aromo ba cak ne tare kai. <verse eid="MAT 20:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 20:30" />Arǝ a leere neya cikǝ a be dǝki be orona. Nangka ne kone na Yeso yaa kala, nane ara lengmelo nane bekaana, “Ateokora, kona egonegone oro, Kena ka Daoda!”<verse eid="MAT 20:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 20:31" />Na aromo ne zurki baa ne kane kome. Kangza nane wale ara lengmelo ne maleo, aane beya na, “Ateokora, kona egonegone oro, Kena ka Daoda!”<verse eid="MAT 20:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 20:32" />Na Yeso itǝ aa ka bekaa nee na, “Eya eya yeme ang ye ying?”<verse eid="MAT 20:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 20:33" />Nane beka kai na, “Ateokora, teya yeme a te cǝ o gonta!”<verse eid="MAT 20:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 20:34" />Ba nyimi okona egonegone one, na Yeso ka moke ayizi ane, na ongmere liizi nane cǝ o gonta, aane tare kai.<verse eid="MAT 20:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="MAT 21" />
  <para style="s">Yeso ka lyǝ aa Urushalima</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 12:1-11">Mar 12:1-11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:28-40">Luk 19:28-40</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:12-19">Yoh 12:12-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 21:1" />Nangka Yeso kaa atoma kai ne dukǝ kapeng ka Betapaji kamea ka amara ka Urushalima, ba kulǝ oyara o mati ma Zaitun, na Yeso ka tong atoma kai a leere, <verse eid="MAT 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 21:2" />naka beka nee na, “Lyǝ na ba kapeng kaa niini ba izi oying. Ee lyǝ eyo laka kurungzǝ baa tera, ka kabana kame. Dinggǝ na e ka ecang. <verse eid="MAT 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 21:3" />Ondo wa pirkǝ, ying e beka wai na, Ateokora ya yeme one. Wayo kuriyǝ ee aa rabokoro.”<verse eid="MAT 21:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 21:4" />A ye nyimia adorana a panza epa eeka ondo beya angmǝ ka mawo ma Ashili Zakariya beke obena,<verse eid="MAT 21:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 21:5" />“Ee bekaa kagala ka Sihiyona na,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 21:5">laka, Ogomo oying waya zo deya ba ying!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 21:5">Ondo o nata ukpwei wai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 21:5">Waya zaa kabana kurungzǝ.”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ZEC 9:9">Zak 9:9</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="MAT 21:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 21:6" />Na atoma Yeso ne ale, nane ye epaaka Yeso ka bekaa ne. <verse eid="MAT 21:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 21:7" />Nane de kaa kurungzǝ ka kabana kame, nane nata ne madibi aa zaa one, a ka zale. <verse eid="MAT 21:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 21:8" />Na aromo ba cak ne nata madibi mane ba zaa orona, aana ondo gera marane ma mati nane eese ba zaa orona. <verse eid="MAT 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 21:9" />A okurkǝnǝng aromo ka neya teweno ba izi ka kai kaa andaaka neya dimǝ kai, nane ara angmelo aane beya na,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 21:9">“Hosana Kena ka Daoda!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 21:9">Okona oleba wa itǝ</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 21:9">o kando ko deya ba nyimi leze le Ateokora!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 21:9">Hosana o Ashili!”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 118:25-26">Sel 118:25-26</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="MAT 21:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 21:10" />Nangka Yeso ka lyǝ baa nyimi Urushalima na pate apeng me a bitǝkǝrnu, aane beya naa, “Mana waana?”<verse eid="MAT 21:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 21:11" />Na aromo aaka neya tare o Yeso bekaana, “Kanna kando ka o beya angmǝ ka mawo ma Ashili Yeso kamea ka surǝa Nazarat o makeke ma Galili.”<verse eid="MAT 21:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yeso ka tarangga ana ejamane aa akwilǝ Ashili</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 11:15-19">Mar 11:15-19</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:45-48">Luk 19:45-48</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 2:13-22">Yoh 2:13-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 21:12" />Na Yeso ka lyǝ akwilǝ Ashili naka tarangga ana o lisǝzǝ kaa ana o eesa magogoro baa nyimi me, naka bitǝkǝri pate matara mana o saara emate me, kaa matara ma o lisǝsǝ egoma e akwilǝ. <verse eid="MAT 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 21:13" />Naka bekaa nee na, “A wele obena,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 21:13">‘Ayo rara akwilǝ ang aro beya angmǝ kaa Ashili,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 21:13">na ying e kuriyǝ ai aro baasaza ana o tǝǝru aromo.’ ”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 7:11">Irim 7:11</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="MAT 21:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 21:14" />Na arǝ kaa agǝdǝ ne deya baa kai a nyimi akwilǝ Ashili naka womza ne. <verse eid="MAT 21:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 21:15" />Nangka andaamoole magame ma Ashili, kaa ana o baala angmǝ aka Ashili a nya Mosa ne laka epa o tera ukpwei eeka ka eza, aa ayana yaa saba Ashili ba nyimi akwilǝ Ashili a ne beya na, “Hosana Kena ka Daoda!” Na ne kone oburǝ maleo. <verse eid="MAT 21:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 21:16" />Nane bekaa kai na, “Oya konaza epaeka andaana ya beya me sang?</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 21:16">Na Yeso beka ne naa, “Ma kona, azaa nyimi eta rosa obena a wele na,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 21:16">“Ba nyimi ongmǝ a abana ayana kaa akaa tata a asa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 21:16">boa baa ote ka ne saboo sang?<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 8:2">Sel 8:2</ref>.</char></note>”<verse eid="MAT 21:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 21:17" />Naka arnang kaa ne, aaka suri ba nyimi apeng me, naka ale ba Betanya, aaka more saname.<verse eid="MAT 21:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yeso ka ye uti o ulǝ angmǝ</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 11:12-14">Mar 11:12-14</ref>,<ref loc="MRK 11:20-24">20-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 21:18" />Nangka ara a sane a kaya kurǝ ba nyimia apeng, na ekomo moke kai. <verse eid="MAT 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 21:19" />Nangka ka laka uti o uli ba ting orona, naka ale ba uti me naka ta cǝ eyapa o uti me ne soona marane belle. Naka beka uti me na, “Otoo ya ayana kangza ne!” Na ongmere liizi na uti me wa waka.<verse eid="MAT 21:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 21:20" />Nangka atoma kai ne laka nyimi, na epame e tere ne ukpwei nane bore be pirǝ na, “Eyaka uti uli na wa waka ba saseya?”<verse eid="MAT 21:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 21:21" />Na Yeso ka kabare naka beka ne naa, “Eyang dongdong bele oying maganggang maame, eeya ka o eke lenyong ba Ashili, zora madoola ma yende, epaaka e mana uti uli ona, eya eto eza belle ne, eyo ama o beka ba oyara ona, era, ka o taru ba nyimi opong ogong, a wayo itǝ nyimi. <verse eid="MAT 21:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 21:22" />Eeya ka o eke lenyong ba Ashili, pate epaaka e bosa ba Ashili eyo cǝ e.”<verse eid="MAT 21:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Aya masanggo azaa o bare o Yeso</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 11:27-33">Mar 11:27-33</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:1-8">Luk 20:1-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 21:23" />Nangka Yeso ka lyǝ ba nyimi akwilǝ Ashili, kaya aza obaala naname, na andaamoole magame ma Ashili, ka magonggong ma aromo nane deya kai ka be pirǝ na, “Ka legoone le mana oya eza magogoro maana? Kangza mana wa nyau legoone le me?”<verse eid="MAT 21:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 21:24" />Na Yeso ka kabare naka bekaa na, “Mima eyang eza o ying be pirǝ. E kabareng, mima eyang bele oying ka legoone le mana ang eze magogoro maana. <verse eid="MAT 21:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 21:25" />O batisma o Yohana, wa surǝ babaa? Ba zaa shili naa, ba aromoi?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 21:25">Nane dambaraza a tukpwei tone obena, “Te bekaana, wa surǝ shili, kayo bekaa aro na, na eyaka eta e kabare kaa kai ne?” <verse eid="MAT 21:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 21:26" />Kangza te bekaana, “Wa surǝ ba aromo, teya kona boome be aromo, obena komana wa rose obena Yohana ondo beya angmǝ ka mawo ma Ashili wai.”<verse eid="MAT 21:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 21:27" />Nane kabare Yeso na, “Teta rosa ne.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 21:27">Na Yeso beka ne naa, “Nyimia mima anta a bele oying ka legoone le mana ang ezeze magogoro maana ne.”<verse eid="MAT 21:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Angmǝ a gerpo azaa ayana leere</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 21:28" />“E laka nannia? Oromo yende wa zene kaa ayana leere andaleme. Nawa ale baa ka o bora, nawa beka kai na, “Kena kang ale ka o eza ogole ba ara o inabi. <verse eid="MAT 21:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 21:29" />Na kena kame beka na, “Anta ale ne.” Nangka a rabokoro naka sara madoola, aaka ale. <verse eid="MAT 21:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 21:30" />Na ate ame wa ale baa ka o leere kame, nawa beka kai epaaka wa beka a ka o bora. Na ka o leere bekaana, “Ma kona ate, eyang ale,” na kata ale ne.<verse eid="MAT 21:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 21:31" />Ba nyimi ayana leere me mana wa ye epaeka ate me wa yeme?</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 21:31">Nane bekaana, “Ka o bora.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 21:31">Na Yeso bekaa nee na, “Eyang bele o ying epeng eme, ana o eesa emate e makeke kaa andaaye o lisǝzǝ apung ane neya kaana oying o lyǝ ba togomo ta Ashili. <verse eid="MAT 21:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 21:32" />Obena Yohana o batisma wa de nawa wore ying orona o rere, neeta kabare ka wai ne. Ba zaa nyimi na ana o eesa emate makeke kaa andaaye o lisǝzǝ apung ane ne kabare ka wai, aa ying pate ka o laka enna, malo nyimi na eta kabare a pisǝ madinǝ maying ne.”<verse eid="MAT 21:32" /></para>
  <para style="s">Angmǝ aa gerpo azaa ana ogole <optbreak />ara ka neye kaa araa buru</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 12:1-12">Mar 12:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:9-19">Luk 20:9-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 21:33" />“Angmǝ aa gerpo yendea aana kangza. Oromo yende wa zene ka waye kaa ara o inabi, nawa ringǝri ara me ka odarne, nawa kau le'o le noke ayana inabi a ara me, a kangza wa so odankee ona soola ara me. Malo nyimi nawa nya ana ogole yende lebose le ara me, a wa ale begere. <verse eid="MAT 21:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 21:34" />Nangka awere o sende e inabi me wa ye, nawa tong azara wai baa ana ogole me kane embe epaaka e itǝ e wai baa ne.<verse eid="MAT 21:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 21:35" />Na andaaka a bose ne ara me, ne meke azara me, nane ole o yende, aa ne wong o yende, aa ne teeze o taaro me. <verse eid="MAT 21:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 21:36" />Nawa kang tongha azara yende, amea ne kala obora, na andaaka a bose ne ara me, nane ye ne epaeka ne ye ana obora name. <verse eid="MAT 21:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 21:37" />Malo nyimi nawa tong kena ka wai baa ne, a wa eke obena, ‘Neyo laka o gongha kena kang.’<verse eid="MAT 21:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 21:38" />Nangka andaaka a bose ne ara ame ne laka kena ka oromo me, nane bekaa tukpwei tone na, “Aha, kando kaana ekeeya ara me aya itǝ a kai. A te wongha kai adorana ara me itǝ a aro.” <verse eid="MAT 21:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 21:39" />Na ne moke kai, aane tare kai ba malo o darne, nane wongha kai.<verse eid="MAT 21:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 21:40" />O ara aana wa deya, eya wayo ya kaa andaaka a bose ne ara ogole me?”<verse eid="MAT 21:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 21:41" />Nane beka kai na, “Wayo wongza ana anyong a buru me, awa bose ana ondo a ara me, andaaka neyo nyaza wai epaaka e itǝ e wai aa nyimi epa eeka ne cǝ.”<verse eid="MAT 21:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 21:42" />Na Yeso beka ne naa, “Eta tukǝ kona epaaka a wele ba nyimi angmǝ Ashili sang? O bena,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 21:42">“Lecale leeka ondo sowa wa nyana,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 21:42">leya lee itǝ le o kala ee dang o sowa odo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 21:42">Onna o eza Ashilia wai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 21:42">Epa o tera ukpwei aa yizi aro.”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:42 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 118:22-23">Sel 118:22-23</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="MAT 21:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 21:43" />“Ba zaa nyimi eyang bele oying, ayo emba togomo ta Ashili ba ying, ka nya a aromo makeke ma yende amea neyo wore o cikǝ o rere. <verse eid="MAT 21:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 21:44" />Ondooka wa rizi aza le cale leena, wayo poso. Aa ondooka le cale leme le taru ba zaa wai leyo nyanta wai naa ma'ena.”<verse eid="MAT 21:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 21:45" />Nangka ana magame ma moole kaa maParisa ne kone angmǝ me, nane rose obena, kaya beya baa za onea. <verse eid="MAT 21:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 21:46" />Na ne gere o moke okai, na boome ba aromo nara ne, obena pate aromo ne jeka kai ondo beya angmǝ kama mawo ma Ashili kai.<verse eid="MAT 21:46" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="MAT 22" />
  <para style="s">Angmǝ a gerpo azaa ozǝnggǝ o amare</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 14:15-24">Luk 14:15-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 22:1" />Na Yeso kang beka ne angmǝ a gerpo na, <verse eid="MAT 22:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 22:2" />“A era kedeya togomo ta shili kaa ogomo yende ooka wa eze kena ka wai ozǝnggǝ amare. <verse eid="MAT 22:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 22:3" />Na wa tong azara wai kane rare aromo aaka a baale ne o ozǝnggǝ me, na aromo amea a baale ne neta deya ne.<verse eid="MAT 22:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 22:4" />Na wa kang tongha azara wai yende nawa beka ne na, “Alena ka e bekaa andaaka a baale ne o ozǝnggǝ na, maa goro na ma core bena be lome be mate eena, epaolya ee yengha, amara ekeeya ane de.”<verse eid="MAT 22:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 22:5" />“Na andaaka a belene o amare me ta bala nee ne, na komana ale o ale awai, ondo wa ale ara awai, aa ondo ale ba ara ejamane awai. <verse eid="MAT 22:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 22:6" />O dangare one moke azara ame nane ole ne, a ne wong ne. <verse eid="MAT 22:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 22:7" />Ogomo me wa munggi aa cak, na wa tong ana otesa ageza aa moole awai, na ne wong aromo me, aane ese apeng ame ka ola aa pat.<verse eid="MAT 22:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 22:8" />Na wa bekaa azara awai na, ‘Amara ekeeya o amare me, aa andaaka a bele ne ta gwara ne de ne. <verse eid="MAT 22:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 22:9" />Tareze na marona, apate ondooka e laka ee bekaa wai na wa de ara o zǝnggǝ o amare me.’ <verse eid="MAT 22:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 22:10" />Na azara me ale na ne rare apate andaaka nee laka, ana edang kaa ana odera edang, nyimia na apanza ogiishi me ka ageng.<verse eid="MAT 22:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 22:11" />“Aa nangka ogomo me wa lyǝ kawa laka ageng me, na wa laka ondo zora madibi ma ozǝnggǝ. <verse eid="MAT 22:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 22:12" />Na wa pirkǝ wai na, ‘Oja, aa wiinia na ba lyǝ arakaana zora o amba madibi ma ozǝnggǝ ne?’ Na oromo me ta ama obeka eyapa ne.<verse eid="MAT 22:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 22:13" />“Na ogomo me bekaa azara awai na, ‘Tera na taara ka tobona te wai, e tare wai a nyimi maring maa bo, ara aka ayo ruuzi ka ononza tuuni.’<verse eid="MAT 22:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 22:14" />“O bena aromo acakea aa rare, aa aromo a baate aa zaka.’ ”<verse eid="MAT 22:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Be pirǝ azaa o arsaza emate makeke aa Kaisar</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 12:13-17">Mar 12:13-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:20-26">Luk 20:20-26</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 22:15" />Na maParisa gere orona ooka neyo moke kai aa nyimi angmǝ a kai. <verse eid="MAT 22:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 22:16" />Na ne tong ana otare one ka aromo a Hiridus yende, na ne beka ana, “Ondo baala, te rose beka ana bo ondo baala epengngha, o kang baala komaname orona Ashili, ota zaka ondo ne, ba jeka komaname oyende a bo. <verse eid="MAT 22:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 22:17" />Na beka aa ro epa eka ba laka, wa gwara te nya Kaisar emate makeke naa, na tana te nya nea?”<verse eid="MAT 22:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 22:18" />Yeso ka rose ara aburu aaka aya anyong ane, naka bekaana, “Ying ana anyong aburu! Eya ka eya kedeya ong? <verse eid="MAT 22:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 22:19" />“Worenna bemate beeka a arseze oma makeke mane.” Nane ca kai be dinari be me. <verse eid="MAT 22:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 22:20" />Na Yeso pirkǝ nee na ‘Mainu ka leze le mana ba azaa benna?’<verse eid="MAT 22:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 22:21" />Nane kabare kai na, “Ma Kaisar.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 22:21">Na Yeso bekaa nee na, “Na nya na Kaisar epa eka e Kaisar e, ee nya Ashili epa eka a Ashili e.” <verse eid="MAT 22:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 22:22" />Nangka ne kona nyimi, na epa eme tere ne ukpwei, aane ale o ale one.<verse eid="MAT 22:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Be pirǝ azaa o era malo ogwǝ</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 12:18-27">Mar 12:18-27</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:27-40">Luk 20:27-40</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 22:23" />A lengme leme, na maSadukiya ka ne beyaana ata eere malo ogwǝ ne, na ne pirkǝ kai, <verse eid="MAT 22:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 22:24" />nane bekana, ‘Mosa wa bekaa na oromo wa gbwǝ zora ayana, orone o wai cikǝ kaa kandaye kame ka ka ngmengze wai ayana.’<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 25:5">Otik 25:5</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="MAT 22:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 22:25" />Arone sondaare zene aa nyimi oro. Obora wa ana ondaaye, nawa gbwi zora kena, na ondaadimǝ wai cikǝ kaa ondaaye me. <verse eid="MAT 22:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 22:26" />Nyimia ondaadimǝ wai o leere, kaa o taaro, nyimia epame e ale a dukǝ pate one aa sondaare. <verse eid="MAT 22:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 22:27" />O maare apat, na ondaye me ma wa gbwi. <verse eid="MAT 22:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 22:28" />Na nannameena, aa lengme le o era malo ogbwǝ, wayo itǝ ondaaye mana a nyimi one, ka pate one nee cikǝ kaa wai?<verse eid="MAT 22:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 22:29" />Na Yeso bekaa nee na, madoola maying ta orona ne, ka eta rose angmǝ Ashili ka awela ne, kangza eta rose legoone le Ashili ne. <verse eid="MAT 22:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 22:30" />Lengme le o era malo ogbwǝ, o anza ondaye ta rene ne, aa onya ondaye kaa o oteze one a todo to rene ne, aza obena neyo kurǝ na atoma Ashili odera lepung aaza shili. <verse eid="MAT 22:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 22:31" />Azaa o era malo o gbwǝ, eta ee tukǝ o soola epaeka Ashili a beke aying ne na? A bekaana, <verse eid="MAT 22:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 22:32" />‘Mia Ashili a Ibraheng, Ashili a Ishaku, kaa Ashili a Yakubu.’<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:32 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 3:6">Osur 3:6</ref>.</char></note> Ashilia a pate andaaka neya ka ebeene, ana o gbwizǝ tazane.”<verse eid="MAT 22:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 22:33" />Nangka aromome ne kona nyimi, na epa eme tere ne ukpwei.<verse eid="MAT 22:33" /></para>
  <para style="s">Makili ma okala dengdeng</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 12:28-32">Mar 12:28-32</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 10:25-28">Luk 10:25-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 22:34" />Nangka maParisa ne kone ana Yeso ka toza maSadukiya, nane gwaara tukpwei, <verse eid="MAT 22:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 22:35" />ondo o baala angmǝ aaka Ashili a nya Mosa aa nyimi one, wa eze Yeso be pirǝ adorana wa cǝ kawa meke kai. <verse eid="MAT 22:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 22:36" />Nawa bena, “Ondo o baala, oyeme kala ogongha a nyimi makili ma Mosa?”<verse eid="MAT 22:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 22:37" />Na Yeso kabare wai na, “Yeme Ateokora Ashili au kaa pate lenyong leo, kaa pate ebeene o, ka opate madoola mau.”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:37 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 6:5">Otik 6:5</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="MAT 22:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 22:38" />Onna obora kawa kala aa gongha apate. <verse eid="MAT 22:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 22:39" />Makili o leere ome kang ya na obora, ‘Yeme ondooka waya ating o na ukpwei o.’ <verse eid="MAT 22:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 22:40" />Pate o baala o Mosa ka ana o beya angmǝ ka mawo ma Ashili, ma ya azaa makili ma leere maana.”<verse eid="MAT 22:40" /></para>
  <para style="s">Be pirǝ azaa Almasipu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 12:35-37">Mar 12:35-37</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:41-44">Luk 20:41-44</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 22:41" />Nangka maParisa ma yende ne kurkǝnǝng ara yende, na Yeso ka pirkǝ ne na, <verse eid="MAT 22:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 22:42" />“Eya madoola maying aza Almasipu? Kai kena ka manaa?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 22:42">Nane kabare kai na, ‘Kena ka Daoda kai.’<verse eid="MAT 22:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 22:43" />Na Yeso bekaane na, “Na a wiinia na Daoda beya angmǝ ka mawo ma Obere o Sangsang, na wa rare kai na ‘Ateokora’? Aa wa bekana,<verse eid="MAT 22:43" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 22:44" />‘Ateokora wa beka aa Ateokora ong na,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 22:44">“Cikǝ o ara o re ong,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 22:44">seeka ma eke ana o nyana o,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 22:44">aa tetau te tobona teo.” ’<verse eid="MAT 22:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 22:45" />Na Daoda wa rara Almasipu na ‘Ateokora’, aa wiinia aaka itǝ kena ka wai? <verse eid="MAT 22:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 22:46" />Ondo ta wa ama kabare a Yeso ne. O era a lengme leme, ondo ta wa kang ama o pirkǝ okai ne.<verse eid="MAT 22:46" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="MAT 23" />
  <para style="s">Yeso ka banggali o ela o andaano</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 12:38-39">Mar 12:38-39</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:43-46">Luk 11:43-46</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:45-47">20:45-47</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 23:1" />Nangka aromo ne kurkǝnǝng ba cake kaa atoma kai, na Yeso bekaane na, <verse eid="MAT 23:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 23:2" />“Ana obaala makili ma Mosa ka maParisa neya a nya ne uwǝri baala makili ma Mosa. <verse eid="MAT 23:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 23:3" />Azaa nyimi, tare na, eza pate epa eka ne beka ying, se na tane ezeze epa eka ne eze ne, ka ne baala aa neta ezeze epa eka ne baala ne. <verse eid="MAT 23:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 23:4" />Ne tesa aromo magogoro ma dendeng ka ma poba ana ba o malo, zora bekaana ne kankama ne ko ka lebo.<verse eid="MAT 23:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 23:5" />“Ekeeya ene ne ezaa ka aromo laka. Ne ezaza a gwada a molemole ka angmǝ a Ashili aaka a wele kane tese a madong mane ka taara tone, ne dozeze se jǝng se eewo ka ma dukǝ tulung te ne, ba taara te madibi mane. <verse eid="MAT 23:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 23:6" />Ne kala ara o eme ne cikǝ ara cisǝ anda mole ara o zǝnggǝ, a ne kang cikǝ ba izi aa nyimi o dandaro Ashili. <verse eid="MAT 23:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 23:7" />Aa ne kang yeme a beeze ne okoo ba ara ejamane, aa kang rara ne na, ‘Ana obaala’.<verse eid="MAT 23:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 23:8" />A ying, tana a rara ying ana ‘Ana obaala’ ne, ka ondo obaala o ying o yendea wai, aa pate oying arone ai. <verse eid="MAT 23:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 23:9" />Tana e rare ondo orambo na ana ‘Ate’ ne. Eya ka Ate a yendea ka aya zaa shili. <verse eid="MAT 23:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 23:10" />A tana rara ying ‘Andaano’ ne, obena eya ka ondoono o yendea belle, kaya Almasipu. <verse eid="MAT 23:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 23:11" />Wai ka wa kala ogongha ba nyimi oying wayo itǝ ozara oying. <verse eid="MAT 23:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 23:12" />Pate ondo oka wa ara ukpwei, ayo jǝpǝrǝ wai. Aa pate ondo oka wa jǝpǝrǝ ukpwei, ayo ara wai.<verse eid="MAT 23:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 23:13" />Eyo zitǝ, ying ana o baala makili ma Mosa ka maParisa, kaa ana rendaza! E pate aromo abuudu o lyǝ aa togomo te zaa shili, yingha tukpwei teying eta lyǝ ne, aa kang nara ana o eme ne lyǝ.<verse eid="MAT 23:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 23:14" />Eyo zitǝ, ana o baala angmǝ aaka Ashili a nya Mosa ka maParisa, ana o rendaza! E lyeeze magogoro ma andaye aka andaleme ane a gbwizǝ, e beya angmǝ ka Ashili o eo adorana aa laka ying. Azaa nyimi, o zitǝ oying wayo kala o komana.<verse eid="MAT 23:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 23:15" />Eyo zitǝ, ana obaala angmǝ aaka Ashili a nya Mosa ka maParisa, kaa ana o rendaza! E taare manyi ma gong, e aleze a makeke macangcang ba ogera ondo o kurǝ Ashili oyende. Aa e cǝ wai, e kang ote wa kala ying o wilǝ.<verse eid="MAT 23:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 23:16" />Eyo zitǝ, ying arǝ aaka ne windǝ aromo. E beeze na, ‘Ondo wa tono ka akwilǝ Ashili, eyapa taza ne, aa wa tono ka ozinari o akwilǝ Ashili, otono me yo lya wai.’ <verse eid="MAT 23:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 23:17" />Ying arǝ, a rara! Oyeng ome kala ogongha, ozinari na, akwilǝ Ashili oka wa kwizǝzǝ ozinari e? <verse eid="MAT 23:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 23:18" />E beeze na, ‘Ondooka wa tono kaa ara o esaza Ashili mapapa mo waze, eyapa taa ne, aa pate ondooka wa tono ka epa eka a nata azame, le tono leyo moke wai.’ <verse eid="MAT 23:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 23:19" />Ying arǝ! O yemea kala ogongha, epa eka aa nya Ashilia na, na a ara o esaza Ashili mapapa mo waze oka wa kwizǝzǝ epa eka a nya mea? <verse eid="MAT 23:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 23:20" />Azaa nyimi, oromo wa tono ka ara o esaza Ashili mapapa mo waze, wa tono ka ara o esaza Ashili mapapa mo waze aa pate epa eka a nata azame. <verse eid="MAT 23:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 23:21" />Aa Pate ondooka wa tono ka akwilǝ Ashili, wa tono ka wai ka Ashili ka aya nyimi ai. <verse eid="MAT 23:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 23:22" />Pate ondooka wa tono ka zaa shili kanza, wa tono kale dǝndǝ le Ashili ka ondo oka waya cikǝ aaza me.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 66:1">Ish 66:1</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 5:34">Mat 5:34</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="MAT 23:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 23:23" />Eyo zitǝ, ying ana o baala angmǝ aaka Ashili a nya Mosa ka maParisa, ying ana o rendaza! E nyaza Ashili le yende a nyimi betuuru epa e ecete ka ma nanggo, aa e pere epa eka ekala edang e makili ma Mosa, na obeya epeng, egonegone, ka o eza epa ee kap. Epa eka wa gwara e eza naname zora o baya ma dangare mame.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 27:30">Mag 27:30</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="MAT 23:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 23:24" />Ying arǝ aka ne windǝ aromo, e lobeze ecǝngci, aa e dongze orankome!<verse eid="MAT 23:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 23:25" />Eyo zitǝ, ana o baala angmǝ aaka Ashili a nya Mosa ka maParisa, ying ana o rendaza! E kwizǝzǝ malo topoto ka teso toying, a nyimi a pena le iri, ka o yeme ukpwei. <verse eid="MAT 23:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 23:26" />Bo, urǝ oParisa! Bora kwizǝ a nyimi oso ka opoto, adora a malo me ya a sangsang.<verse eid="MAT 23:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 23:27" />Eyo zitǝ, ana obaala makili ma Mosa ka maParisa, ying ana o rendaza! Eye na macao maaka a leleme ka egengge epeng. Ma rere olaka oo yanga, aa nyimi a pena kaa cako andaaka ne gbwizǝ kaa kombela madinǝ.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 23:3">Ogat 23:3</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="MAT 23:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 23:28" />Nyimia ba ayizi aromo ying ana okona boome be Ashilia, aa nyimi anyong aying ana o rendaza, kaa ana ara aburu.<verse eid="MAT 23:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 23:29" />Eyo zitǝ, ana obaala makili ma Mosa ka maParisa, ying ana o rendaza! E sooze ana o beya angmǝ ka mawo ma Ashili macao, kangza ezeze ejaaga a macau ma ana o kona boome be Ashili. <verse eid="MAT 23:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 23:30" />E beeze na, ‘Eya te rene a were a samba, te ta teyo gwara taara kane ba o wonghza ana obeya angmǝ ka mawo ma Ashili mame ne.’ <verse eid="MAT 23:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 23:31" />Nyimia e wore bena ying ayana andaaka ne wonghza ana o beya angmǝ ka mawo ma Ashili. <verse eid="MAT 23:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 23:32" />Lya na izi, maare na epa eka ma gonggong maying ma bore!<verse eid="MAT 23:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 23:33" />Ying ewa, kaa o kurkǝnǝng ewa e buru! Aa wiinia e bisi o gǝǝzǝ Ashili akwilǝ ola? <verse eid="MAT 23:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 23:34" />Azaa nyimi ma tongha ying ana o beya angmǝ ka mawo ma Ashili, kaa ana orosa, kaa ana o baala angmǝ aaka Ashili a nya Mosa. E yo wongha ana ondo one, ee gendare ana ondo o uti, aa na ondo eyo ola ne aa nyimi ma dandaro maying, ee tarze ne aa topepeng ee gǝǝzǝ ne. <verse eid="MAT 23:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 23:35" />Nyimia aaza oying ayo gera manyau mana o dera madinǝ maaka a oke a lerambo, aa era a manyau ma ondo o sangsang Habila aa ale a Zakariya kena ka Berekiya, kamea e wongha aa tera akwilǝ Ashili ka ara o esaza Ashili mapapa mayo kurǝ aaza oying. <verse eid="MAT 23:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 23:36" />Na eyang baala oying, pate manna ma yo mana ayana nanname.<verse eid="MAT 23:36" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yeso ka kone egonegone e Urushalima</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 13:34-35">Luk 13:34-35</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 23:37" />Urushalima! Urushalima! Bo ka ba wongze ana o beya angmǝ ka mawo ma Ashili, aa o kang teeze andaaka aa tongha ba bo ka cale! Ka wondaa ma yeme o kurǝ oying nangka katokoro kuruzi ayana kai aa ma beko ma kai, na ee nyana. <verse eid="MAT 23:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 23:38" />Na awa nanname aa ba ying akwilǝ me na a itǝ makansǝng! <verse eid="MAT 23:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 23:39" />Mi sang eyang baala oying, eto kang lakang ne, se lengme leeka e bekaana ‘Ondo o kona leba ondooka waya deya ka leze le Ateokora.’<verse eid="MAT 23:39" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="MAT 24" />
  <para style="s">O oko Akwilǝ Ashili</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 13:1-2">Mar 13:1-2</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:5-6">Luk 21:5-6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 24:1" />Nangka Yeso ka suri Akwilǝ Ashili me, kaya nyimi teyeno, na atoma akai de nane wore kai masosowa ma Akwilǝ Ashili me. <verse eid="MAT 24:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 24:2" />Na ka bekaa nee na, ‘Eya gonta pate masosowa maana? Eyang dongdong obele ying, ata baya le cale leyende kaa ayo baya aza leyende ne. Ayo bacakare ai aa pat.’<verse eid="MAT 24:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Obora ozitǝ</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 13:3-13">Mar 13:3-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:7-19">Luk 21:7-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 24:3" />Yeso ka ya cikǝ oyara o Zaitun, na atoma akai ne deya kai aa suk, nane beka kai na, ‘‘Bele ro, ngmǝyamea aya eza mapa maana? Eya kangza eyo wore ro odeya o, ka omare lerambo?”<verse eid="MAT 24:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 24:4" />Na Yeso kabare nee, naka bekaana, “Eza na a sauwo, tana ondo rende ying ne. <verse eid="MAT 24:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 24:5" />Obena aromo a cake neyo deya aa nyimi leze leng, aane beyaa na, ‘Mia Almasipu’, ka ne rendeze aromo aa cak. <verse eid="MAT 24:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 24:6" />Eyo kang konaza marooka ma okara kaa ngmǝ acak azaa makara. Tana ekone boome ne, azaa obena dongdong nyimi yo ya, aa omaare tata suri. <verse eid="MAT 24:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 24:7" />Aromo apeng neyo gera aromo apeng yende bete, togomo teyo gera togomo te yende bete. Ayo eza ekomo kangza, kaa o zukǝrzu adeze, a kuruwǝ. <verse eid="MAT 24:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 24:8" />Aa pate ka nyimi, onna obora o zitǝa belle.<verse eid="MAT 24:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 24:9" />“Malo nyimi neyo niyi ying ka gǝǝzǝ ying, aa kang wongha ying. Pate aromo yo nyana ying aza leze leng. <verse eid="MAT 24:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 24:10" />A were na mea aromo acake yo rizi, neyo iri tukpwei, aa ne nyana tukpwei. <verse eid="MAT 24:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 24:11" />Atoma o rendaza a cake yo susǝ, aa ne rendeze aromo a cak. <verse eid="MAT 24:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 24:12" />Azaa waale ogongha araaburu, o yeme aromo acake yo kasarno. <verse eid="MAT 24:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 24:13" />Aa pate ondooka wa motana aa ale omaare wayo bisǝ. <verse eid="MAT 24:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 24:14" />Ayo kang baala orooka o leba o togomo te Ashili teena a pate kuruwǝ a nyimi lerambo leena. Malo o nyimi o maare de.”<verse eid="MAT 24:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ozitǝ oo jǝng</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 13:14-23">Mar 13:14-23</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:20-24">Luk 21:20-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 24:15" />“Azaa nyimi, pate awere aaka e laka epa e berebere, o deesa ka ocara, oo ka ondo obeya angmǝ ka mawo ma Ashili Daniyel wa beye angmǝ azaa me, aa waya itǝ ara aa sangsang. Ondo o soola awa rose.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 9:27">Dan 9:27</ref>; <ref loc="DAN 11:31">11:31</ref>; <ref loc="DAN 12:11">12:11</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="MAT 24:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 24:16" />Aa andaaka neya makeke ma Yahudiya songha ne lyǝ aa mayara. <verse eid="MAT 24:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 24:17" />Tana ondooka wa ya azaa akwilǝ jipi a jeka eyapa a nyimi akwilǝ me ne. <verse eid="MAT 24:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 24:18" />Ondooka waya ara kangza, tana wa kuri aa jeka odibi owai ne.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 17:31">Luk 17:31</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="MAT 24:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 24:19" />Andaye aaka neya ka etumǝ ka ana lewanyo, neyo zitǝ. <verse eid="MAT 24:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 24:20" />Bosa na Ashili tana tesong teying de aa lekoze na lengme le o teseke ne. <verse eid="MAT 24:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 24:21" />Aa werename ayo kala o ara ozitǝ, ombela ooka ata aa tukǝ ezame o era obora lerambo aa deya awereena ne. Ato kang sukǝ nyimi ne dakemeeme.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 12:1">Dan 12:1</ref>; <ref loc="REV 7:14">T.Yoh 7:14</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="MAT 24:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 24:22" />Bangka a kashe shengme sheme ne, ondo ta zene ka waa yoo bisǝ ne, obena andaaka Ashili a zaka ne rene, ayo kashe shengme sheme. <verse eid="MAT 24:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 24:23" />Awere name pate ondooka wa beka aying na ‘Almasipu waana!’ Koona, ‘Awa niini!’ Tana e kabare ne. <verse eid="MAT 24:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 24:24" />Ma Almasipu kaa ana o beya angmǝ ka mawo ma Ashili ma orenda kaa neyo deesa, kane ezeze mapapa ma o tesa ukpwei, adorana ne wilǝrǝ pate ka andaaka Ashili a zake, nyimi waayo ya. <verse eid="MAT 24:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 24:25" />Konanna! Ma bekaa ying ka orabo.<verse eid="MAT 24:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 24:26" />“Nee bekaa ying na ‘Lakana, awa niini a owake, tana e ale ne.’ Nee kang bekaa ying na, ‘Awaana ara o baasa,’ tana e kabare ne. <verse eid="MAT 24:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 24:27" />Nangka malmi eze masanto aa surǝ aa dizi aa alea aza, nyimi o kurǝ o Kena ka Oromo yo itǝ.<verse eid="MAT 24:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 24:28" />Pate ara aaka ekeze rene, aya ejogaale kurkǝnǝzǝng ne.<verse eid="MAT 24:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">O kurǝ Kena ka Oromo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 13:24-27">Mar 13:24-27</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:25-28">Luk 21:25-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 24:29" />“A saseya malo tomore te ozitǝ oo jǝng me,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 24:29">‘ongme to kang ya masanto ne,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 24:29">oreka kangza wato nya masanto ne.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 24:29">Aa ewerewere yo tǝǝrǝ aa surǝ azaa shili,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 24:29">ayo zukǝ pate obare ooka waya azaa shili.’<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 13:10">Ish 13:10</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 34:4">34:4</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 32:7">Ezek 32:7</ref>; <ref loc="JOL 2:10">Joy 2:10</ref>; <ref loc="JOL 3:4">3:4</ref>; <ref loc="JOL 3:15">3:15</ref>; <ref loc="REV 3:12-13">T.Yoh 3:12-13</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="MAT 24:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 24:30" />Awere namea ayo laka o surǝ o Kena ka Oromo aaka surǝ aza shili, pate aleng aa lerambo leena neyo ruuzi, neyo laka Kena ka Oromo aa kaya deya aza mawere, ka obare kaa togomo tee gong.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:30 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 7:13">Dan 7:13</ref>; <ref loc="ZEC 12:10-14">Zak 12:10-14</ref>; <ref loc="REV 1:7">T.Yoh 1:7</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="MAT 24:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 24:31" />Wayo tongha atoma kai o dera lepung kane ulbi tojebe ajǝng, aa ne kurki andaaka aa zaka o era aa ara o susǝ ongme, kaa ara o tǝǝru ongme, aa kulu arungji kaa kulu ayarbawa o lerambo leena.<verse eid="MAT 24:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Epa eeka o eka oo baala azaa uti uli</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 13:28-31">Mar 13:28-31</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:29-33">Luk 21:29-33</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 24:32" />Jeka na eyapa a uti uli. Aa e bana ee obara o sara, kane sǝǝrǝ marane maa sau, ee rosa obena lekoze le amara naname. <verse eid="MAT 24:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 24:33" />Nyimia awereaka ee laka pate epanana, eyo rosa obena awere a amara, aa bengmǝ be abuudu. <verse eid="MAT 24:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 24:34" />Ang dongdong ya baala oying, awereena ta kala ne seeka epanana apate eye. <verse eid="MAT 24:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 24:35" />Shili kaa deze yo maro, aa angmǝ ang to tukǝ omaro ne dakemeeme.<verse eid="MAT 24:35" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ondo ta rosa lengme na awere ne</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 13:32-37">Mar 13:32-37</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 17:26-30">Luk 17:26-30</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 17:34-36">34-36</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 24:36" />“Ondo ta rosa lengme leme na awereme ne, koona atoma odera lepung ka neya azaa shili, koona Kena kame, seena Ate me belle. <verse eid="MAT 24:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 24:37" />Waye na nangka a eze awere a Nuhu, nyimia o kurǝ Kena ka Oromo yo za. <verse eid="MAT 24:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 24:38" />Wa kang ya na tomore tennamea zongka manyi maa gong bore, aya lyelyeeza, aa sosoza, aya nyaza aa angza andaaye, aa dukǝ lengme leeka Nuhu wa lyǝ o onggo o taara manyi. <verse eid="MAT 24:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 24:39" />Zongka ne rose epa eka eya ale ne, seena manyi maa gong mame lye ne apat. Nyimia o kurǝ o Kena ka Oromo yo za. <verse eid="MAT 24:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 24:40" />Awerenamea, ayo mana aromo leere ara a ogole, ayo jeka oyende, aa baya oyende. <verse eid="MAT 24:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 24:41" />Ayo laka andaaye leere aa neya nyanta o nyanto, ayo jeka oyende, aa baya oyende.<verse eid="MAT 24:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 24:42" />Azaa nyimi, cikǝ na a le'enda, ka eta rosa lengme leeka Ateokora oying ya kurǝ ne. <verse eid="MAT 24:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 24:43" />Rosana bena, eeya ateakwilǝ yo rosa awere aka okǝri ya deya akwilǝ wai aa lelyaare, waa yo mora aa le'enda tana a lyǝ akwilǝ awai ka eze bekǝri ne. <verse eid="MAT 24:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 24:44" />Ying kangza cikǝ na ka ogoro, Kena ka Oromo ya deya awereaka ata madoola ma nyimi ne.<verse eid="MAT 24:44" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ozara edang kaa o dera edang</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 12:41-48">Luk 12:41-48</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 24:45" />“Ozara o yemea o eza epa edang aa waye ka orosa, ka ateakwilǝ awai yo nya wai le onta le akwilǝ awai, ka wa nyaza odangare azara me epaolya a were aka wa gwara?” <verse eid="MAT 24:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 24:46" />O kona oleba ya aza ozara oka ateakwilǝ awai yo kurǝ awa mana wai awa ya eza nyimi. <verse eid="MAT 24:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 24:47" />Eyang dongdong baala oying, wa yo ote wai aza ekeeya e wai. <verse eid="MAT 24:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 24:48" />Aa ozara name ondo araaburu wa za, wa yo bekaa ukpwei wai na, ‘Ateakwilǝ ta amara ka o deya ne.’ <verse eid="MAT 24:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MAT 24:49" />Aa wa bore olaza odangare azara me, awa lye, awa soze kaa ana ososoza. <verse eid="MAT 24:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MAT 24:50" />Ateakwilǝ ozara me yo deya a lengme leeka ata madoola ma o deya wai ne, awere aka wata rosa ne. <verse eid="MAT 24:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="MAT 24:51" />Ka wa daara wai lepung ka lesaro, aa wa nya wai epa eka e gwara ka ana araaburu. Aa arame ayo ruuzi ka o nongza tuuni.”<verse eid="MAT 24:51" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 24" />
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="MAT 25" />
  <para style="s">A ngmǝ gerpo azaa agala betuuru</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 25:1" />Awere name ayo kedeya togomo te shili na agala be tuuru ka ne jeke eru masanto na ne ale a wobe ondaasau. <verse eid="MAT 25:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 25:2" />Esu a nyimi one ya ka orosa, aa ondanggare esu ta neye ka wai ne. <verse eid="MAT 25:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 25:3" />Ana o dera orosa ne jeke eru masanto mane, aa neta ne onte manau ne. <verse eid="MAT 25:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 25:4" />Aa ana orosa kangza ne monte eru masanto mane kaa kagwi ka manau. <verse eid="MAT 25:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 25:5" />Ondaasau me ta wa dusung deya ne, pate one na ne bora ungzǝ, na malau jeke ne.<verse eid="MAT 25:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 25:6" />“Aa sanini tera le lyaare, na ne kona lengmelo aa rara na, ‘Ondaasau me a waana wa dukǝ! Surǝ na ka e wobe wai!’<verse eid="MAT 25:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 25:7" />“Pate agala name na ne ere na ne diisi eru masanto mane. <verse eid="MAT 25:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 25:8" />Na ana odera orosa name bekaa ana orosa na, ‘Nyapana ro a manau maaying aa baate, eru masanto maro ya limbuzu!’<verse eid="MAT 25:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 25:9" />Na ana orosa bekaana, ‘Ba eza manau maro to bare ro kaa ying ne. Mara e ale ana lisǝzǝme ke embe.’<verse eid="MAT 25:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 25:10" />“Aane tata ara o emba manau mame, na ondaasau me dukǝ. Na andaaka neye ka ogoro ne lyǝ ara o zǝnggǝ ka wai, aa kang pate abuudu me.<verse eid="MAT 25:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 25:11" />“Malo nyimi na ondanggare agala name dukǝ, nane bekaana, ‘Ateokora, Ateokora, pǝri ro abuudu!’<verse eid="MAT 25:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 25:12" />“Na wa kabare nee na, ‘Ang dongdong bele oying, mi anta rosa ying ne.’<verse eid="MAT 25:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 25:13" />“Na Yeso maare ka o bekaana, ‘Azaa nyimi, cikǝ na ka ogoro ka eta rosa lengme na awereme ne.’ ”<verse eid="MAT 25:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">A ngmǝ a gerpo azaa talenti</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 19:11-27">Luk 19:11-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 25:14" />“Togomo te Ashili teyo itǝ naa oromoa ka waya ya ale aa teweno, nawa rare azara wai aa wa eke pate epa eka waya ka e a taara te ne. <verse eid="MAT 25:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 25:15" />Wa nya oyende ma talenti esu, oyende ma talenti ma leere, aa oyende o talenti oyende. Wa nya komaname nangka legoone lewai leze. Aa wa ale. <verse eid="MAT 25:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 25:16" />Wai ondooka wa emba ma talenti esu mame wa era a saseya nawa ale nawa wanggare nawa cǝ esu aa zame. <verse eid="MAT 25:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 25:17" />Nyimia ondooka wa emba ma talenti ma leere, wai kangza wa cǝ ma leere aa zame. <verse eid="MAT 25:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 25:18" />Wai ka wa o talenti o yende, wa ale nawa kau le'o a deze na wa baasa o talenti a ateakwilǝ a wai.<verse eid="MAT 25:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 25:19" />“Malo rabo, na ateakwilǝ me wa kuri kane bale epa eka nee cǝ. <verse eid="MAT 25:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 25:20" />Na ondo name kawa emba ma talenti esu wa paka nawa de ka ma talenti ma yende esu, awa bekaana, ‘Ateakwilǝ, ba nyang ma talenti esu, mi naana ama cǝ esu yende kangza.’<verse eid="MAT 25:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 25:21" />“Na ateakwilǝ beka wai ana, ‘Kondo ogole, ozara edang, o dera araaburu. Ba eza edang aza epa e baate, eyang ote o aza epa ecake. Deya ka o cikǝ o kone oleba kaa ateakwilǝ o.<verse eid="MAT 25:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 25:22" />“Na ondooka wa embe ma talenti ma leere wa paka, na wa bekaana, ‘Ateakwilǝ, ba nyang ma talenti ma leere, a maana aa ma cǝ ma leere aa zame.’<verse eid="MAT 25:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 25:23" />“Na ateakwilǝ bekaa wai na ‘Kondo ogole, ozara edang, odera araaburu. Ba ya edang aza epa a baate. Eyang ote aza epa cake. Deya ka o cikǝ o kone oleba kaa ateakwilǝ o.’<verse eid="MAT 25:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 25:24" />“Wai kangza kawa emba o talenti o yende name, nawa paka, nawa bekaana, ‘Ateakwilǝ, ang rose obena bo oromo oka wata eza eceya ka aromo ne, o yeme o senda a ara aka boa ota ba kweene ne, bo ondo o yeme epa eka ota ba zitǝ a zamea ne.’ <verse eid="MAT 25:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 25:25" />Waya na ma kona boome, na ma ale nama kawa le'o a deze namaa baasa o talenti ooka ba nyang. Na opa owaa waana!’<verse eid="MAT 25:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 25:26" />“Na ateakwilǝ kabare wai na, ‘Bo, ozara araaburu, ondo be nau! Orose bena ang shende ara aka mia ta ma kweene ne, aa mi ondo o yeme epa eka anta maa zitǝ azame ne na?’ <verse eid="MAT 25:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 25:27" />Wa gwara eeya ba eke o talenti ong ara le'eke ka ma deya ang emba opa ong ka eyapa aza me!<verse eid="MAT 25:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 25:28" />“Azaa nyimi, emba na o talenti onname a tara te wai, ka e nya ondo betuuru onname. <verse eid="MAT 25:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 25:29" />Pate ondooka waya ka epa, ayo wala wai, ka e wala gongha. Ondooka wata ka e ne kangza, kapa kaa baate kamea wa zene, ayo emba a wai. <verse eid="MAT 25:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 25:30" />Tare na ozara odera edang oona a nyimi maring maa bitibiti. Arakanamea wayo ruuzi ka onongza tuuni.<verse eid="MAT 25:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">O core angmǝ azaa aworme</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 25:31" />“Awereaka Kena ko Oromo ya deya nyimi togomo te kai ka pate atoma o dera lepung, awere namea kayo cikǝ a ledǝndǝ le togomo te kai.” <verse eid="MAT 25:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 25:32" />Ayo kurki pate aromo lerambo aa begeshe be kai, ayo kang arsaza ne, nangka ana otare ka emande zauze emande epeng aa nyimia ee bo. <verse eid="MAT 25:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 25:33" />Ka yo eke emande epeng o ara ore o kai, aa emande ee bo o ara oguri kai.<verse eid="MAT 25:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 25:34" />Awerenamea, Ogomo ya bekaa andaaka yo ara ore owai, ‘Deya na, ying ka Ate ang a eke taara azaa oying, emba na togomo teeka Ashili a eke ying ka o rabo obora lerambo.’ <verse eid="MAT 25:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 25:35" />Oo bena ma kone ekomo, na e nyang epaolya. Ma kone lewe, na e nyang manyi nang se. Ma deya legeng, na e nyang ara ojǝpi akwilǝ ying. <verse eid="MAT 25:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 25:36" />Ma ye ngmata, na e ambang madibi. Ma kono na e sooleng. A pateng akwilǝ andaleme, na e de aa laka ong.<verse eid="MAT 25:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 25:37" />“Awerenamea andaa sangsang a begeshe be Ashili yo kabare ko bekaana, ‘Ateokora, ngmǝyamea te lakau ka ekomo na te nyau epaolya, na ngmǝyamea te lakau a kona lewe na te nyau manyi ma o sa?’ <verse eid="MAT 25:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 25:38" />Kangza ngmǝyamea te lakau ogeng na te nyau ara ujǝpi, koona ngmǝyamea te lakau ngmata nate ambau madibi? <verse eid="MAT 25:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 25:39" />Ngmǝyamea te lakau a ota zake ne, koona aa pate akwilǝ andaleme, na te de aa laka o?<verse eid="MAT 25:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 25:40" />“Ogomo ome yo kabare nee na, ‘Ang dongdong bele oying, pate epa e erere eka e eza arone ang ana, ka o kala aa be baate, aa ee ezangngha.’<verse eid="MAT 25:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 25:41" />A werenamea wayo bekaa andaaka ne yo o ara oguri na, ‘Arnanna kaa mi, andaamea neya enda ogǝzǝ Ashili, lyǝ na ola ooka wata lambu ne kaa babare ogomo obere oburu kaa atoma wai.’ <verse eid="MAT 25:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 25:42" />Ka ma kona ekomo, eta e nyang epaolya ne. Ma kona lewe, eta e nyang manyi ma o sa ne. <verse eid="MAT 25:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 25:43" />Ma ya legeng, eta e nyang ara ujǝpi ne. Ma ye ngmata, na eta ambang madibi ne. Ma kono, a pateng akwilǝ andaleme, na eta e balang ne.<verse eid="MAT 25:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 25:44" />“Awerenamea neema neyo kabare na, ‘Ateokora, ngmǝyamea te lakau ka ekomo, koona ka lewe, na aa legeng, na ngmata, koona oya kono, koona oyaa akwilǝ andaleme, na teta balau ne?’<verse eid="MAT 25:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 25:45" />“Wayo kabare nee na, ‘Ang dongdong bele oying, nangka eta e eze ka yende aa nyimi andaa batebate aana nyimi ying ne, mia eta e ezanne.’<verse eid="MAT 25:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 25:46" />“Andaana ya lyǝ ozitǝ o dera omaro, aa andaa sangsang a begeshe be Ashili neya yo lyǝ a ebeene o dera o maro.”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25:46 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 12:2">Dan 12:2</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="MAT 25:46" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 25" />
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="MAT 26" />
  <para style="s">O gwaara kpwai o wongha Yeso</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:12">Mar 14:12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:1-2">Luk 22:1-2</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 11:45-53">Yoh 11:45-53</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 26:1" />Nangka Yeso ka mare o beya apate epaname, na ka bekaa atoma akai ana, <verse eid="MAT 26:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 26:2" />“Erose na Ozǝnggǝ Ocakate tata kaa amora aleerea, ayo kang nya Kena ka oromo ka gendare kai a uti.”<verse eid="MAT 26:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 26:3" />Na andaamoole magame ma Akwilǝ Ashili kaa andaano aromo ne gwarnang akwilǝ ondo ogong o magame ma Akwilǝ Ashili, ka aa rare wai na Kayafa. <verse eid="MAT 26:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 26:4" />Na ne tere nangka neya moke a Yeso asuk ka ne wong kai. <verse eid="MAT 26:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 26:5" />Aa ne bekaana, ‘‘Wato gwara awere ozǝnggǝ me ne, adorana tana aromo ne ara o kara ne.”<verse eid="MAT 26:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">A kare Yeso manau ma o waze o lebo aa Betanya</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:3-9">Mar 14:3-9</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 7:37-38">Luk 7:37-38</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:1-8">Yoh 12:1-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 26:6" />Aa, Yeso kaya apeng a Betanya akwilǝ Siman, ondooka samba waye ka legangca, <verse eid="MAT 26:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 26:7" />na kandaaye ka yende de ara Yeso ka kagwi ka a eze kai kaa acale onis aa ka pena ka manau ma owaze olebo ma emate ecake. Awere aaka kaya lya epaolya naka kare kai manau mame ukpwei.<verse eid="MAT 26:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 26:8" />Nangka atoma kai ne laka nyimi, na ne kone oburǝ aane bekaa tukpwei tone na, “Onna ocara emate wai!” <verse eid="MAT 26:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 26:9" />“Ayya aa lisǝ manau maana, aa yo ci emate acake ka nya ana odera.”<verse eid="MAT 26:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 26:10" />Aa nangka Yeso ka rose epa eka neya beyame, na ka bekaa nee na, “Eyaka eya gera kandaye kaana? Enna, epa ererea kaya eza ong. <verse eid="MAT 26:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 26:11" />Ana o dera neye legwa kaa ying koonang were, aa koonag werea anto ya legwa kaa ying ne. <verse eid="MAT 26:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 26:12" />Okare manau maana aa kaa ezang, kaya goro ongngha o matasakong mang. <verse eid="MAT 26:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 26:13" />Ang dongdong ya baale oying, pate ara aka ayo baala orooka olebo ona aa lerambo aa pate, ayo beya orooka azaa epa eeka kandaye kaana kaya ka rintǝ ka kai.”<verse eid="MAT 26:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yahuda wa kabare awa nya Yeso</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:10-11">Mar 14:10-11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:3-6">Luk 22:3-6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 26:14" />Na ondo a nyimi atoma Yeso lekuri, ka a beya wai ana Yahuda Iskariyoti, wa ale andaamoole magame ma Akwilǝ Ashili, <verse eid="MAT 26:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 26:15" />na wa pirkǝ nee na, “Eya nya ong eya maa nya ying kai?” Na ne bale o azorpa etuuru taaro, nane nya wai o azorpo etuuru taaro. <verse eid="MAT 26:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 26:16" />O era awere namea wa gere orona ooka wayo nya Yeso.<verse eid="MAT 26:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yeso ka lye epaolya Ozǝngǝ Ocakate kaa atoma kai</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:12-21">Mar 14:12-21</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:7-14">Luk 22:7-14</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:-1-23">21-23</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:21-30">Yoh 13:21-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 26:17" />Nangka lengme le o bora le Ozǝnggǝ Oborode Odera o Yisti, na atoma Yeso de nane pirkǝ kai na, “Aruwǝ me oya yeme a te babarau ara olya epaolya ozǝnggǝ ocakate me?”<verse eid="MAT 26:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 26:18" />Na Yeso kabare nee na, “Ale na aa nyimi peng ara oromo yende ka e bekaa wai na, ‘Ondo obaala wa bekaana awere a kai a amara, kayo lya epaolya Ozǝnggǝ Ocakate a akwilǝ au kaa atoma a kai.’ ” <verse eid="MAT 26:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 26:19" />Na atoma me ne eze akap nangka Yeso ka ote ne, nane kang goro ekeeya azaa Ozǝnggǝ Ocakate me.<verse eid="MAT 26:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 26:20" />Nangka ulyǝlu waye, na Yeso cikǝ a lya epaolya ka atoma kai betuuru ke leere. <verse eid="MAT 26:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 26:21" />Neya nyimia olya epaolya, naka bekaana, “Ang dongdong bele oying, ondo aa nyimi oying wayo naying.”<verse eid="MAT 26:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 26:22" />Na anyong ane caro ajǝng, na komana one bore o pirǝ o kai ayeyende, aane beyaa na, “Anyya, mia na, Ateokora?”<verse eid="MAT 26:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 26:23" />Na Yeso kabare na, “Ondooka waya pasa taara oso yende kaa mi, waiya ya nayi ong. <verse eid="MAT 26:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 26:24" />Kena ka Oromo kayo gbwǝ nangka a wele angmǝ Ashili azaa kai. Pate ka nyimi, ondooka waya nayi Kena ka Oromo wa lyǝ udi! Wa kala o bena mara taa a ngmengha wai ne.”<verse eid="MAT 26:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 26:25" />Na Yahuda ka wa ya nayi kai pirkǝ na, “Ondo obaala, mia na,?’’ Na Yeso kabare wai na, “Bo ma baa beka.”<verse eid="MAT 26:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Olya epaolya Ateokora</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:22-26">Mar 14:22-26</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:14-20">Luk 22:14-20</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 11:23-25">1 Kor 11:23-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 26:26" />Neya za olya epaolya, na Yeso jeka oborode, na ka wore okona oleba Ashili, aa ka nyeskare, na ka nya atoma akai, aa ka bekaana “Emba, ka e lya. Leena lepung lengha le.”<verse eid="MAT 26:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 26:27" />Na ka jeke kaso ka manyi ma o inabi. Malo owore okona oleba Ashili, na ka nya ne aka bekaana, “Sa na aa pate oying. <verse eid="MAT 26:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 26:28" />Obena manna manyau mangngha mai, ma owore opanza okabare otono osau, ka ayo oka aza aromo a cake, ka opisǝ madinǝ mane. <verse eid="MAT 26:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 26:29" />Eyang baala oying, anta kang sa manyi ma o inabi na ne, seena lengme lenname ka teyo sa ma yende ma sau ka ying a togomo te Ate ang.”<verse eid="MAT 26:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 26:30" />Nangka Yeso kaa atoma kai ne beye leera, nane suri, aane ale a oyara o mati ma o Zaitun.<verse eid="MAT 26:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Biturusu yo sangga orosa o Yeso</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:27-31">Mar 14:27-31</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:31-34">Luk 22:31-34</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:36-38">Yoh 13:36-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 26:31" />Na Yeso bekaane na, “Pate oying eyo songha e bayang aa lelyaare leena, azaa epaeka eyo manang, nangka a wele na,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 26:31">“‘Eyang taba ondo otare ka enama,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 26:31">legwa le emande epeng me yo bacakarna.’<verse eid="MAT 26:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 26:32" />Aa malo ara ong malo o gbwǝ, eyang kaana ying a ale a makeke ma Galili.”<verse eid="MAT 26:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 26:33" />Biturusu wa bekaa Yeso, “Pate one ne songha azaa epa eeka eyo manau, mi antang tukǝ songha ne.”<verse eid="MAT 26:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 26:34" />Na Yeso beka wai na, “Ang dongdong bele o, aa lelyaare leena, zongka orunǝ sene, oyo sangga orosa ong ka taaro.”<verse eid="MAT 26:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 26:35" />Na Biturusu bekaa kai na, “Ayaa wongha ong, anto sangga orosa o ne.” Nyimia apate odangare atoma kai ne beke.<verse eid="MAT 26:35" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yeso ka beye angmǝ kaa Ashili aa Gasamani</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:32-42">Mar 14:32-42</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:39-46">Luk 22:39-46</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 26:36" />Malo o nyimia, Yeso kaa atoma kai ne alea ara kaa beya ai na Gasamani. Ara aaka a pilizi ayana o zaitun ne. Naka bekaa atoma kai, “Cikǝ na arakaana, eyang alea sanini kang beye angmǝ kaa Ashili.” <verse eid="MAT 26:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 26:37" />Na ka ale ka Biturusu, a ayana Zebadi aleere, Yakubu kaa Yohana, naka bore o caro anyong kaa o kona o burǝ maleu. <verse eid="MAT 26:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 26:38" />Aaka kang bekaa nee na, “O caro a nyong ka waya lenyong leng wa era aa wa wongngeng. Cikǝna arakaana ee eza le'enda ka mi.”<verse eid="MAT 26:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 26:39" />Nangka ka lya izi a baate, na ka taru ka mayinu a deze, aa ka beye angmǝ kaa Ashili na, “Ate ang, nyimi waayo ya, saareng kaso ka ozitǝ kaana. Pate ka nyimi sang, epa eeka eyang yeme me eya ato yeme ne, soona epa eeka bo oya yeme me.”<verse eid="MAT 26:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 26:40" />Ka o kurǝ ara atoma akai, naka mana ne aa aneya malau, na ka bekaa Biturusu na, “E era eta ama le'enda kaa mi, na awere yende ne na? <verse eid="MAT 26:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 26:41" />Cikǝ na aa le'enda, ee kang beya na angmǝ kaa Ashili adorana tana e rǝzi aa nyimi okedeya ne. Dongdong lenyong lee kabare, aa lepung kangza leya nyana.”<verse eid="MAT 26:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 26:42" />Naka kuri o leere, na ka beye angmǝ kaa Ashili aaka bekaana, “Ate ang, ozitǝ ona waata kala ne seeka ma se wai, a baya aa eze apa eeka bo oya yeme me.”<verse eid="MAT 26:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 26:43" />Nangka ka kang kurǝ, aa ka kang mana ne a malau, azaa obena ayizi ane a pena ka malau. <verse eid="MAT 26:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 26:44" />Naka sukǝ o baya one, na ka kuri aa beya angmǝ kaa Ashili o taaro, na ka tikǝri angmǝ aaka ka be samba.<verse eid="MAT 26:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 26:45" />Na ka kuri ara atoma kai, aaka bekaa nee na, “Etata a malau nanna, eeya teseke na?” Laka na, awere aya, ka ayo nya Kena ka Oromo a taara te ana madinǝ. <verse eid="MAT 26:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 26:46" />Erana ka ale. Laka na, ondo nya ong awaana, wa dukǝ.”<verse eid="MAT 26:46" /></para>
  <para style="s">A meke Yeso</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:40-43">Mar 14:40-43</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:47-53">Luk 22:47-53</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:3-12">Yoh 18:3-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 26:47" />Zongka ka pate o ngmǝ, na Yahuda, oyende a nyimia atoma betuuru kaa leere name, dukǝ ka aromo a cake, ka masagali, ka sebenda. Andaamoole magame ma Akwilǝ Ashilia kaa andaano aromoa ne tongha ne. <verse eid="MAT 26:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 26:48" />Aa ondo o nayi okai wa samba o wore one obena, “Kondo kamea ma beya kai oko ang gambare kai, kaiya karomo kame. Moke na kai.” <verse eid="MAT 26:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MAT 26:49" />Ka o dǝkǝ wai na wa paka a Yeso, aa wa bekaana, “Oya cammo na, Ondobaala!” Aa wa beye kai oko ka o gambare.<verse eid="MAT 26:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="MAT 26:50" />Na Yeso bekaa wai na, “Oja ong, eza epa eka e deya ka bo.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 26:50">Na aromo de na ne meke Yeso, nane monte kai. <verse eid="MAT 26:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="MAT 26:51" />Ka o laka nyimi, na ondo a nyimi andaaka Yeso kaye legwa ka ne sǝǝrǝ osagali na wa lope oto o ozara andoo ogong ona magame ma Ashili.<verse eid="MAT 26:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="MAT 26:52" />Na Yeso bekaa wai na, “Kuriyǝ osagali o a nyimi opano wai. Pate ondooka wa lopa osagali, osagali yo wongha wai. <verse eid="MAT 26:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="MAT 26:53" />Eya gonta na anta ka o bare kang gera okangkama Ate ang, kangza aa saseya a kawa turki legwa le atoma Ashili o dera lepung, kane kala legwa le ana o tesa geza a moole be tuuru ka leere sang? <verse eid="MAT 26:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="MAT 26:54" />Na, a wiinia a ngmǝ Ashili itǝ maganggang aaka a wele, ka aa beyaa na dongdong nyimi mea yo ya?<verse eid="MAT 26:54" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="MAT 26:55" />Awere name, na Yeso beka a aromo me na, “E surǝa ka masagali ka sebenda ka e mokeng na ondo o tǝǝru a aromo na? Koonang lengme ang ciisǝ a akwilǝ Ashili ang baaleze na eta mekeng ne. <verse eid="MAT 26:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="MAT 26:56" />Aa pate a eze nyimia adorana a panza epa eka ana o beya angmǝ ka mawo ma Ashili ne wela.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 26:56">Ka o kona nyimi na pat atoma kai ne song aane baya kai.<verse eid="MAT 26:56" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yeso a begeshe bena anaateandaasau</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:53-65">Mar 14:53-65</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:54-55">Luk 22:54-55</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 22:63-71">63-71</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:13-14">Yoh 18:13-14</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:-1-24">19-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="MAT 26:57" />Na andaaka ne moke Yeso ale ka kai a Keyafa, ondoo gong ana magame ma Ashili, ara aka ana baala a ngmǝ aaka Ashili a nya Mosa kaa andaano ne kurkǝnǝng ne. <verse eid="MAT 26:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="MAT 26:58" />Na Biturusu tarze kai aa macangcang aa alea nyimi akora ondoo ogong magame ma Ashili. Nangka wa lyǝ nawa cikǝ kaa ana le'enda, ka wa laka nangka ayo maare.<verse eid="MAT 26:58" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="MAT 26:59" />Na andaamoole magame ma Ashili kaa anatendaasau, pate one nane gere angmǝ majǝkǝri kaa ayo eza Yeso adorana ne cǝ orona o wongha kai. <verse eid="MAT 26:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="MAT 26:60" />Pate kaa nyimi na ne ta cǝ ne, o bekaana aromo a cake ne ya beya majǝkǝri azaa kai. Malo me na aromo leere surǝ, <verse eid="MAT 26:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="MAT 26:61" />ne bekaa na, “Karomo oona wa bekaana, ‘Wa era wa oke akwilǝ Ashili ana, aa wa sowa ai a nyimi tomore te taaro.’ ”<verse eid="MAT 26:61" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="MAT 26:62" />Na ondo gong magame ma Ashili ere aa itǝ na wa bekana, “Ota ke epa o beka ne na? Epa ena aa neya beyaa na ba beke pa?” <verse eid="MAT 26:62" /><verse number="63" style="v" sid="MAT 26:63" />Na Yeso sokong kome. Na ondo o gong magame ma Ashili beka a kai na, “Ma gwarau ka Ashili aka ya ka ebeene, bele ro, ‘Boa Almasipu, Kena ka Ashili.”<verse eid="MAT 26:63" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="64" style="v" sid="MAT 26:64" />Na Yeso bekaa wai na, “Nangka ba beka. Aa eyang bele ying, ba ale a izi, eya laka Kena ka Oromo a cikǝ o ara oree Ondo Keeya, aa ka kang deya aza mawere.”<verse eid="MAT 26:64" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="65" style="v" sid="MAT 26:65" />Na ondo o gong magame ma Ashili daara madibi ma wai azaa o caro a nyong, aa wa bekaana, “Ka sopa! Eya teya gerame kangza? Ee kona o sopa ooka kaya.<verse eid="MAT 26:65" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="MAT 26:66" />Eya madoola maying?</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 26:66">Nane kabare na, “Ka gwara a wong kai.”<verse eid="MAT 26:66" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="67" style="v" sid="MAT 26:67" />Nane karze kai mawo a mainu, aa ne ola kai, ana ondo kangza nane kpweze kai to maare.<verse eid="MAT 26:67" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="68" style="v" sid="MAT 26:68" />Aane beya ana, “Bele ro epa eka ayo eza aa izi, boa baa ya Almasipu. Mana wa olau?”<verse eid="MAT 26:68" /></para>
  <para style="s">Biturusu wa sangga orosa o Yeso</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:66-72">Mar 14:66-72</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:56-62">Luk 22:56-62</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:15-18">Yoh 18:15-18</ref>,<ref loc="JHN 18:25-27">25-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="69" style="v" sid="MAT 26:69" />Aa Biturusu ya cikǝ o yanga a tatara akwilǝ ogomo, na ka kazara kagala de naka zundǝ wai, aa ka bekaana wai na, “Bo kangza oya legwa ka Yeso ka o Galili!”<verse eid="MAT 26:69" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="70" style="v" sid="MAT 26:70" />Na Biturusu wa sangga a begeshe bene apate, aa wa bekaana, “Mi anta rose epa eka oya beya me ne.”<verse eid="MAT 26:70" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="71" style="v" sid="MAT 26:71" />Nangka wa surǝ aa tatara akwilǝ ogomo, na kazara ka ai yende kangza laka wai, na ka beka andaaka ne ya itǝ arame na, “Oromo na waye legwa ka Yeso ka Nazarat!”<verse eid="MAT 26:71" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="72" style="v" sid="MAT 26:72" />Na wa kang sangga ka otongzo na, “Anta rosa oromo name ne.”<verse eid="MAT 26:72" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="73" style="v" sid="MAT 26:73" />Ka o rabo a baate, na andaaka neya itǝ arame de ane bekaa Biturusu na, “Ma shango tarenene, bo ma oya nyimi one. Obelo angmǝ au, aa pǝro.”<verse eid="MAT 26:73" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="74" style="v" sid="MAT 26:74" />Na wa bora angmǝ aburu aza ukpwei wai, aa wa tongzo, aa wa beyaana, “Anta rosa oromo me ne!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 26:74">Awerename na urunǝ sene. <verse eid="MAT 26:74" /><verse number="75" style="v" sid="MAT 26:75" />Na Biturusu rintǝ angmǝ a Yeso na, “Zongka orunǝ sene, oyo sangga orosa ong ka taaro.” Na wa surǝ o yanga na wa ruzii a maleo.<verse eid="MAT 26:75" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 26" />
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="MAT 27" />
  <para style="s">Yeso aa begeshe be ogomo Bilatus</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 15:1">Mar 15:1</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:1-2">Luk 23:1-2</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:28-32">Yoh 18:28-32</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 27:1" />Nangka ara asane, na pate andaamoole magame Ashili kaa andaano aromo gwaara angmǝ azaa nangka neya wongha Yeso.<verse eid="MAT 27:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 27:2" />Nane tere kai, aane ale ka kai aa begeshe be Ogomo Bilatus.<verse eid="MAT 27:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ogbwǝ o Yahuda</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="ACT 1:18-20">Ogat 1:18-20</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 27:3" />Awere aka Yahuda ooka wa nayi kai wa laka aa core Yeso angmǝ wongha, na wa kone oburǝ, nawa kuri ara andaamoole magame ma Ashili kaa andaano, nawa kuriyǝ ne ma azorpa tuuru taaro name. <verse eid="MAT 27:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 27:4" />Awa bekaana, “Ma ya madinǝ ka ma nya ondooka wata tambo ne ka wongha kai.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 27:4">Nane bekaana, “Eya manyi maro? Onna a owa wai.”<verse eid="MAT 27:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 27:5" />Na Yahuda me bacakare o azorpa me a akwilǝ Ashili, na wa suri, na wa ale aa wa ye lesara.<verse eid="MAT 27:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 27:6" />Azaa nyimi na andaamoole magame Ashili ne shende emate me aa ne bekaana, “Wata gwara aa eke emate eena e a lebengga le akwilǝ Ashili ne, obena emate me e manyau e.” <verse eid="MAT 27:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 27:7" />Azaa nyimi na ne nya tukpwei madoola na, ne embe adeze a ondo sowa madaka ka emate me ka a itǝ adeze o taasa a ageng. <verse eid="MAT 27:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 27:8" />Nyimia wa ote, a deya o ngmeengme a rareze arame na ugiishi manyau. <verse eid="MAT 27:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 27:9" />Azaa nyimia a panza angmǝ a Ondo o beya angmǝ ka mawo ma Ashili Irimiya ka wa beke na, “Ne jeke emate tuuru taaro, emate eeka aromo a Isrela ne kabare na are azaa kai naname,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ZEC 11:12-13">Zak 11:12-13</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="MAT 27:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 27:10" />nane embe adeze ondo o sooza madaka ka e, nangka Ateokora ka oteng.”<verse eid="MAT 27:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bilatus wa eze Yeso be pirǝ</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 15:2-5">Mar 15:2-5</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:3-5">Luk 23:3-5</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:33-38">Yoh 18:33-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 27:11" />Na Yeso itǝ a begeshe be ondo togomo, na ondo togomo teme kang pirkǝ kai na, “Boo na, boa Ogomo maYahuda na?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 27:11">Yeso ka kabare na, “Nangka baa beka.”<verse eid="MAT 27:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 27:12" />Nangka ne andaamoole magame ma Ashili kaa andaano ne beye kai majǝkǝri, naka ta beke eyapa ne. <verse eid="MAT 27:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 27:13" />Na Bilatus bekaa akai na, “Ota ba kona e pate epa eena ane beyau majǝkǝri azame ne?” <verse eid="MAT 27:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 27:14" />Na Yeso ta ka kabare na be pirǝ be yende ne, na nyimi tere ogomo ukpwei aa bote.<verse eid="MAT 27:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">A core Yeso o gǝǝzǝ o gbwǝ</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 15:6-15">Mar 15:6-15</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:13-25">Luk 23:13-25</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:39-19:16">Yoh 18:39-19:16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 27:15" />Koonang awere Ozǝnggǝ Ocakate, ondo togomo wa mena aa peere oromo yende aa nyimia andaaka a pate a akwilǝ andaleme, ooka aromo ne zaka. <verse eid="MAT 27:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 27:16" />Awere name, ondo zene a akwilǝ andaleme ka a rose wai ka ogirǝ, ka a beya wai na Barabas. <verse eid="MAT 27:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 27:17" />Nangka maYahuda ne kurkǝnǝng, na Bilatus pirkǝ nee na, “Mana eya yeme ang pere ying wai? Barabas naa, na Yeso kamea arareze kai na Almasipu?” <verse eid="MAT 27:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 27:18" />Obena wa rose na le'ero le ote nane turki Yeso awai.<verse eid="MAT 27:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 27:19" />Bangka nyimi kangza, awere aka wa ya cikǝ a ledǝndǝ le cora angmǝ, ondaye wai wa tong na abele wai na, “Karomo kana ta kaa ya eyapa ne. Sǝǝrǝ taara to orooka karomo kaana obena ma zitǝ a tolau kaya kai.”<verse eid="MAT 27:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 27:20" />Andaamoole magame ma Ashili kaa andaano ne tarze aromo aa ne baale ne na ne zaka Barabas ka ne cǝ kane wong Yeso.<verse eid="MAT 27:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 27:21" />Na ogomo me kang pirkǝ aromo me na, “A nyimi aromo leere aana, mana eya yeme ang pere ying wai?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 27:21">Na ne bekaana, “Barabas.”<verse eid="MAT 27:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 27:22" />Na Bilatus bekaa na, “Na ang wiinia ka Yeso ka rareze kai na Almasipu?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 27:22">Na pate one kabare na “A gendare kai a uti!”<verse eid="MAT 27:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 27:23" />Na Bilatus pirkǝ ne, “Azaa eya? Ombela araaburu ka eza?” Na ne waale o ara angmelo na, “A gendare kai a uti.”<verse eid="MAT 27:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 27:24" />Nangka Bilatus wa laka wa era wata ya eyapa ne, kangza a nyong aromo ya waale o caro, na wa mangka manyi na wa kwizǝ taara tewai aa aromo ya gonta, aa wa bekaana, “Mi, ma kwizǝ a taara teng aa manyau ma karomo ka o dera madinǝ kaana. Onna zitǝ oying wai.”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 21:6-9">Otik 21:6-9</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="MAT 27:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 27:25" />Na pate aromo me kabare na, “Baya ozitǝ ome itǝ azaa aro kaa ayana aro.”<verse eid="MAT 27:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 27:26" />Awere namea wa pere ne Barabas. Malo oka wa ote na ole Yeso, aa wa nayi kai ka gendare.<verse eid="MAT 27:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ana o tesa a geza a moole ne zeele Yeso</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 15:16-20">Mar 15:16-20</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:2-3">Yoh 19:2-3</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 27:27" />Na ana otesa ageza aa moole o ogomo ale ka Yeso a akwilǝ togomo, nane kurki pate legwa le ana otesa ageza a moole o makeke mame azaa kai. <verse eid="MAT 27:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 27:28" />Na ne lope madibi maaka maya lepung le kai, aa ne amba kai odibi o ganggo o togomo. <verse eid="MAT 27:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 27:29" />Na ne pi betageya be ekana, aa ne amba kai ukpwei, aa ne nya kai lebenda le yende o ara ore o kai, na ne kang tungunu a begeshe be kai aa ne zeele kai, aa ne beyaana kai na, “Ashili waloo ne, Ogomo maYahuda!” <verse eid="MAT 27:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 27:30" />Aa ne karze kai mawo, nane jeke lebenda lenname nane ola kai kaa le o ukpwei. <verse eid="MAT 27:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 27:31" />Nangka ne mare o zeela kai, nane lope kai odibi o togomo te me, aa kuriyǝ kai madibi maaka maya kai a lepung, nane ale ka kai ka ne gendare uti.<verse eid="MAT 27:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">A gendare Yeso</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 15:21-32">Mar 15:21-32</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:26-43">Luk 23:26-43</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:17-27">Yoh 19:17-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 27:32" />Ne ya teweno naname, nane gwarnang ka Saminu, oromo a Siyarin. Waya ne ote nawa ana uti o gendare a Yeso. <verse eid="MAT 27:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 27:33" />Nangka ne dukǝ ara aka arareze ai na Golgota, araaka a rose ai na ara o cako ukpwei, <verse eid="MAT 27:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 27:34" />nane nya kai manyi ma inabi maaka a sakale ka ka o ngmangmang ka ka se. Nangka ka lembe ka leleng, naka nyana o sa me.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27:34 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 69:21">Sel 69:21</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="MAT 27:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 27:35" />Malo o gendare a Yeso, nane eze o zawa azaa madibi ma kai kane laka mana yo jeka odibi me.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27:35 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 22:18">Sel 22:18</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="MAT 27:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 27:36" />Malo nyimi nane cikǝ arame aa le'enda le kai. <verse eid="MAT 27:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 27:37" />A aza uti me, aza kaa ukpwei o kai, nane wele aa kati ka patarake ka yende na, “KANNAA YESO, OGOMO MAYAHUDA.” <verse eid="MAT 27:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 27:38" />Nane kang gendare kai legwa kaa akǝri o tǝǝru aromo a leere, oyende o ara ore, aa o yende o ara uguri kai. <verse eid="MAT 27:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 27:39" />Ana o kaale ne ne zeele kai, aa ne zuu ukpwei, <verse eid="MAT 27:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 27:40" />aa ne beyaana, “Bo ka baa bekaana, ba era o oka akwilǝ Ashili, oo kang sowa ai a nyimi amora taaro, na boza o ukpwei o! Na bo Kena ka Ashili baaza, jipi a uti ogendare me!” <verse eid="MAT 27:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 27:41" />Nyimia kangza andaamoole magame ma Ashili ka ana o baala angmǝ aaka Ashili a nya Mosa ka andaano aromo ne zeele kai, aa ne beyaana, <verse eid="MAT 27:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 27:42" />“Ka boza ana ondo, aa ka girǝ o boza ukpwei kai. Kai ya Ogomo Isrela sang? Kaa jipi a uti ogendare na nannameena, awere namea te yo kabare ka kai. <verse eid="MAT 27:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 27:43" />Ka eke lenyong a Ashili, baya a Ashili me boza kai nanname, aaya yeme a kai, obena ka bekaana kai Kena ka Ashilia kai.”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27:43 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 22:9">Sel 22:9</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="MAT 27:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 27:44" />Pate a akǝri o tǝǝru a aromo ka a gendare ne ka Yeso ne beya akai angmǝ a aburu.<verse eid="MAT 27:44" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ogbwǝ o Yeso</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 15:33-41">Mar 15:33-41</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:44-49">Luk 23:44-49</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:28-30">Yoh 19:28-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 27:45" />Na maring meke pate makeke mame aa era o tera ongme aa dukǝ beru be o taaro ulyǝlu. <verse eid="MAT 27:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 27:46" />Nangka ongme wa amara ka otaru, na Yeso ara lengmelo ajǝng, na ka bekaana, “Eloi, Eloi, lama sabatani?” Obena, “Ashili ang, Ashili ang, eyaaka ba nyang o malo?”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27:46 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 22:1">Sel 22:1</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="MAT 27:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 27:47" />Aromo aa ka neya itǝ a ting arame ne kone nyimi na ne bekaana, “Karomo kaana kaya orara Ileya!”<verse eid="MAT 27:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 27:48" />Na ondo a nyimi one song nawa jeke lesuni nawa tǝkǝzǝ a manyi ma marara, nawa ote a lebenda, aa wa nayi Yeso na ka se.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27:48 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 69:21">Sel 69:21</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="MAT 27:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MAT 27:49" />Azaa nyimi odangare me bekaana, “Bayana te laka na Ileya yo deya kawa boza kai.”<verse eid="MAT 27:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="MAT 27:50" />Na Yeso kang ara lengmelo a jǝng, aa ka pere ebeene e kai.<verse eid="MAT 27:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="MAT 27:51" />Nyimia oyambati ka waya a akwilǝ Ashili wa daro a tera madǝkǝni ma leere, o era obora aaza a jǝpi dizi. Na adeze a zukǝru, aa acale poso. <verse eid="MAT 27:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="MAT 27:52" />A pǝǝri macao, andaaka ne gbwizǝ kaa ne ye ka boome be Ashili, ne ere ka ebeene, <verse eid="MAT 27:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="MAT 27:53" />aa komana one susi a ocao o wai. Malo o era Yeso, nane lyǝ a nyimi apeng aa sangsang, aromo acake ne laka ne.<verse eid="MAT 27:53" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="MAT 27:54" />Awere aka ondo gong ana otesa geza o Roma, kaa andaaka neya legwa aa enda Yeso ne laka adeze a zukǝrnu kaa pate epa eka ne laka, na pate one kone boome maleo, aa ne bekaana, “Kanna dongdong Kena ka Ashilia kai!”<verse eid="MAT 27:54" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="MAT 27:55" />Andaye yende acake ka ne tare Yeso aa surǝ aa Galili aane kangkama kai, ne itǝ aa macang a gontaka pate epa eka eya ale. <verse eid="MAT 27:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="MAT 27:56" />Aa nyimi one neye, Mariya ka o Magadala, kaa Mariya iini na Yakubu ka Yusupu, aa iini ayana Zabadi kangza.<verse eid="MAT 27:56" /></para>
  <para style="s">O taasa o Yeso</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 15:42-47">Mar 15:42-47</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:50-56">Luk 23:50-56</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:38-42">Yoh 19:38-42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="MAT 27:57" />Nangka o ulyǝlu waye, na Yusupu, oromo o Arimatiya ka waya ka o cǝ, wai kangza ondo o tare Yeso waze. <verse eid="MAT 27:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="MAT 27:58" />Nawa ale aa Bilatus nawa bose na nya wai lepung le Yeso. Na Bilatus ote na nya wai. <verse eid="MAT 27:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="MAT 27:59" />Yusupu wa jeke lepung leme, nawa pate le ka betu, <verse eid="MAT 27:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="MAT 27:60" />aa wa lyǝǝrǝ lepung leme a nyimi ocau osau oka wa she eke ukpwei wai ka wa kau a lecale. Nawa turki lecale legong leyende nawa pate begmǝ be ocau me, aa wa ale. <verse eid="MAT 27:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="MAT 27:61" />Mariya ka o Magadala, kaa Mariya kayende, ne ya zaa ocikǝ a izi ocau me.<verse eid="MAT 27:61" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ana le'enda ocau</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="MAT 27:62" />Ka o sana ara, malo Lengme le Ogoro, na andaamoole magame ma Ashili kaa maParisa gwarnang a begeshe be Bilatus, <verse eid="MAT 27:62" /><verse number="63" style="v" sid="MAT 27:63" />nane bekaana, “Ogomo, te rintǝ nangka karomo kaaname ka o rendaza aa ka tata a bengma ka beeze na malo tomore to taaro kayo era ka ebeene. <verse eid="MAT 27:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="MAT 27:64" />Azaa nyimi, ote ka eza le'enda ocau me maleo aa dukǝ tomore te taaro, tana atoma akai de kane kpwi ekeze kai aa ne bekaa aromo na ka era malo ogbwǝ ne. Orenda o maare wayo kala obora o buru.”<verse eid="MAT 27:64" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="65" style="v" sid="MAT 27:65" />Na Bilatus bekaa nee na, “Besa na ana otesa geza aa moole, ka e ale kaa e eze le'enda nangka wa gwara.” <verse eid="MAT 27:65" /><verse number="66" style="v" sid="MAT 27:66" />Nane ale nane ende ocau ome, aa ne ote bewela becapa be ogomo, aa ne baya ana otesa geza me aa le'enda.<verse eid="MAT 27:66" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 27" />
  <chapter number="28" style="c" sid="MAT 28" />
  <para style="s">O era o Yeso a nyimi ocau</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 16:1-8">Mar 16:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:1-12">Luk 24:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:1-10">Yoh 20:1-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 28:1" />Malo Lengme le Oteseke lee kala, aa lelere lengme le obora, na Mariya ka o Magadala, kaa Mariya kayende, ne ale a olaka ocau me.<verse eid="MAT 28:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 28:2" />Na adeze zukǝrnu a jǝng o otoma Ashili o dera lepung wa sura a zaa shili nawa kinkǝri o cale me aa wa cikǝ aaza me. <verse eid="MAT 28:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 28:3" />Waya masanto na o malmi, aa madibi ma wai maya apeng aa pauwo na adoka. <verse eid="MAT 28:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 28:4" />Nangka ana le'enda ne laka wai, na boome moke ne maleo, nane kerkeze aa ne tǝǝru aa deze naa nee gbwizǝ.<verse eid="MAT 28:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 28:5" />Aa otoma Ashili o dera lepung leme wa bekaa andaaye me na, “Tana e kona boome ne, ang rose obena Yeso kamea a gendare kaya eya gerame. <verse eid="MAT 28:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 28:6" />Kata rene ne. Ka era nangka ka beke. Deyana ke laka ara aka a eke kai. <verse eid="MAT 28:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 28:7" />Alena a saseya ka e bekaa otoma akai na, obena ka era malo ogbwǝ. Akaname aa ka yo kang kaana oying o ale a makeke ma Galili. Aa sanamea eyo laka kai! Epa eeka ma deya aa bele oying naname.”<verse eid="MAT 28:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 28:8" />Nane baya ocau ome a kwarte a nyimi boome, ka okona oleba aa cake, nane song nane bele atoma akai oroka ome. <verse eid="MAT 28:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 28:9" />Na Yeso ka o upkwai kai gwarnang ka ne, naka bekaa nee na, “O cikǝ o cammo itǝ ka ying!” Nane paka aa ma'amo aa ne garme tobona te kai, nane girwǝ a begeshe be kai. <verse eid="MAT 28:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 28:10" />Na Yeso bekaane na, “Tane kona boome ne, alena ka e bekaa arone ang, ane ale aa makeke ma Galili, asanamea ne yo lakang.”<verse eid="MAT 28:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Orooka ooka ana o enda ocau ne de ne</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 28:11" />Nangka andaaye me neya nyimi teweno, na ana ondo aa nyimi ana o enda ocau me, nane bele andaamoole ana magame ma Ashili orooka o pate epa eka ee ale. <verse eid="MAT 28:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 28:12" />Na andaamoole magame ma Ashili kaa andaano ne kurkǝnǝng, nane tere madoola ma yende, nane nya ana otesa geza aa moole me emate aa cak, <verse eid="MAT 28:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 28:13" />aa ne bekaane na, “Bele na aromo na, atoma kai ya ne deya aa lelyaare aa teya malau nane kpwi kai. <verse eid="MAT 28:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 28:14" />Orooka ona wa dukǝ teto te ogomo, teyo nya wai angmǝ te kang itǝ ka ying aa nyimia pate o zitǝ.” <verse eid="MAT 28:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 28:15" />Nane embe emate me, nane ye epa eka a bekaa nee na ne eze. Orooka ona wa ale kurǝwa a maYahuda aa deya o ngmeengme.<verse eid="MAT 28:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ogole ka Yeso ka nya atoma kai</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 16:14-18">Mar 16:14-18</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:36-49">Luk 24:36-49</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:19-23">Yoh 20:19-23</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 28:16" />Na atoma akai be tuuru kaa leyende name ale a makeke ma Galili, a oyara ooka Yeso ka bekaa ne na ne gwarnang arame. <verse eid="MAT 28:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 28:17" />Nangka ne laka kai, na ne girwǝ aa ne sabe kai, aa na ondo ne dambaraza. <verse eid="MAT 28:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 28:18" />Na Yeso paka na ka bekaa nee na, “A nyang pate obare azaa shili ka adeze.” <verse eid="MAT 28:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 28:19" />Azaa nyimi, ale na ka e baale pate aromo lerambo ka ne tareng, e eza ne batisma a nyimi le ze Ate, ka Kena, ka Obere o Ashili, <verse eid="MAT 28:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 28:20" />e baala ne kane tare pate epaeka ma ote ying. Mi naana kangza ang ye legwa ka ying aa ale ka ying o omaare lerambo.<verse eid="MAT 28:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 28" />
</usx>